>• Faster system boot times compared with traditional HDD storage</span><br><span>• Faster application loading</span><br><span>• Improved overall PC responsiveness</span><br><span>• Great for Windows installation</span><br><span>• Ideal for budget PC upgrades</span><br><span>• Suitable for office and home systems</span><br><span>• Cost-effective storage solution</span><br><span>• Used / System Pulled</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Product:</span></strong><span> Solid State Drive</span><br><strong><span>Capacity:</span></strong><span> 128GB</span><br><strong><span>Storage Type:</span></strong><span> SSD</span><br><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> May vary according to stock</span><br><strong><span>Interface:</span></strong><span> Depends on available stock</span><br><strong><span>Condition:</span></strong><span> Used / System Pulled</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Windows Drive, Office PC, Home PC, Gaming PC &amp; System Upgrade</span></p>\n<h2><span>Condition</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>USED – SYSTEM PULLED</span></strong></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>This SSD has been removed from a previously assembled system and is </span><strong><span>not being advertised as brand-new retail storage</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Brand, model, interface, form factor, appearance and performance may vary according to available stock.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>If you require a specific brand, SATA/M.2 interface or form factor, please confirm availability before ordering.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Why Upgrade to an SSD?</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Upgrading an older PC from a mechanical hard drive to an SSD is one of the most effective ways to improve everyday responsiveness.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>An SSD can provide:</span><br><span>• Faster Windows startup</span><br><span>• Quicker application loading</span><br><span>• Improved file access</span><br><span>• More responsive everyday computing</span><br><span>• Silent operation with no moving mechanical parts</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Please confirm the </span><strong><span>SSD interface and your system compatibility</span></strong><span> before ordering.</span></p>\n<p><span>If you require a specific </span><strong><span>2.5-inch SATA, M.2 SATA or NVMe SSD</span></strong><span>, confirm the exact available stock before purchase.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),4000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/2079009-a.webpkryygaekwygf.webp?v=1786225764','https://sakoonsay.com/products/128gb-ssd-used-system-pulled-pc-storage-drive.js','storage',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:16');
