>\n</li>\n</ul>','\n',char(10)),140000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/THUNDER-JASPER-RGB-GAMiNG-CASE-TGC-627-ATX-WiTH-3X-ARGB-FAN-2.jpg?v=1741206279','https://sakoonsay.com/products/130k-budget-gaming-pc-build-ryzen-5-3600-rtx-2060.js','Gaming PC',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:29');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(4,'8209098375221','16gb-ddr4-2133-2400mhz-desktop-ram-used-system-pulled','16GB DDR4 2133/2400MHz Desktop RAM – Used System Pulled | Price in Pakistan',replace('<h2>16GB DDR4 2133/2400MHz Desktop RAM in Pakistan</h2>\n<p>Upgrade a compatible desktop PC with <strong>16GB DDR4 RAM</strong> for smoother gaming, multitasking, office work, browsing and productivity. This is used/system-pulled desktop memory offered at an affordable upgrade price.</p>\n\n<h2>Product Highlights</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Capacity:</strong> 16GB</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Memory type:</strong> DDR4</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Speed:</strong> 2133MHz or 2400MHz, depending on the available module</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Form factor:</strong> Desktop DIMM</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Condition:</strong> Used / system pulled</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Current price:</strong> Rs. 19,000</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Compatibility</h2>\n<p>Your motherboard and processor must support DDR4 desktop memory. DDR4 is not compatible with DDR3 or DDR5 slots. Confirm the motherboard model, supported capacity and memory speed before ordering.</p>\n\n<h2>Gaming and Multitasking</h2>\n<p>16GB RAM provides useful headroom for modern games, browser tabs, Discord, office applications and everyday multitasking. A matched dual-channel setup may provide better memory bandwidth where supported by the motherboard.</p>\n\n<h2>Condition and Stock Note</h2>\n<p>This is <strong>used system-pulled RAM</strong>, not brand-new retail memory. Brand, model, PCB appearance, timings, heatsink design and exact speed may vary according to available stock. If you need a specific brand or frequency, please confirm availability before ordering.</p>\n\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<h3>Is this RAM compatible with DDR3?</h3>\n<p>No. DDR3 and DDR4 use different slots and are not interchangeable.</p>\n<h3>Is this RAM new?</h3>\n<p>No. It is listed as used/system pulled memory.</p>\n<h3>Will a 2400MHz module always run at 2400MHz?</h3>\n<p>Not necessarily. Actual operating speed depends on the memory module, motherboard, processor and BIOS settings.</p>','\n',char(10)),19000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/16GB-DDR4-RAM-21332400Mhz-SYSTEM-PULLED-USED-2.jpg?v=1786225232','https://sakoonsay.com/products/16gb-ddr4-2133-2400mhz-desktop-ram-used-system-pulled.js','Ram',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:20');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(5,'8209123934261','1tb-hdd-used-system-pulled-desktop-pc-hard-drive','1TB HDD – Used System Pulled Desktop PC Hard Drive',replace('<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Expand your PC storage with a </span><strong><span>1TB Hard Disk Drive (HDD)</span></strong><span>. This </span><strong><span>used system-pulled desktop hard drive</span></strong><span> provides plenty of affordable storage for games, videos, documents, backups and everyday files.</span></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Add plenty of affordable storage to your computer with a </span><strong><span>1TB System-Pulled Desktop HDD</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>With </span><strong><span>1TB storage capacity</span></strong><span>, this hard drive provides ample space for documents, photos, videos, games, software, backups and other large files.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>It is an excellent choice for customers who need high-capacity storage without paying the higher cost of an equivalent-capacity SSD.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For gaming and everyday PCs, a particularly effective setup is to use an </span><strong><span>SSD for Windows and frequently used applications</span></strong><span>, while using this </span><strong><span>1TB HDD as secondary mass storage</span></strong><span> for games, media and other files.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>This hard drive is </span><strong><span>USED / SYSTEM PULLED</span></strong><span>, meaning it has been removed from a previously assembled desktop computer rather than being sold as a brand-new retail drive.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Key Features</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• 1TB Storage Capacity</span><br><span>• Desktop Hard Disk Drive (HDD)</span><br><span>• Affordable high-capacity storage</span><br><span>• Great for games and large files</span><br><span>• Ideal for photos, videos and documents</span><br><span>• Suitable for backups and general data storage</span><br><span>• Excellent as a secondary PC drive</span><br><span>• Cost-effective alternative to high-capacity SSD storage</span><br><span>• Used / System Pulled</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Product:</span></strong><span> Desktop Hard Disk Drive</span><br><strong><span>Capacity:</span></strong><span> 1TB</span><br><strong><span>Storage Type:</span></strong><span> HDD</span><br><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> May vary according to available stock</span><br><strong><span>Interface:</span></strong><span> Depends on available stock</span><br><strong><span>RPM:</span></strong><span> May vary according to stock</span><br><strong><span>Cache:</span></strong><span> May vary according to model</span><br><strong><span>Condition:</span></strong><span> Used / System Pulled</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Gaming Storage, Media, Files, Backups &amp; Secondary PC Storage</span></p>\n<h2><span>Condition</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>USED – SYSTEM PULLED</span></strong></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>This hard drive has been removed from a previously assembled desktop computer and is </span><strong><span>not being advertised as a brand-new retail drive</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Brand, model, RPM, cache, cosmetic appearance and exact specifications may vary depending on available stock.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Please confirm availability before ordering if you require a particular brand or specification.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Recommended Gaming PC Setup</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For a better overall PC experience, we recommend combining this </span><strong><span>1TB HDD with an SSD</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Use the </span><strong><span>SSD for Windows and frequently used applications</span></strong><span> to improve system responsiveness, while using the </span><strong><span>1TB HDD for games, media, downloads and larger files</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>This gives budget-conscious customers a practical combination of speed and storage capacity.</span></p>\n<h2><span>HDD vs SSD</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>An HDD provides </span><strong><span>more storage capacity at a lower cost</span></strong><span>, making it ideal for large files and secondary storage.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>However, an SSD is considerably faster for Windows startup, application loading and general system responsiveness.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For customers prioritizing speed, consider a </span><strong><span>512GB or 1TB SSD</span></strong><span> instead.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Please confirm your desktop PC supports the interface used by the available hard drive.</span></p>\n<p><span>Also ensure your PC case has a suitable drive bay and the required power and data connections before installation.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),8000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/sg-1tb.jpg?v=1786226758','https://sakoonsay.com/products/1tb-hdd-used-system-pulled-desktop-pc-hard-drive.js','storage',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:16');
