ail drive.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Performance Highlights</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• 1TB Storage Capacity</span><br><span>• Solid State Drive (SSD)</span><br><span>• Faster boot times compared with traditional HDD storage</span><br><span>• Faster application and game loading</span><br><span>• Improved overall system responsiveness</span><br><span>• Large capacity for Windows, software and games</span><br><span>• Excellent upgrade from 128GB, 256GB or 512GB storage</span><br><span>• Suitable for compatible desktops and laptops</span><br><span>• Great for gaming and productivity systems</span><br><span>• Used / System Pulled</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Product:</span></strong><span> Solid State Drive</span><br><strong><span>Capacity:</span></strong><span> 1TB</span><br><strong><span>Storage Type:</span></strong><span> SSD</span><br><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> May vary according to available stock</span><br><strong><span>Interface:</span></strong><span> Depends on available stock</span><br><strong><span>Form Factor:</span></strong><span> May vary according to stock</span><br><strong><span>Condition:</span></strong><span> Used / System Pulled</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Gaming PC, Office PC, Laptop, Home PC &amp; Storage Upgrade</span></p>\n<h2><span>Condition</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>USED – SYSTEM PULLED</span></strong></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>This SSD has been removed from a previously assembled desktop or laptop computer and is </span><strong><span>not being advertised as a brand-new retail drive</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Brand, model, interface, form factor, cosmetic appearance, drive health and performance specifications may vary according to available stock.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Please confirm availability if you require a specific brand, interface or form factor.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Why Choose a 1TB SSD?</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>A </span><strong><span>1TB SSD</span></strong><span> is an excellent option for users who want both fast storage performance and plenty of usable capacity.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Compared with a traditional HDD, an SSD can provide:</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Faster Windows startup</span><br><span>• Quicker game and application loading</span><br><span>• Faster file access</span><br><span>• Improved overall system responsiveness</span><br><span>• Silent operation with no moving mechanical parts</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>1TB capacity</span></strong><span> also provides significantly more room for modern games, applications and personal files than smaller SSD options.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Please confirm the </span><strong><span>SSD interface and your system compatibility</span></strong><span> before ordering.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Depending on available stock, drives may use different interfaces or form factors, including </span><strong><span>2.5-inch SATA or M.2</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p><span>SATA and M.2 drives are not automatically interchangeable. Please confirm your desktop or laptop specifications before purchasing.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),22000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/Transcend-1TB-SSD-Hard-Drive-Internal-SATA-SSD-1.jpg?v=1786226440','https://sakoonsay.com/products/1tb-ssd-used-system-pulled-desktop-laptop-storage-drive.js','storage',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:16');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(7,'8209441030197','256gb-m-2-ssd-desktop-laptop-pc-storage-drive','256GB M.2 SSD – Desktop & Laptop PC Storage Drive',replace('<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Upgrade your compatible desktop or laptop with a </span><strong><span>256GB M.2 SSD</span></strong><span> for faster boot times, quicker application loading and improved system responsiveness. With more usable space than a 128GB drive, it’s an excellent option for Windows, essential software and everyday storage.</span></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Upgrade your computer with the speed and convenience of a </span><strong><span>256GB M.2 SSD</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>With </span><strong><span>256GB storage capacity</span></strong><span>, this SSD provides a practical balance between performance, capacity and affordability. It offers enough space for Windows, essential applications, documents and selected games while delivering the responsive performance expected from solid-state storage.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The compact </span><strong><span>M.2 form factor</span></strong><span> installs directly into a compatible motherboard or laptop M.2 slot, reducing the need for separate SATA data and power cables where applicable.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>It is an excellent storage option for </span><strong><span>gaming PCs, office computers, laptops and everyday systems</span></strong><span>, whether you are replacing an older drive or building a new PC.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The exact brand, model, interface and performance specifications may vary according to available stock.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Key Features</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• 256GB Storage Capacity</span><br><span>• M.2 Form Factor</span><br><span>• Solid State Drive (SSD)</span><br><span>• Fast Windows startup</span><br><span>• Quick application loading</span><br><span>• Improved everyday responsiveness</span><br><span>• Compact installation</span><br><span>• Suitable for compatible desktops and laptops</span><br><span>• Great for Windows and essential applications</span><br><span>• More storage capacity than 128GB SSDs</span><br><span>• Ideal for budget PC upgrades</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Product:</span></strong><span> M.2 Solid State Drive</span><br><strong><span>Capacity:</span></strong><span> 256GB</span><br><strong><span>Storage Type:</span></strong><span> SSD</span><br><strong><span>Form Factor:</span></strong><span> M.2</span><br><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> May vary according to stock</span><br><strong><span>Interface:</span></strong><span> SATA or PCIe/NVMe depending on available stock</span><br><strong><span>Performance:</span></strong><span> Varies according to model and interface</span><br><strong><span>Compatibility:</span></strong><span> Compatible M.2-equipped desktop PCs and laptops</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Gaming PC, Office PC, Laptop, Windows &amp; Storage Upgrade</span></p>\n<h2><span>Performance</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>A </span><strong><span>256GB M.2 SSD</span></strong><span> is a great choice for users looking to improve everyday system performance.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Compared with a traditional mechanical HDD, solid-state storage can provide:</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Faster Windows boot times</span><br><span>• Quicker application loading</span><br><span>• Faster file access</span><br><span>• Improved overall system responsiveness</span><br><span>• Silent operation with no moving mechanical parts</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The 256GB capacity also provides considerably more flexibility than smaller 120GB or 128GB drives.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Important Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>M.2 is a form factor and does not automatically mean NVMe.</span></strong></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>M.2 SSDs may use </span><strong><span>SATA or PCIe/NVMe interfaces</span></strong><span>. Your motherboard or laptop must support the interface used by the specific drive.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>A physically compatible M.2 slot does not always support every type of M.2 SSD.</span></p>\n<p><span>Please confirm your motherboard or laptop model before ordering. If you specifically need an </span><strong><span>NVMe M.2 SSD</span></strong><span>, confirm the exact available drive before purchase.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),7500,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/images_14_91ac9b89-7d1a-47e0-82f0-0565e5be33cf.jpg?v=1786266576','https://sakoonsay.com/products/256gb-m-2-ssd-desktop-laptop-pc-storage-drive.js','storage',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:13');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(8,'8209444732981','256gb-nvme-m-2-ssd-desktop-laptop-high-speed-storage','256GB NVMe M.2 SSD – Desktop & Laptop High-Speed Storage',replace('<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Upgrade your compatible desktop or laptop with a </span><strong><span>256GB NVMe M.2 SSD</span></strong><span> for fast boot times, quicker application loading and responsive everyday performance. Using the PCIe/NVMe interface, it’s an excellent storage upgrade for gaming PCs, office systems and laptops.</span></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Boost your system performance with a </span><strong><span>256GB NVMe M.2 SSD</span></strong><span>, combining fast solid-state storage with a compact M.2 form factor.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Unlike SATA-based SSDs, an </span><strong><span>NVMe SSD communicates through PCIe</span></strong><span>, allowing compatible drives and systems to achieve higher storage performance than conventional SATA storage.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>With </span><strong><span>256GB capacity</span></strong><span>, this drive is ideal for installing Windows, essential applications, productivity software and selected games. It provides a practical balance between affordability, speed and usable storage space.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The compact M.2 design installs directly into a compatible motherboard or laptop slot without requiring traditional SATA data and power cables.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Whether you’re upgrading an older system or completing a budget gaming PC, a 256GB NVMe SSD can deliver a noticeably faster and more responsive computing experience.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Performance Highlights</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• 256GB Storage Capa