tems with larger game libraries, consider using this NVMe SSD for </span><strong><span>Windows and frequently used applications</span></strong><span> while adding a larger SSD or HDD for additional storage.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Important Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Your motherboard or laptop must support </span><strong><span>PCIe/NVMe M.2 SSDs</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>An M.2 slot does not automatically guarantee NVMe compatibility because some systems only support SATA-based M.2 drives.</span></p>\n<p><span>Also check the supported </span><strong><span>M.2 drive size and PCIe generation</span></strong><span> of your system before purchasing.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),7500,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/e5cef80733609b13d142ae3cd65d7acd.jpg?v=1786266740','https://sakoonsay.com/products/256gb-nvme-m-2-ssd-desktop-laptop-high-speed-storage.js','storage',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:13');
