 loading</span><br><span>• Improved overall system responsiveness</span><br><span>• More storage capacity than 120GB/128GB SSDs</span><br><span>• Great for Windows and essential applications</span><br><span>• Suitable for budget gaming PCs</span><br><span>• Excellent for office and home computers</span><br><span>• Cost-effective system upgrade</span><br><span>• Used / System Pulled</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Product:</span></strong><span> Solid State Drive</span><br><strong><span>Capacity:</span></strong><span> 256GB</span><br><strong><span>Storage Type:</span></strong><span> SSD</span><br><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> May vary according to available stock</span><br><strong><span>Interface:</span></strong><span> Depends on available stock</span><br><strong><span>Condition:</span></strong><span> Used / System Pulled</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Gaming PC, Office PC, Home PC, Laptop &amp; Storage Upgrade</span></p>\n<h2><span>Condition</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>USED – SYSTEM PULLED</span></strong></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>This SSD has been removed from a previously assembled computer and is </span><strong><span>not being advertised as a brand-new retail drive</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Brand, model, interface, form factor, cosmetic appearance and performance specifications may vary according to available stock.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>If you require a specific brand or interface, please confirm availability before ordering.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Why Upgrade to a 256GB SSD?</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>A </span><strong><span>256GB SSD</span></strong><span> provides an excellent balance between affordability, speed and usable storage capacity.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Compared with a traditional hard drive, an SSD can provide:</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Faster Windows startup</span><br><span>• Quicker application loading</span><br><span>• Faster file access</span><br><span>• Improved everyday responsiveness</span><br><span>• Silent operation with no moving mechanical parts</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Compared with a </span><strong><span>128GB SSD</span></strong><span>, the 256GB capacity also provides significantly more room for applications, files and selected games.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Please confirm the </span><strong><span>SSD interface and your system compatibility</span></strong><span> before ordering.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Available stock may vary between </span><strong><span>2.5-inch SATA, M.2 SATA or other SSD formats</span></strong><span>. Do not order based on capacity alone if your system requires a specific interface or form factor.</span></p>\n<p><span>Contact us before ordering if you need a specific SSD type.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),7500,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/Toshiba-256gb-Sata-SSD-Hard-Drive-THNSNC256GBSJ-CJAA0202-Apple-655-1653C-25-113280183999.pngDFMNGBDHGS.webp?v=1786226000','https://sakoonsay.com/products/256gb-ssd-used-system-pulled-desktop-laptop-storage-drive.js','storage',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:16');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(10,'8209128161333','2tb-hdd-used-system-pulled-desktop-pc-hard-drive','2TB HDD – Used System Pulled Desktop PC Hard Drive',replace('<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Expand your PC storage with a </span><strong><span>2TB Hard Disk Drive (HDD)</span></strong><span>. This </span><strong><span>used system-pulled desktop hard drive</span></strong><span> provides high-capacity, cost-effective storage for games, videos, photos, backups and large files.</span></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Add massive and affordable storage to your desktop computer with a </span><strong><span>2TB System-Pulled HDD</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>With </span><strong><span>2TB storage capacity</span></strong><span>, this hard drive provides plenty of space for games, videos, photos, documents, downloads, backups and other large files. It is an excellent option for users who need significantly more storage without the higher cost of a large-capacity SSD.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For gaming PCs, a 2TB HDD is particularly useful as a </span><strong><span>secondary game and media drive</span></strong><span>. Pair it with an SSD for Windows and frequently used applications to enjoy faster system responsiveness while keeping plenty of affordable storage available.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>This hard drive is </span><strong><span>USED / SYSTEM PULLED</span></strong><span>, meaning it has been removed from a previously assembled desktop computer rather than being sold as a brand-new retail drive.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Brand, model, RPM, cache and exact specifications may vary according to available stock.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Key Features</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• 2TB Storage Capacity</span><br><span>• Desktop Hard Disk Drive (HDD)</span><br><span>• High-capacity storage at an affordable cost</span><br><span>• Great for large game libraries</span><br><span>• Ideal for videos, photos and media</span><br><span>• Suitable for documents and backups</span><br><span>• Excellent secondary storage drive</span><br><span>• Great for gaming and everyday PCs</span><br><span>• Cost-effective alternative to large-capacity SSDs</span><br><span>• Used / System Pulled</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Product:</span></strong><span> Desktop Hard Disk Drive</span><br><strong><span>Capacity:</span></strong><span> 2TB</span><br><strong><span>Storage Type:</span></strong><span> HDD</span><br><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> May vary according to available stock</span><br><strong><span>Interface:</span></strong><span> Depends on available stock</span><br><strong><span>RPM:</span></strong><span> May vary according to stock</span><br><strong><span>Cache:</span></strong><span> May vary according to model</span><br><strong><span>Condition:</span></strong><span> Used / System Pulled</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Gaming Storage, Media, Files, Backups &amp; Secondary PC Storage</span></p>\n<h2><span>Condition</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>USED – SYSTEM PULLED</span></strong></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>This HDD has been removed from a previously assembled desktop system and is </span><strong><span>not being advertised as a brand-new retail hard drive</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Brand, model, RPM, cache, cosmetic appearance and exact specifications may vary depending on available stock.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Please confirm availability before ordering if you require a specific brand, RPM or model.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Recommended Gaming PC Setup</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For the best balance of </span><strong><span>speed and storage capacity</span></strong><span>, pair this </span><strong><span>2TB HDD with an SSD</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Use the SSD for:</span><br><span>• Windows</span><br><span>• Frequently used applications</span><br><span>• Your most frequently played games</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Use the 2TB HDD for:</span><br><span>• Larger game libraries</span><br><span>• Videos and media</span><br><span>• Downloads</span><br><span>• Documents</span><br><span>• Backups and general file storage</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>This combination gives you fast everyday system performance while providing plenty of affordable storage.</span></p>\n<h2><span>HDD vs SSD</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>A </span><strong><span>2TB HDD</span></strong><span> is an excellent choice when storage capacity and value are the priority.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For customers who prioritize faster game loading, file transfers and application performance, a </span><strong><span>1TB or 2TB SSD</span></strong><span> is a better upgrade where budget allows.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Please confirm your desktop PC supports the interface used by the available hard drive.</span></p>\n<p><span>Also ensure your PC case has a suitable drive bay and the required power and data connections before installation.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),14000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/2tb-821-0-030422103153209.jpg?v=1786226921','https://sakoonsay.com/products/2tb-hdd-used-system-pulled-desktop-pc-hard-drive.js','storage',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:16');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(11,'8209098407989','4gb-ddr3-desktop-ram-used-system-pulled-pc-memory','4GB DDR3 1333/1600MHz Desktop RAM – Used System Pulled | Price in Pakistan',replace('<h2>4GB DDR3 Desktop RAM in Pakistan</h2>\n<p>Upgrade or repair a compatible older desktop computer with <strong>4GB DDR3 RAM</strong>. This used system-pulled desktop memory is a practical and affordable choice for office PCs, home computers, browsing, basic applications and budget upgrades.</p>\n\n<h2>Product Highlights</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Capacity:</strong> 4GB</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Memory type:</strong> DDR3</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Speed:</strong> 1333/1600MHz, subject to the exact available module</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Form factor:</strong> Desktop DIMM</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Condition:</strong> Used / system pulled</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Current price:</strong> Rs. 1,500</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Compatibility</h2>\n<p>This RAM is designed for desktop motherboards that support DDR3 memory. DDR3 is not compatible with DDR4 or DDR5 slots. Confirm your motherboard model, supported RAM generation and maximum capacity before ordering.</p>\n\n<h2>Condition and Stock Note</h2>\n<p>This is <strong>used system-pulled RAM</strong>, not brand-new retail memory. Brand, model, PCB appearance, timings and exact frequency may vary according to available stock. If you need a specific brand or speed, please confirm availability before purchase.</p>\n\n<h2>Recommended Use</h2>\n<p>It is suitable for repairing older desktop PCs, upgrading systems currently using limited memory, office and home computers, and economical PC builds. Adding another compatible module may improve total capacity where the motherboard supports it.</p>\n\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<h3>Is this RAM compatible with DDR4?</h3>\n<p>No. DDR3, DDR4 and DDR5 use different slots and are not interchangeable.</p>\n<h3>Is this RAM new?</h3>\n<p>No. It is listed as used/system pulled memory.</p>\n<h3>Will it work in every desktop computer?</h3>\n<p>It will work only in a compatible DDR3 desktop motherboard that supports the module capacity and speed.</p>','\n',char(10)),1500,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/4gb-ddr3-ram-1333-1600mhz-1.jpg?v=1786225376','https://sakoonsay.com/products/4gb-ddr3-desktop-ram-used-system-pulled-pc-memory.js','Ram',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:20');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(12,'8209098276917','4gb-ddr4-desktop-ram-pc-memory-upgrade','4GB DDR4 Desktop RAM – PC Memory Upgrade | Price in Pakistan',replace('<h2>4GB DDR4 Desktop RAM in Pakistan</h2>\n<p>Upgrade a compatible desktop computer with <strong>4GB DDR4 RAM</strong> for smoother everyday performance, office work, web browsing and basic multitasking. This is an affordable desktop memory upgrade for supported Intel and AMD DDR4 systems.</p>\n\n<h2>Product Highlights</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Capacity:</strong> 4GB</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Memory type:</strong> DDR4</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Form factor:</strong> Desktop DIMM</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Condition:</strong> Product condition and exact module may vary with stock</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Current price:</strong> Rs. 4,500</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Recommended Use</h2>\n<p>This module is suitable for office PCs, home computers, everyday computing, basic multitasking, repairs and budget desktop upgrades. For more demanding gaming or multitasking, an 8GB or 16GB total configuration is recommended when supported by the motherboard.</p>\n\n<h2>Compatibility</h2>\n<p>Your motherboard and processor must support DDR4 desktop memory. DDR4 is not physically compatible with DDR3 or DDR5 slots. Confirm your motherboard model, supported capacity and memory speed before ordering.</p>\n\n<h2>Condition and Stock Note</h2>\n<p>Brand, model, PCB appearance, timings and exact speed may vary according to available stock. If you require a specific brand or frequency, please confirm availability before ordering. For dual-channel operation, use two compatible modules with matching specifications where supported.</p>\n\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<h3>Is this RAM compatible with DDR3?</h3>\n<p>No. DDR3 and DDR4 use different slots and are not interchangeable.</p>\n<h3>Is 4GB enough for gaming?</h3>\n<p>It can support basic use and some lighter games, but 8GB or 16GB is generally more suitable for modern gaming and multitasking.</p>\n<h3>Will it work in every desktop PC?</h3>\n<p>No. It works only in a desktop motherboard that supports DDR4 memory and the module''s specifications.</p>','\n',char(10)),4500,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/79a5f9734c000ada59e6e960c567c8e9.jpg_720x720q80.jpg?v=1786225039','https://sakoonsay.com/products/4gb-ddr4-desktop-ram-pc-memory-upgrade.js','Ram',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:20');
