500GB HDD as secondary storage</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>This combination provides the faster responsiveness of an SSD while keeping additional storage affordable.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Please confirm your computer supports the interface used by the available HDD before ordering.</span></p>\n<p><span>For desktop systems, also make sure the PC case has suitable drive mounting space and the required power/data connections.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),4000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/wd-500_8a85062b-5234-4d68-b213-f6e1d410a87f.jpg?v=1786226613','https://sakoonsay.com/products/500gb-hdd-used-system-pulled-desktop-pc-hard-drive.js','storage',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:16');
