><span>12V output, PCIe power connectors and overall suitability for your GPU</span></strong><span> before purchase.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For gaming PCs with higher-power graphics cards, we recommend choosing a suitable </span><strong><span>branded PSU with the required PCIe connectors and appropriate power capacity</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Before purchasing, please confirm:</span></p>\n<p><span>• Motherboard power connector compatibility</span><br><span>• CPU power connector compatibility</span><br><span>• SATA/Molex connector requirements</span><br><span>• PCIe GPU connector requirements, if needed</span><br><span>• PSU physical size and case compatibility</span><br><span>• Power requirements of your complete PC</span></p>','\n',char(10)),4500,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/500watt-psu.jpg?v=1786227071','https://sakoonsay.com/products/500w-psu-used-system-pulled-mix-brand-desktop-power-supply.js','Power Supply',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:16');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(15,'7869420044341','50k-budget-gaming-pc-build-intel-i7-3rd-gen-rx-580-8gb-best-gaming-pc-in-pakistan','50K Budget Gaming PC Build – Intel i7 3rd Gen + RX 580 8GB – Best Gaming PC in Pakistan',replace('<p>This <strong>50K budget gaming PC build</strong> pairs an <strong>Intel Core i7-3770</strong> with an <strong>ASUS Radeon RX 580 8GB</strong>. It is a desktop tower configuration for buyers comparing gaming PCs around Rs. 50,000 in Pakistan. Use the current price shown above when placing your order.</p><h2>Listed build specification</h2><ul>\n<li>Processor: Intel Core i7-3770, 3rd generation</li>\n<li>Motherboard: H61</li>\n<li>Memory: 8GB DDR3</li>\n<li>Storage: 128GB SSD and 500GB HDD</li>\n<li>Graphics: ASUS Radeon RX 580 8GB</li>\n<li>Power supply: 500W</li>\n<li>Case: standard gaming case</li>\n</ul><p>Confirm the exact motherboard, PSU and case models, component condition and any requested upgrades before ordering.</p><h2>What is included?</h2><p>The listed package contains the assembled PC tower and a power cable. A monitor, keyboard and mouse are not listed as included; ask for a separate full-setup quotation if you need them.</p><h2>Gaming performance</h2><p>FPS varies with the game''s current version, resolution, settings, drivers and component condition. Ask for a test in your preferred games before buying. This listing does not promise a fixed frame rate.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Can I change the RAM or storage?</h3><p>Contact us with the capacity you need. We will confirm compatible options, availability and any price difference before you order.</p><h3>Does 50K include a complete monitor setup?</h3><p>The listed configuration is a PC tower and power cable. Confirm the total quotation for a monitor and peripherals separately.</p><h2>Price, availability and ordering</h2><p>Check the price and availability shown on this page before ordering. Free delivery is available across Pakistan; cash-on-delivery orders require a 10% advance. Read our <a href="/pages/faq">delivery, payment and warranty FAQs</a>, or contact SakoonSay on <a href="https://wa.me/923007912922">WhatsApp</a> to confirm condition, included accessories and warranty terms for the unit you are buying.</p>','\n',char(10)),50000,55000,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/download.jpg?v=1741454166','https://sakoonsay.com/products/50k-budget-gaming-pc-build-intel-i7-3rd-gen-rx-580-8gb-best-gaming-pc-in-pakistan.js','Gaming PC',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:54');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(16,'8209449451573','512gb-m-2-nvme-gen3x4-ssd-used-system-pulled-mix-brand','512GB M.2 NVMe Gen3x4 SSD – Used System Pulled Mix Brand',replace('<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Upgrade your compatible desktop or laptop with a </span><strong><span>512GB M.2 NVMe PCIe Gen3x4 SSD</span></strong><span>. This </span><strong><span>used system-pulled branded SSD</span></strong><span> delivers fast storage performance, quick boot times and responsive application loading at excellent value. Brand and exact model vary according to stock.</span></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Boost your PC or laptop performance with a </span><strong><span>512GB M.2 NVMe PCIe Gen3x4 Solid State Drive</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Using the </span><strong><span>PCIe Gen3 x4 NVMe interface</span></strong><span>, this SSD is designed to provide high-speed storage performance for compatible desktop PCs and laptops, making it an excellent upgrade from traditional hard drives and SATA-based storage.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>With </span><strong><span>512GB capacity</span></strong><span>, you get practical storage space for Windows, applications, productivity software, personal files and a selection of games.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The compact </span><strong><span>M.2 form factor</span></strong><span> installs directly into a compatible motherboard or laptop M.2 NVMe slot, eliminating the need for separate SATA power and data cables.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>These drives are </span><strong><span>USED / SYSTEM PULLED</span></strong><span> and supplied in mixed branded stock. The exact manufacturer, model and performance specifications may vary depending on availability.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Performance Highlights</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• 512GB Storage Capacity</span><br><span>• M.2 NVMe Solid State Drive</span><br><span>• PCIe Gen3 x4 Interface</span><br><span>• Fast Windows boot times</span><br><span>• Quick application loading</span><br><span>• Responsive file access</span><br><span>• Great for gaming and productivity PCs</span><br><span>• Suitable for compatible desktops and laptops</span><br><span>• Compact cable-free installation</span><br><span>• Branded mixed stock</span><br><span>• Used / System Pulled</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Product:</span></strong><span> M.2 NVMe Solid State Drive</span><br><strong><span>Capacity:</span></strong><span> 512GB</span><br><strong><span>Interface:</span></strong><span> PCIe Gen3 x4 / NVMe</span><br><strong><span>Form Factor:</span></strong><span> M.2 / NGFF</span><br><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> Mixed Branded Stock</span><br><strong><span>Model:</span></strong><span> Varies according to stock</span><br><strong><span>Read Speed:</span></strong><span> Varies by model</span><br><strong><span>Write Speed:</span></strong><span> Varies by model</span><br><strong><span>Condition:</span></strong><span> Used / System Pulled</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Gaming, Windows, Office, Laptop &amp; PC Storage Upgrade</span></p>\n<h2><span>Condition</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>USED – SYSTEM PULLED</span></strong></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>These SSDs have been removed from previously assembled systems and are </span><strong><span>not being advertised as brand-new retail drives</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Brand, model, PCB appearance, firmware, performance and other specifications may vary according to available stock.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>If you require a particular brand or model, please confirm availability before ordering.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Gaming &amp; Everyday Performance</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>A </span><strong><span>512GB NVMe SSD</span></strong><span> is an excellent choice for a gaming or everyday PC.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>It provides enough capacity for Windows, essential applications and selected games while offering the fast response associated with NVMe storage.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Compared with traditional HDD storage, you can benefit from:</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Faster Windows startup</span><br><span>• Quicker application launches</span><br><span>• Faster file access</span><br><span>• Improved system responsiveness</span><br><span>• Reduced loading times in supported workloads</span></p>\n<h2><span>Important Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Your desktop or laptop must have an </span><strong><span>M.2 slot that supports PCIe/NVMe SSDs</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>An M.2 slot does not automatically guarantee NVMe support, as some older systems only support M.2 SATA drives.</span></p>\n<p><span>Please confirm your motherboard or laptop specifications before ordering.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),14000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/Used-SM951-MZVPV512HDGL-MZ-VPV5120-MZ-VPV512D-MZ-VPV512L-MZ-VPV512H-512GB-2280-M-2-PCIe.webp?v=1786266951','https://sakoonsay.com/products/512gb-m-2-nvme-gen3x4-ssd-used-system-pulled-mix-brand.js','storage',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:13');
