graphics-card clearance, motherboard ka PCIe x16 slot, power-supply capacity aur required power connector verify karein. Used hardware hone ki wajah se product ki physical condition aur included accessories order se pehle confirm karein.</p>\n\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<h3>GALAX GTX 1660 SUPER 1-Click OC kis resolution ke liye suitable hai?</h3>\n<p>Yeh graphics card 1080p gaming ke liye suitable hai, khaas taur par esports aur commonly played PC games ke liye. Exact FPS CPU, RAM, game settings aur optimization par depend karega.</p>\n\n<h3>Is graphics card mein kitni VRAM hai?</h3>\n<p>Is GALAX GTX 1660 SUPER mein 6GB GDDR6 VRAM aur 192-bit memory interface hai.</p>\n\n<h3>Kya yeh card modern games chala sakta hai?</h3>\n<p>Haan, yeh card 1080p par modern games chala sakta hai. Recommended settings aur performance game ke mutabiq different ho sakti hai.</p>\n\n<h3>Kya GTX 1660 SUPER mein ray tracing hai?</h3>\n<p>GTX 1660 SUPER mein dedicated RTX ray-tracing cores nahi hote, is liye yeh ray-tracing-focused graphics card nahi hai.</p>\n\n<h3>Kya yeh graphics card used hai?</h3>\n<p>Ji haan, yeh used GALAX GTX 1660 SUPER 1-Click OC graphics card hai aur retail box included nahi hai.</p>\n\n<h3>Kya is product ke saath box milta hai?</h3>\n<p>Nahi, yeh listing used graphics card without retail box ke liye hai. Included accessories order se pehle confirm karein.</p>\n\n<h3>Kya yeh mere PC mein install ho jayega?</h3>\n<p>Agar aapke motherboard mein compatible PCIe x16 slot, case mein required clearance aur suitable PSU available hai to installation possible hai. Compatibility confirm karne ke liye apne system ki details share karein.</p>\n\n<h3>Is card ke liye PSU kaise select karein?</h3>\n<p>System ke total components aur graphics-card ke required connector ke mutabiq suitable quality PSU use karein. Purchase se pehle apne exact card model ka power requirement verify karein.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> Used product ki condition, accessories aur availa