 outputs are available?</h4><p>MSI lists three DisplayPort 2.1b outputs and one HDMI 2.1b output.</p>','\n',char(10)),115000,NULL,0,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/msi-rtx-5060-shadow-2x-oc-8gb-gddr7-without-box.webp?v=1789861404','https://sakoonsay.com/products/msi-geforce-rtx-5060-8g-shadow-2x-oc-8gb-gddr7-graphics-card-without-box.js','Graphics Card',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:03:53');
