Series</span><br><span>• DGT / Digital Display Design</span><br><span>• Performance Tower CPU Cooler</span><br><span>• Multi Heat-Pipe Cooling System</span><br><span>• Large Aluminum Fin Stack</span><br><span>• Illuminated Gaming Fan</span><br><span>• Premium Black Finish</span><br><span>• Gaming-Focused Cooling Design</span><br><span>• Ideal for Glass-Panel Cases</span><br><span>• Excellent Stock Cooler Upgrade</span><br><span>• Suitable for Gaming &amp; Performance PCs</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> FROZER</span><br><strong><span>Model:</span></strong><span> FR-6 Fusion DGT</span><br><strong><span>Product Type:</span></strong><span> CPU Air Cooler</span><br><strong><span>Color:</span></strong><span> Black</span><br><strong><span>Cooling Type:</span></strong><span> Air Cooling</span><br><strong><span>Design:</span></strong><span> Tower CPU Cooler</span><br><strong><span>Heat Pipes:</span></strong><span> Multi Heat-Pipe Design</span><br><strong><span>Heatsink:</span></strong><span> Aluminum Fin Stack</span><br><strong><span>Display:</span></strong><span> Digital Display</span><br><strong><span>Fan:</span></strong><span> Performance Cooling Fan</span><br><strong><span>Lighting:</span></strong><span> Illuminated / RGB-style design</span><br><strong><span>CPU Compatibility:</span></strong><span> Intel &amp; AMD depending on included mounting hardware</span><br><strong><span>TDP Support:</span></strong><span> Confirm according to manufacturer specification</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Gaming PCs, Performance Systems &amp; Custom Builds</span></p>\n<h2><span>Performance Cooling</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Compared with compact 2-heat-pipe coolers such as entry-level tower models, the </span><strong><span>FR-6 Fusion DGT</span></strong><span> is designed as a more substantial cooling solution.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Its larger heatsink and multi-heat-pipe configuration provide increased heat-transfer potential, making it better suited to performance-oriented gaming systems.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Actual CPU temperatures depend on the processor, power limits, thermal paste, ambient temperature and case airflow.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Digital Display</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>One of the standout features of the </span><strong><span>FR-6 Fusion DGT</span></strong><span> is its digital display.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The display gives the cooler a much more premium appearance than conventional tower air coolers and works particularly well inside tempered-glass gaming cases.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Black Gaming Aesthetic</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The black tower design provides an excellent match for:</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Black gaming cases</span><br><span>• RGB/ARGB gaming fans</span><br><span>• Gaming motherboards</span><br><span>• RGB RAM</span><br><span>• Dedicated gaming GPUs</span><br><span>• Dark-themed custom PC builds</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The result is a clean and performance-focused gaming setup.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Air Cooling Without an AIO</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The FR-6 Fusion DGT is an attractive option for customers who want stronger tower cooling while preferring the simplicity of an </span><strong><span>air cooler instead of an AIO liquid cooler</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>There is no radiator to mount and no liquid cooling loop, making installation and case planning simpler for compatible builds.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Before ordering, confirm the exact </span><strong><span>Intel/AMD socket support</span></strong><span>, included mounting hardware and your PC case''s maximum CPU cooler height.</span></p>\n<p><span>RAM and motherboard clearance should also be checked before installation.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),8500,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/276.webp?v=1786299302','https://sakoonsay.com/products/frozer-fr-6-fusion-dgt-black-cpu-air-cooler-digital-display.js','Cooler',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-21 03:20:31');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3252,'8209897619509','frozer-fr-200-pro-cpu-air-cooler-2-heat-pipes-black','FROZER FR-200 Pro CPU Air Cooler – 2 Heat Pipes Black',replace('<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Upgrade your processor cooling with the </span><strong><span>FROZER FR-200 Pro CPU Air Cooler – Black</span></strong><span>. Featuring a </span><strong><span>2 heat-pipe tower design and RGB gaming fan</span></strong><span>, it delivers practical CPU cooling with an attractive gaming look for budget and mainstream PC builds.</span></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Keep your processor cool while upgrading your gaming PC aesthetics with the </span><strong><span>FROZER FR-200 Pro CPU Air Cooler – Black</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Designed as a practical alternative to basic stock CPU coolers, the FR-200 Pro uses </span><strong><span>2 copper heat pipes</span></strong><span> to transfer heat away from the processor into its aluminum heatsink.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>An active cooling fan pushes air through the heatsink fins to dissipate heat, helping maintain suitable operating temperatures during everyday computing and gaming workloads.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>black finish with colorful RGB-style lighting</span></strong><span> makes the cooler an attractive choice for glass-panel gaming cases and RGB PC setups.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For customers who want an affordable CPU cooling upgrade without moving to a larger tower cooler or liquid AIO, the </span><strong><span>FROZER FR-200 Pro</span></strong><span> offers a great combination of cooling, compact size and gaming aesthetics.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Key Features</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• FROZER FR-200 Pro Series</span><br><span>• Tower CPU Air Cooler</span><br><span>• 2 Copper Heat Pipes</span><br><span>• Aluminum Heatsink</span><br><span>• Active Cooling Fan</span><br><span>• RGB Gaming Aesthetic</span><br><span>• Black Finish</span><br><span>• Compact Tower Design</span><br><span>• Great Upgrade from Basic Stock Cooling</span><br><span>• Ideal for Budget Gaming PCs</span><br><span>• Suitable for Everyday Desktop Builds</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> FROZER</span><br><strong><span>Model:</span></strong><span> FR-200 Pro</span><br><strong><span>Product Type:</span></strong><span> CPU Air Cooler</span><br><strong><span>Color:</span></strong><span> Black</span><br><strong><span>Cooling Type:</span></strong><span> Air Cooling</span><br><strong><span>Heat Pipes:</span></strong><span> 2</span><br><strong><span>Heat Pipe Material:</span></strong><span> Copper</span><br><strong><span>Heatsink:</span></strong><span> Aluminum Fin Stack</span><br><strong><span>Design:</span></strong><span> Tower Style</span><br><strong><span>Fan:</span></strong><span> Active Cooling Fan</span><br><strong><span>Lighting:</span></strong><span> RGB-style illumination / confirm exact lighting control</span><br><strong><span>CPU Compatibility:</span></strong><span> Intel &amp; AMD depending on included mounting kit</span><br><strong><span>TDP Rating:</span></strong><span> Confirm according to manufacturer specification</span><br><strong><span>Fan Speed:</span></strong><span> Confirm according to model specification</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Gaming, Office &amp; Everyday Desktop PCs</span></p>\n<h2><span>2 Heat-Pipe Cooling</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The FR-200 Pro uses </span><strong><span>two heat pipes</span></strong><span> to move heat from the CPU contact area into the heatsink fins.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The attached fan then moves air across the heatsink to dissipate that heat away from the processor.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>This makes it a practical cooling solution for compatible mainstream CPUs and budget gaming systems.</span></p>\n<h2><span>RGB Gaming Style</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The illuminated fan gives the </span><strong><span>FR-200 Pro Black</span></strong><span> a more attractive appearance than a conventional stock CPU cooler.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Its black chassis works especially well with:</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Black gaming cases</span><br><span>• RGB/ARGB case fans</span><br><span>• Gaming motherboards</span><br><span>• RGB RAM</span><br><span>• Dedicated graphics cards</span><br><span>• Glass-panel PC cases</span></p>\n<h2><span>Ideal For</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The FR-200 Pro is a good choice for:</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Budget Gaming PCs</span><br><span>• Office Desktop PCs</span><br><span>• Home Computers</span><br><span>• Stock Cooler Replacement</span><br><span>• Entry-Level Custom Builds</span><br><span>• RGB Gaming Setups</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Before ordering, confirm that the included mounting hardware supports your exact </span><strong><span>Intel or AMD CPU socket</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Also check your PC case''s </span><strong><span>maximum CPU cooler height clearance</span></strong><span> before installation.</span></p>\n<p><span>For higher-power CPUs or sustained heavy workloads, consider a larger multi-heat-pipe tower cooler or </span><strong><span>240mm AIO liquid cooler</span></strong><span> for additional thermal headroom.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),2000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/ChatGPTImageAug9_2026_11_10_14PM.png?v=1786299028','https://sakoonsay.com/products/frozer-fr-200-pro-cpu-air-cooler-2-heat-pipes-black.js','Cooler',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-21 03:20:31');
