><span>Perfect for White PC Builds</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>white design</span></strong><span> pairs especially well with:</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• White gaming cases</span><br><span>• White motherboards and heatsinks</span><br><span>• White RGB/ARGB RAM</span><br><span>• White graphics cards</span><br><span>• White case fans</span><br><span>• Matching gaming accessories</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>It provides a cleaner, coordinated appearance compared with using a conventional black CPU cooler in an all-white build.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Before ordering, please confirm the cooler supports your exact </span><strong><span>Intel or AMD CPU socket</span></strong><span> and that your PC case has sufficient CPU cooler height clearance.</span></p>\n<p><span>For higher-power processors, consider a larger multi-heat-pipe tower cooler or </span><strong><span>240mm AIO liquid cooler</span></strong><span> for greater cooling headroom.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),2000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/ChatGPTImageAug9_2026_11_06_33PM.png?v=1786298806','https://sakoonsay.com/products/frozer-fr-200-pro-cpu-air-cooler-2-heat-pipes-white.js','Cooler',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:03');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3254,'8209893916725','frozer-ice-emperor-240mm-aio-liquid-cpu-cooler-black','FROZER Ice Emperor 240mm AIO Liquid CPU Cooler – Black',replace('<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Upgrade your gaming PC cooling with the </span><strong><span>FROZER Ice Emperor 240mm AIO Liquid CPU Cooler – Black</span></strong><span>. Featuring a </span><strong><span>240mm dual-fan radiator, ARGB cooling aesthetics and digital temperature display</span></strong><span>, it combines efficient CPU cooling with a premium gaming look.</span></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Keep your processor cool while giving your gaming PC a premium appearance with the </span><strong><span>FROZER Ice Emperor 240mm AIO Liquid CPU Cooler – Black</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Built around a </span><strong><span>240mm radiator with dual cooling fans</span></strong><span>, the Ice Emperor provides a strong cooling platform for compatible gaming and performance processors.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The sleek black design fits perfectly into dark-themed gaming PCs, while colorful </span><strong><span>ARGB lighting</span></strong><span> adds an eye-catching effect inside glass-panel gaming cases.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>A standout feature is the </span><strong><span>digital display on the pump head</span></strong><span>, providing a modern high-tech appearance while complementing the cooler''s RGB gaming aesthetic.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The closed-loop </span><strong><span>All-in-One liquid cooling design</span></strong><span> provides the benefits of liquid CPU cooling in a convenient pre-assembled solution, making the Ice Emperor an attractive upgrade over basic stock CPU coolers.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Key Features</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• FROZER Ice Emperor Series</span><br><span>• 240mm AIO Liquid CPU Cooler</span><br><span>• Dual 120mm-Class Fan Layout</span><br><span>• ARGB Gaming Lighting</span><br><span>• Digital Temperature Display</span><br><span>• Premium Black Finish</span><br><span>• Closed-Loop Liquid Cooling</span><br><span>• Braided Cooling Tubes</span><br><span>• Gaming-Focused Design</span><br><span>• Ideal for Glass-Panel PC Cases</span><br><span>• Suitable for Gaming &amp; Performance Builds</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> FROZER</span><br><strong><span>Series:</span></strong><span> Ice Emperor</span><br><strong><span>Product Type:</span></strong><span> AIO Liquid CPU Cooler</span><br><strong><span>Radiator Class:</span></strong><span> 240mm</span><br><strong><span>Color:</span></strong><span> Black</span><br><strong><span>Cooling Type:</span></strong><span> All-in-One Liquid Cooling</span><br><strong><span>Fan Configuration:</span></strong><span> Dual-Fan 240mm Format</span><br><strong><span>Lighting:</span></strong><span> ARGB</span><br><strong><span>Pump Display:</span></strong><span> Digital Temperature Display</span><br><strong><span>Tubing:</span></strong><span> Braided</span><br><strong><span>CPU Compatibility:</span></strong><span> Intel / AMD depending on included mounting hardware</span><br><strong><span>Radiator Installation:</span></strong><span> Requires compatible 240mm case mounting position</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Gaming PCs, Performance PCs &amp; Custom Builds</span></p>\n<h2><span>Cooling Performance</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>240mm radiator</span></strong><span> provides greater cooling surface area than smaller 120mm AIO solutions, making it a strong option for gaming and performance-focused processors.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Dual radiator fans move air across the cooling fins while the liquid cooling loop transfers heat away from the CPU.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Actual temperatures depend on your processor, CPU power consumption, ambient temperature, thermal paste, fan settings and overall case airflow.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Digital Display</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The pump head features a </span><strong><span>digital temperature display</span></strong><span>, giving the cooler a distinctive high-end appearance inside your gaming PC.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Combined with ARGB lighting, it creates an excellent visual centerpiece around the CPU area.</span></p>\n<h2><span>ARGB Gaming Design</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The black finish creates strong contrast with colorful ARGB illumination, making the </span><strong><span>Ice Emperor Black</span></strong><span> especially suitable for RGB gaming setups.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Pair it with a black gaming case, RGB RAM, ARGB case fans and a gaming GPU for a coordinated performance build.</span></p>\n<h2><span>240mm Case Compatibility</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Before purchasing, make sure your PC case has sufficient space for a </span><strong><span>240mm radiator and two fans</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Depending on your case, the radiator may be mounted at the top, front or another supported location.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Also check clearance around your motherboard, RAM, graphics card and other components.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Please confirm the exact </span><strong><span>Intel/AMD CPU socket compatibility and included mounting brackets</span></strong><span> for the available unit before purchase.</span></p>\n<p><span>Exact fan speed, pump speed, airflow, noise level and electrical specifications should be confirmed according to the specific FROZER Ice Emperor version.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),13000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/4_8-748x512-1.png?v=1786298456','https://sakoonsay.com/products/frozer-ice-emperor-240mm-aio-liquid-cpu-cooler-black.js','Cooler',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:03');
