ics.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Key Features</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• FROZER Ice Emperor Series</span><br><span>• 240mm AIO Liquid CPU Cooler</span><br><span>• Premium White Finish</span><br><span>• Dual-Fan Radiator Format</span><br><span>• Designed for Gaming &amp; Performance PCs</span><br><span>• Clean CPU Area Appearance</span><br><span>• Excellent for White Gaming Builds</span><br><span>• Ideal for Showcase PC Cases</span><br><span>• Suitable for Compatible Intel &amp; AMD Platforms</span><br><span>• All-in-One Liquid Cooling Design</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> FROZER</span><br><strong><span>Series:</span></strong><span> Ice Emperor</span><br><strong><span>Product Type:</span></strong><span> AIO Liquid CPU Cooler</span><br><strong><span>Radiator Size:</span></strong><span> 240mm Class</span><br><strong><span>Color:</span></strong><span> White</span><br><strong><span>Cooling Type:</span></strong><span> Closed-Loop Liquid Cooling</span><br><strong><span>Radiator Fans:</span></strong><span> 2-Fan / 240mm format</span><br><strong><span>Lighting:</span></strong><span> Confirm exact lighting features for available version</span><br><strong><span>Pump:</span></strong><span> Integrated AIO Pump</span><br><strong><span>CPU Socket Support:</span></strong><span> Confirm exact Intel/AMD socket compatibility</span><br><strong><span>Fan Speed:</span></strong><span> Confirm according to model specification</span><br><strong><span>Pump Speed:</span></strong><span> Confirm according to model specification</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Gaming PC, Performance PC &amp; White Custom Builds</span></p>\n<h2><span>Cooling Performance</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>240mm radiator format</span></strong><span> provides a strong balance between cooling potential and case compatibility.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Compared with basic stock CPU coolers, an appropriately installed 240mm AIO can provide greater thermal headroom for compatible processors, particularly during demanding gaming and productivity workloads.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Actual CPU temperatures will depend on the processor, power settings, ambient temperature, case airflow and radiator configuration.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Perfect for White Gaming Builds</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The white Ice Emperor is especially suitable for builders creating a coordinated gaming setup.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Pair it with:</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• White gaming case</span><br><span>• White or silver motherboard</span><br><span>• White graphics card</span><br><span>• RGB/ARGB RAM</span><br><span>• White case fans</span><br><span>• White PSU cables</span><br><span>• RGB gaming components</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The result is a cleaner, premium-looking custom PC.</span></p>\n<h2><span>240mm Case Compatibility</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Before purchasing, make sure your PC case has a mounting location suitable for a </span><strong><span>240mm AIO radiator and its fans</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Depending on the case, a 240mm radiator may be installed at the top, front or another supported mounting position.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Always check radiator clearance against your motherboard, RAM, graphics card and other components.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Important Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Please confirm the exact </span><strong><span>Intel or AMD CPU socket compatibility</span></strong><span> of the available FROZER Ice Emperor package before ordering.</span></p>\n<p><span>Also verify that your case supports a 240mm radiator with sufficient clearance for both the radiator and fans.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),13000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/ChatGPTImageAug9_2026_10_58_42PM.png?v=1786298336','https://sakoonsay.com/products/frozer-ice-emperor-240mm-aio-liquid-cpu-cooler-white.js','Cooler',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:03');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3256,'8209881989173','msi-mag-275qf-e20-27-wqhd-200hz-rapid-ips-gaming-monitor','MSI MAG 275QF E20 27″ WQHD 200Hz Rapid IPS Gaming Monitor',replace('<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Step up to high-resolution, high-refresh gaming with the </span><strong><span>MSI MAG 275QF E20 27-inch Gaming Monitor</span></strong><span>. Featuring </span><strong><span>2560×1440 WQHD resolution, up to 200Hz refresh rate, Rapid IPS technology and 0.5ms response performance</span></strong><span>, it’s built for fast, sharp and immersive gaming.</span></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Experience the perfect balance of </span><strong><span>resolution, speed and screen size</span></strong><span> with the </span><strong><span>MSI MAG 275QF E20 Gaming Monitor</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Its </span><strong><span>27-inch WQHD 2560×1440 display</span></strong><span> delivers significantly more detail and desktop space than conventional Full HD gaming monitors, making games look sharper while providing additional room for productivity and everyday use.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For competitive players, the monitor offers an ultra-fast </span><strong><span>up to 200Hz refresh rate</span></strong><span>, allowing compatible gaming PCs to deliver exceptionally smooth motion during fast-paced gameplay.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Rapid IPS panel</span></strong><span> combines fast response performance with excellent viewing characteristics, while its </span><strong><span>0.5ms response specification</span></strong><span> is designed to help minimize visible motion blur during intense gaming action.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Whether you''re playing competitive FPS titles, racing games, battle royale or visually detailed AAA games, the </span><strong><span>MSI MAG 275QF E20</span></strong><span> provides the speed and resolution needed for a premium gaming experience.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Key Features</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• 27-inch Gaming Display</span><br><span>• 2560 × 1440 WQHD Resolution</span><br><span>• Up to 200Hz Refresh Rate</span><br><span>• Rapid IPS Panel Technology</span><br><span>• 0.5ms Response Performance</span><br><span>• High-Refresh Competitive Gaming</span><br><span>• Sharp 1440p Image Quality</span><br><span>• Wide Viewing Angles</span><br><span>• Gaming-Focused Display Features</span><br><span>• Excellent for FPS &amp; Esports</span><br><span>• Great for AAA Gaming</span><br><span>• Suitable for Gaming &amp; Productivity</span></p>\n<h2><span>Display Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> MSI</span><br><strong><span>Series:</span></strong><span> MAG</span><br><strong><span>Model:</span></strong><span> MAG 275QF E20</span><br><strong><span>Screen Size:</span></strong><span> 27-inch</span><br><strong><span>Resolution:</span></strong><span> 2560 × 1440</span><br><strong><span>Resolution Class:</span></strong><span> WQHD / 1440p</span><br><strong><span>Panel Technology:</span></strong><span> Rapid IPS</span><br><strong><span>Maximum Refresh Rate:</span></strong><span> Up to 200Hz</span><br><strong><span>Response Time:</span></strong><span> 0.5ms class; measurement mode should be checked against MSI''s specification</span><br><strong><span>Aspect Ratio:</span></strong><span> 16:9</span><br><strong><span>Display Type:</span></strong><span> Flat Gaming Monitor</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Competitive Gaming, AAA Gaming, Esports &amp; Productivity</span></p>\n<h2><span>200Hz Gaming Performance</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>up to 200Hz refresh rate</span></strong><span> gives competitive gamers a major upgrade over conventional 60Hz, 75Hz and even 144Hz displays.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>When paired with a gaming PC capable of producing high frame rates, it provides:</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Smoother character movement</span><br><span>• More fluid camera motion</span><br><span>• Better clarity during fast action</span><br><span>• Responsive competitive gameplay</span><br><span>• Excellent high-FPS gaming experience</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>It''s particularly attractive for games such as </span><strong><span>Counter-Strike 2, Valorant, Fortnite, PUBG, Apex Legends and Call of Duty</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<h2><span>WQHD 1440p Resolution</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>With </span><strong><span>2560×1440 resolution</span></strong><span>, the MAG 275QF E20 provides approximately 78% more pixels than 1920×1080 Full HD.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>That means:</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Sharper gaming visuals</span><br><span>• Greater image detail</span><br><span>• More desktop workspace</span><br><span>• Better-looking text and interfaces</span><br><span>• Excellent balance at 27 inches</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For gamers upgrading from a 24-inch or 25-inch 1080p monitor, the jump to </span><strong><span>27-inch 1440p</span></strong><span> can provide a noticeably more detailed experience.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Rapid IPS Technology</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Rapid IPS panel</span></strong><span> is designed to combine the viewing characteristics of IPS technology with the response performance required for modern gaming.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>This makes the monitor suitable for customers who don''t want to choose between </span><strong><span>fast competitive performance and strong overall image quality</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Recommended Gaming PC</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>To get the most from </span><strong><span>1440p at high refresh rates</span></strong><span>, pair this monitor with a capable gaming graphics card.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For esports titles, high frame rates can be achievable with a wider range of GPUs, while demanding AAA games may require a stronger graphics card to approach the monitor''s maximum refresh rate at native 1440p resolution.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Upgrade from 1080p 180Hz</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>If you''re deciding between a </span><strong><span>1080p 180Hz monitor</span></strong><span> and the MAG 275QF E20, this MSI model provides both a higher </span><strong><span>2560×1440 resolution</span></strong><span> and a higher </span><strong><span>up to 200Hz refresh rate</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>It''s therefore an excellent upgrade for customers with a sufficiently powerful gaming PC who want sharper visuals without giving up high-refresh competitive performance.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>To achieve </span><strong><span>2560×1440 at the maximum supported refresh rate</span></strong><span>, your graphics card, selected display input and cable must support the required bandwidth.</span></p>\n<p><span>Available refresh rates can vary depending on the input, GPU and system configuration.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),60999,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/rbtech_msi_mag_275qf_e20.webp?v=1786297864','https://sakoonsay.com/products/msi-mag-275qf-e20-27-wqhd-200hz-rapid-ips-gaming-monitor.js','LCD',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:03');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3257,'8209878089781','msi-mag-256f-25-fhd-180hz-rapid-ips-1ms-gaming-monitor','MSI MAG 256F 25″ FHD 180Hz Rapid IPS 1ms Gaming Monitor',replace('<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Experience fast and fluid competitive gaming with the </span><strong><span>MSI MAG 256F 25-inch Gaming Monitor</span></strong><span>. Featuring </span><strong><span>1920×1080 Full HD resolution, 180Hz refresh rate, Rapid IPS panel and 1ms response time</span></strong><span>, it’s built for FPS, esports and high-refresh-rate gaming.</span></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Get the speed and clarity you need for competitive gaming with the </span><strong><span>MSI MAG 256F Gaming Monitor</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Featuring a </span><strong><span>24.5-inch viewable Rapid IPS panel</span></strong><span> with Full HD 1920×1080 resolution, the MAG 256F combines responsive gaming performance with the viewing characteristics of IPS display technology.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The ultra-fast </span><strong><span>180Hz refresh rate</span></strong><span> delivers significantly smoother motion than conventional 60Hz and 75Hz monitors, making fast movement easier to follow in competitive games.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>A </span><strong><span>1ms (GtG) response time</span></strong><span> helps reduce motion blur and keeps fast-paced action looking sharp, making this monitor especially suitable for FPS, racing, battle royale and esports titles.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For gamers looking to maximize competitive performance at 1080p, the MSI MAG 256F provides an excellent combination of </span><strong><span>180Hz speed, Rapid IPS technology and Full HD resolution</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Key Features</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• 24.5-inch Viewable Gaming Display</span><br><span>• 25-inch Class Monitor</span><br><span>• 1920 × 1080 Full HD Resolution</span><br><span>• Rapid IPS Panel</span><br><span>• 180Hz Refresh Rate</span><br><span>• 1ms (GtG) Response Time</span><br><span>• Adaptive-Sync Support</span><br><span>• HDR Ready</span><br><span>• Anti-Glare Display</span><br><span>• Wide Viewing Angles</span><br><span>• Excellent for FPS &amp; Esports Gaming</span><br><span>• Suitable for High-FPS Gaming PCs</span></p>\n<h2><span>Display Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> MSI</span><br><strong><span>Series:</span></strong><span> MAG</span><br><strong><span>Model:</span></strong><span> MAG 256F</span><br><strong><span>Screen Size:</span></strong><span> 24.5-inch viewable / 25-inch class</span><br><strong><span>Resolution:</span></strong><span> 1920 × 1080 (FHD)</span><br><strong><span>Panel Type:</span></strong><span> Rapid IPS</span><br><strong><span>Refresh Rate:</span></strong><span> Up to 180Hz</span><br><strong><span>Response Time:</span></strong><span> 1ms (GtG)</span><br><strong><span>Aspect Ratio:</span></strong><span> 16:9</span><br><strong><span>Viewing Angle:</span></strong><span> 178° Horizontal / 178° Vertical</span><br><strong><span>Surface:</span></strong><span> Anti-Glare</span><br><strong><span>HDR:</span></strong><span> HDR Ready</span><br><strong><span>Adaptive Sync:</span></strong><span> Supported</span><br><strong><span>VESA Mount:</span></strong><span> 100 × 100mm</span></p>\n<h2><span>Connectivity</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>DisplayPort:</span></strong><span> 1× DisplayPort 1.2a</span><br><strong><span>HDMI:</span></strong><span> 2× HDMI 2.0b</span><br><strong><span>Headphone Output:</span></strong><span> 1× Headphone-Out</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For maximum refresh-rate performance, use an appropriate DisplayPort or HDMI connection with a compatible graphics card.</span></p>\n<h2><span>180Hz Competitive Gaming</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>180Hz refresh rate</span></strong><span> is one of the MAG 256F''s biggest advantages.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Compared with a standard 60Hz display, the monitor can refresh the image up to three times as frequently, producing noticeably smoother motion when your gaming PC can deliver high frame rates.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>This makes it particularly suitable for:</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Counter-Strike 2</span><br><span>• Valorant</span><br><span>• Fortnite</span><br><span>• PUBG</span><br><span>• Apex Legends</span><br><span>• Call of Duty</span><br><span>• Racing &amp; Competitive Games</span></p>\n<h2><span>Rapid IPS + 1ms Response</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Rapid IPS panel</span></strong><span> combines fast gaming performance with the color and wide viewing-angle advantages associated with IPS technology.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Combined with its </span><strong><span>1ms GtG response time</span></strong><span>, the MAG 256F is designed to keep fast-moving gameplay responsive and clear.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Ideal GPU Pairing</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The Full HD resolution makes the MAG 256F a strong match for gaming PCs focused on achieving high frame rates.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For competitive gaming, pair it with a capable NVIDIA GeForce or AMD Radeon GPU that can push high FPS at </span><strong><span>1080p</span></strong><span> to take full advantage of the 180Hz display.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Why Choose MSI MAG 256F?</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The MAG 256F offers an excellent combination of:</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• 180Hz high-refresh gaming</span><br><span>• 1ms response time</span><br><span>• Rapid IPS technology</span><br><span>• Full HD resolution</span><br><span>• Adaptive-Sync support</span><br><span>• Esports-friendly screen size</span><br><span>• MSI gaming-focused design</span></p>\n<p><span>It’s an excellent upgrade for gamers moving from a traditional </span><strong><span>60Hz, 75Hz or 100Hz monitor</span></strong><span> to a much faster gaming display.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),38000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/inch1920x1080_F1.webp?v=1786297652','https://sakoonsay.com/products/msi-mag-256f-25-fhd-180hz-rapid-ips-1ms-gaming-monitor.js','LCD',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:03');
