edEnd"><span>• Thunder NOVA Gaming Series</span><br><span>• 4× ARGB Infinity Fans Included</span><br><span>• Infinity Mirror Lighting Effect</span><br><span>• Modern Gaming PC Design</span><br><span>• Showcase-Style Aesthetic</span><br><span>• Excellent RGB/ARGB Appearance</span><br><span>• Active Component Airflow</span><br><span>• Ideal for Gaming PCs</span><br><span>• Suitable for Custom Performance Builds</span><br><span>• Great Value with 4 Fans Included</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> Thunder</span><br><strong><span>Model:</span></strong><span> NOVA</span><br><strong><span>Product Type:</span></strong><span> Gaming PC Case / Chassis</span><br><strong><span>Included Fans:</span></strong><span> 4× ARGB Infinity Fans</span><br><strong><span>Lighting:</span></strong><span> ARGB</span><br><strong><span>Fan Style:</span></strong><span> Infinity / Mirror Effect</span><br><strong><span>Motherboard Compatibility:</span></strong><span> Confirm exact supported form factors</span><br><strong><span>GPU Clearance:</span></strong><span> Confirm according to case specifications</span><br><strong><span>CPU Cooler Clearance:</span></strong><span> Confirm before installation</span><br><strong><span>PSU Compatibility:</span></strong><span> Confirm according to case specifications</span><br><strong><span>Radiator Support:</span></strong><span> Confirm exact supported configuration</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Gaming PC, RGB PC &amp; Custom Performance Build</span></p>\n<h2><span>4× ARGB Infinity Fans</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>A major highlight of the </span><strong><span>Thunder NOVA</span></strong><span> is its factory-included </span><strong><span>4× ARGB Infinity Fan setup</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Infinity fans use a distinctive mirror-style lighting effect to create additional visual depth, producing a premium appearance that stands out through a showcase gaming case.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The included fans provide:</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Eye-catching ARGB lighting</span><br><span>• Infinity mirror visual effect</span><br><span>• Active case airflow</span><br><span>• Premium gaming aesthetics</span><br><span>• Reduced need to purchase additional fans</span></p>\n<h2><span>Gaming Build Potential</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Pair the </span><strong><span>Thunder NOVA</span></strong><span> with:</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Gaming motherboard</span><br><span>• NVIDIA GeForce or AMD Radeon GPU</span><br><span>• RGB/ARGB RAM</span><br><span>• RGB CPU cooler or compatible AIO</span><br><span>• NVMe SSD</span><br><span>• Quality gaming PSU</span><br><span>• Clean cable management</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The combination creates a modern gaming PC with vibrant lighting and a showcase-ready appearance.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Why Choose Thunder NOVA?</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The inclusion of </span><strong><span>four ARGB Infinity Fans</span></strong><span> makes the NOVA particularly attractive for gamers who want a complete RGB look without adding a separate set of expensive illuminated fans.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>It is an excellent option for customers who prioritize </span><strong><span>gaming aesthetics, RGB lighting and component presentation</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Before ordering, confirm compatibility with your </span><strong><span>motherboard, graphics card, CPU cooler, PSU and cooling setup</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p><span>Exact case dimensions, motherboard form-factor support, GPU clearance, CPU cooler height and radiator compatibility should be confirmed for your specific components.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),14500,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/Thunder-NOVA-PC-Case-with-4xArgb-infinity-Fans-2.jpg?v=1786297332','https://sakoonsay.com/products/thunder-nova-gaming-pc-case-4-argb-infinity-fans.js','PC Case',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:03');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3259,'8209877172277','msi-mag-a850gl-pcie5-850w-gold-fully-modular-psu-white','MSI MAG A850GL PCIE5 850W Gold Fully Modular PSU – White',replace('<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Power a high-performance gaming PC with the </span><strong><span>MSI MAG A850GL PCIE5 850W White</span></strong><span>. Featuring </span><strong><span>ATX 3.1 compatibility, PCIe 5.x GPU power support, 80 PLUS Gold efficiency and a fully modular cable design</span></strong><span>, it’s an excellent choice for modern gaming GPUs and premium white PC builds.</span></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Build your high-performance gaming system around reliable, efficient power with the </span><strong><span>MSI MAG A850GL PCIE5 850W – White</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Delivering </span><strong><span>850 watts of power</span></strong><span>, this PSU is designed for modern gaming and performance PCs, including systems equipped with power-hungry CPUs and compatible next-generation graphics cards.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Its </span><strong><span>ATX 3.1 design</span></strong><span> and native modern GPU power connectivity make it particularly suitable for current-generation gaming builds where handling high GPU power demands is important.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>80 PLUS Gold efficiency rating</span></strong><span> helps reduce wasted energy and heat compared with lower-efficiency power supplies, while the </span><strong><span>fully modular design</span></strong><span> allows you to connect only the cables your PC actually requires.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Finished in white with matching build potential, the A850GL is an excellent PSU for premium </span><strong><span>white gaming PCs, RGB showcase builds and high-performance custom systems</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Key Features</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• 850W Power Output</span><br><span>• ATX 3.1 Compatible</span><br><span>• PCIe 5.x Ready</span><br><span>• Native Modern GPU Power Support</span><br><span>• 80 PLUS Gold Certified</span><br><span>• Fully Modular Cable Design</span><br><span>• Designed for Modern Gaming GPUs</span><br><span>• High-Efficiency Power Delivery</span><br><span>• White Finish</span><br><span>• Ideal for Premium White Gaming PCs</span><br><span>• Suitable for High-Performance Gaming Builds</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> MSI</span><br><strong><span>Series:</span></strong><span> MAG</span><br><strong><span>Model:</span></strong><span> A850GL PCIE5</span><br><strong><span>Power Output:</span></strong><span> 850W</span><br><strong><span>Color:</span></strong><span> White</span><br><strong><span>Efficiency Certification:</span></strong><span> 80 PLUS Gold</span><br><strong><span>Design:</span></strong><span> Fully Modular</span><br><strong><span>ATX Standard:</span></strong><span> ATX 3.1</span><br><strong><span>PCIe Generation Support:</span></strong><span> PCIe 5.x</span><br><strong><span>GPU Power:</span></strong><span> Native high-power GPU connector support</span><br><strong><span>Cooling:</span></strong><span> Integrated PSU cooling fan</span><br><strong><span>Form Factor:</span></strong><span> ATX Power Supply</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> High-Performance Gaming, Workstation &amp; Custom PC Builds</span></p>\n<h2><span>Fully Modular Design</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>fully modular cable system</span></strong><span> allows builders to install only the power cables required by their components.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>This provides several advantages:</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Cleaner cable management</span><br><span>• Less unnecessary cable clutter</span><br><span>• Improved showcase appearance</span><br><span>• Easier PC assembly</span><br><span>• Better flexibility when routing cables</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>This is especially valuable in white gaming cases with glass panels where cable management is clearly visible.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Built for Modern Gaming GPUs</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>MAG A850GL PCIE5</span></strong><span> is designed with modern graphics-card power requirements in mind.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Its ATX 3.1 platform and native high-power GPU connectivity make it a strong option for compatible NVIDIA GeForce RTX and AMD Radeon gaming configurations.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>With </span><strong><span>850W capacity</span></strong><span>, it provides significantly more upgrade headroom than typical 550W, 650W and 750W power supplies.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Always check the PSU recommendation for your exact graphics card and complete PC configuration.</span></p>\n<h2><span>80 PLUS Gold Efficiency</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>80 PLUS Gold certification</span></strong><span> makes the A850GL an excellent option for performance-focused systems where efficiency matters.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Higher efficiency means less input power is wasted as heat, helping create a more efficient gaming system while reducing unnecessary thermal output inside the PSU.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Perfect for White Gaming PCs</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The white version of the A850GL is particularly attractive for premium white-themed builds.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Pair it with:</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• White gaming case</span><br><span>• White graphics card</span><br><span>• White motherboard</span><br><span>• White AIO liquid cooler</span><br><span>• RGB/ARGB RAM</span><br><span>• White case fans</span><br><span>• Matching cable management</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>This creates a cleaner and more coordinated gaming setup than using a standard black PSU in a visible white build.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Upgrade Path</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>An </span><strong><span>850W premium PSU</span></strong><span> provides excellent flexibility for future upgrades.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>It gives builders more room to move to higher-performance CPUs and graphics cards without automatically needing to replace the power supply during every major component upgrade.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Before purchasing, confirm the power requirements of your </span><strong><span>CPU, graphics card and complete PC configuration</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p><span>For modern high-power graphics cards, make sure the supplied GPU power cable is connected according to MSI and GPU manufacturer instructions.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),28999,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/rbtech_msi_mag_a850gl_white.png?v=1786296699','https://sakoonsay.com/products/msi-mag-a850gl-pcie5-850w-gold-fully-modular-psu-white.js','Power Supply',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:03');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3260,'8209876975669','msi-mag-a650bnl-650w-80-plus-bronze-gaming-psu','MSI MAG A650BNL 650W 80 PLUS Bronze Gaming PSU',replace('<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Power your gaming PC with the </span><strong><span>MSI MAG A650BNL 650W Power Supply</span></strong><span>, featuring </span><strong><span>80 PLUS Bronze efficiency, Active PFC, a 120mm Hydro Bearing fan and dual PCIe 6+2-pin connectors</span></strong><span>. A reliable choice for compatible gaming and performance PC builds.</span></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Give your gaming PC reliable power with the </span><strong><span>MSI MAG A650BNL 650W 80 PLUS Bronze Power Supply</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Designed for gaming and everyday performance systems, the MAG A650BNL delivers </span><strong><span>650 watts of power</span></strong><span> with an </span><strong><span>80 PLUS Bronze efficiency rating of up to 85%</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Cooling is handled by a </span><strong><span>120mm Hydro Bearing fan</span></strong><span>, while Active PFC helps provide efficient power delivery.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The PSU includes </span><strong><span>2× PCIe 6+2-pin connectors</span></strong><span>, making it suitable for compatible dedicated graphics cards, along with two EPS 4+4-pin CPU connectors and multiple SATA and peripheral connections.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>MSI also equips the A650BNL with electrical protection features including </span><strong><span>OCP, OVP, OPP and SCP</span></strong><span>, providing additional protection for your PC hardware.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For gamers building a mid-range gaming system, the MSI MAG A650BNL offers an excellent combination of branded reliability, useful connectivity and 650W capacity.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Key Features</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• 650W Total Power</span><br><span>• 80 PLUS Bronze Certified</span><br><span>• Up to 85% Efficiency</span><br><span>• Active PFC Design</span><br><span>• 120mm Hydro Bearing Fan</span><br><span>• 2× PCIe 6+2-Pin Connectors</span><br><span>• 2× EPS 4+4-Pin CPU Connectors</span><br><span>• 5× SATA Connectors</span><br><span>• Flat Cable Design</span><br><span>• Multiple Electrical Protections</span><br><span>• Ideal for Gaming &amp; Performance PCs</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> MSI</span><br><strong><span>Series:</span></strong><span> MAG</span><br><strong><span>Model:</span></strong><span> MAG A650BNL</span><br><strong><span>Power Output:</span></strong><span> 650W</span><br><strong><span>Efficiency Rating:</span></strong><span> 80 PLUS Bronze – Up to 85%</span><br><strong><span>Modular:</span></strong><span> No / Non-Modular</span><br><strong><span>PFC:</span></strong><span> Active PFC</span><br><strong><span>Fan Size:</span></strong><span> 120mm</span><br><strong><span>Fan Bearing:</span></strong><span> Hydro Bearing</span><br><strong><span>Input Voltage:</span></strong><span> 100–240V</span><br><strong><span>Input Frequency:</span></strong><span> 50–60Hz</span><br><strong><span>Dimensions:</span></strong><span> 150 × 140 × 86mm</span></p>\n<h3><span>Connectors</span></h3>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>ATX 24-Pin:</span></strong><span> 1</span><br><strong><span>EPS 4+4-Pin:</span></strong><span> 2</span><br><strong><span>PCIe 6+2-Pin:</span></strong><span> 2</span><br><strong><span>SATA 15-Pin:</span></strong><span> 5</span><br><strong><span>Molex 4-Pin:</span></strong><span> 2</span><br><strong><span>FDD 4-Pin:</span></strong><span> 1</span></p>\n<h3><span>Protection</span></h3>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• OCP – Over Current Protection</span><br><span>• OVP – Over Voltage Protection</span><br><span>• OPP – Over Power Protection</span><br><span>• SCP – Short Circuit Protection</span></p>\n<h2><span>Gaming Performance</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>With </span><strong><span>650W capacity and two PCIe 6+2-pin connectors</span></strong><span>, the MAG A650BNL is designed to accommodate compatible dedicated graphics cards and gaming configurations.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>It is a strong PSU option for customers building a balanced gaming PC where a quality branded power supply is preferred over generic or system-pulled alternatives.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Always check the recommended PSU wattage and connector requirements of your specific graphics card before installation.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Why Choose MSI MAG A650BNL?</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The A650BNL combines:</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Branded MSI quality</span><br><span>• 650W power capacity</span><br><span>• 80 PLUS Bronze efficiency</span><br><span>• Hydro Bearing cooling fan</span><br><span>• Active PFC</span><br><span>• Multiple protection features</span><br><span>• Gaming GPU power connectivity</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>This makes it a practical choice for new gaming PC builds and PSU upgrades.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Before purchasing, confirm the power requirements of your </span><strong><span>CPU, graphics card and complete PC configuration</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p><span>Some high-performance GPUs may require more wattage, additional PCIe connectors or newer GPU power connectors.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),14499,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/msi-mag-a650bnl-bronze-psu-price-in-pakistan-1-19643-0-161024082749852.jpg?v=1786296355','https://sakoonsay.com/products/msi-mag-a650bn