ctedEnd"><span>Exact cosmetic condition can vary from unit to unit within the mixed lot.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Important – Fans Not Included</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>This listing does not include case cooling fans.</span></strong></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Compatible fans can be installed separately where supported by the selected case.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For gaming PCs, adding suitable intake and exhaust fans is recommended to improve airflow and component cooling.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Mixed Lot Notice</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Pictures may be representative of available stock.</span></strong></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Because these cases are sold from a mixed lot, the </span><strong><span>brand, design, size, front panel, USB ports, internal layout and component clearance may vary</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>If you need a case for a specific motherboard, graphics card, PSU or CPU cooler, please confirm compatibility before ordering.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Before purchasing, confirm the selected case supports your:</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Motherboard form factor</span><br><span>• Power supply size</span><br><span>• Graphics card dimensions</span><br><span>• CPU cooler height</span><br><span>• Storage drives</span><br><span>• Required case fan sizes</span></p>\n<h2><span>Meta Description</span></h2>\n<p><span>Buy used desktop PC cases from mixed stock in normal condition without fans. Affordable chassis for budget gaming, office and custom PC builds.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),3000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/1000862326-510x542.jpg?v=1786269323','https://sakoonsay.com/products/used-desktop-pc-case-mixed-lot-without-fans-normal-condition.js','PC Case',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:13');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3388,'8209098440757','8gb-ddr3-desktop-ram-used-system-pulled-pc-memory','8GB DDR3 1600MHz Desktop RAM – Used System Pulled | Price in Pakistan',replace('<h2>8GB DDR3 1600MHz Desktop RAM in Pakistan</h2>\n<p>Upgrade a compatible older desktop computer with <strong>8GB DDR3 desktop RAM</strong>. This module is suitable for everyday computing, office work, browsing, media use, repairs and budget PC upgrades.</p>\n\n<h2>Product Highlights</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Capacity:</strong> 8GB</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Memory type:</strong> DDR3</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Speed:</strong> 1600MHz (PC3-12800), subject to the exact available module</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Form factor:</strong> Desktop DIMM</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Condition:</strong> Used / system pulled</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Current price:</strong> Rs. 3,500</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Compatibility</h2>\n<p>This RAM is for desktop motherboards that support DDR3 memory and an 8GB module. DDR3 is not compatible with DDR4 or DDR5 slots. Before ordering, confirm your motherboard model, supported RAM generation and maximum capacity.</p>\n\n<h2>Condition and Stock Note</h2>\n<p>This is <strong>used system-pulled RAM</strong>, not brand-new retail memory. Brand, PCB appearance, timings and exact module specifications may vary with available stock. If you need a specific brand or frequency, please confirm before ordering. Each module should be tested for compatibility and working condition before dispatch.</p>\n\n<h2>Who should buy it?</h2>\n<p>It is a practical, affordable option for customers upgrading an older DDR3 desktop PC from 2GB or 4GB RAM, repairing a system, or building a budget office and home computer.</p>\n\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<h3>Is this RAM compatible with DDR4?</h3>\n<p>No. DDR3, DDR4 and DDR5 use different slots and are not interchangeable.</p>\n<h3>Is this RAM new?</h3>\n<p>No. It is listed as used/system pulled memory.</p>\n<h3>Will it work in every desktop PC?</h3>\n<p>It will work only in a compatible DDR3 desktop motherboard that supports the module capacity and speed.</p>','\n',char(10)),3500,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/8GB-DDR3-RAM-1600Mhz.webp?v=1786225498','https://sakoonsay.com/products/8gb-ddr3-desktop-ram-used-system-pulled-pc-memory.js','Ram',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:16');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3392,'8209098145845','8gb-ddr4-3200mhz-desktop-ram-system-pulled-memory','8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM – System Pulled | Price in Pakistan',replace('<h2>8GB DDR4 3200MHz Desktop RAM in Pakistan</h2>\n<p>Upgrade a compatible desktop computer with <strong>8GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM</strong> for smoother everyday performance, gaming, multitasking and office work. This system-pulled memory is an affordable option for supported Intel and AMD DDR4 desktop platforms.</p>\n\n<h2>Product Highlights</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Capacity:</strong> 8GB</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Memory type:</strong> DDR4</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Rated speed:</strong> 3200MHz</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Form factor:</strong> Desktop DIMM</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Condition:</strong> Used / system pulled</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Current price:</strong> Rs. 10,500</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Performance and Use</h2>\n<p>An 8GB module is suitable for everyday computing, office applications, browsing and entry-level gaming. For modern gaming and heavier multitasking, two compatible 8GB modules with 16GB total memory may provide a better experience where supported.</p>\n\n<h2>Compatibility</h2>\n<p>Your motherboard and processor must support DDR4 desktop memory. DDR4 is not compatible with DDR3 or DDR5 slots. Although the module is rated at 3200MHz, actual operating speed depends on the CPU, motherboard and BIOS settings and may be lower on some systems.</p>\n\n<h2>Condition and Stock Note</h2>\n<p>This is <strong>system-pulled memory</strong>, not brand-new retail RAM. Manufacturer, model, PCB appearance, timings and cosmetic condition may vary according to available stock. If you require a specific brand or exact model, please confirm before ordering.</p>\n\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<h3>Is this RAM compatible with DDR3?</h3>\n<p>No. DDR3 and DDR4 use different slots and are not interchangeable.</p>\n<h3>Is 8GB enough for gaming?</h3>\n<p>It is suitable for basic and entry-level gaming, but 16GB is generally recommended for modern games and multitasking.</p>\n<h3>Will it always run at 3200MHz?</h3>\n<p>No. The actual speed depends on the supported specifications of the motherboard, processor and BIOS configuration.</p>','\n',char(10)),10500,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/8GB-DDR4-RAM-3200Mhz-SYSTEM-PULLED-1-600x600-1.jpg?v=1786224858','https://sakoonsay.com/products/8gb-ddr4-3200mhz-desktop-ram-system-pulled-memory.js','Ram',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:20');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3393,'8209097556021','colorful-h510-lga1200-10th-11th-gen-ddr4-motherboard','Colorful H510 LGA1200 10th/11th Gen DDR4 Motherboard',replace('<p>Build or upgrade a compatible Intel or AMD desktop PC with the <strong>Colorful H510 LGA1200 10th/11th Gen DDR4 motherboard</strong>. This listing is aimed at Pakistan buyers who need a clear platform match for their processor, DDR memory, graphics card and storage. Confirm the exact model and revision before ordering because motherboard features can vary by revision.</p>\n<h2>Specifications</h2>\n<table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Chipset</th>\n<td>Intel H510</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>CPU socket</th>\n<td>LGA1200</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Memory</th>\n<td>DDR4; Model-dependent; dual-channel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Form factor</th>\n<td>Model-dependent Micro-ATX</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Expansion and storage</th>\n<td>PCIe x16 graphics expansion and M.2/SATA storage vary by model</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Condition</th>\n<td>As listed; confirm exact stock condition</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>Compatibility guidance</h2>\n<p>10th/11th Gen Intel support depends on exact board revision and BIOS. Do not choose a motherboard by socket name alone: chipset generation, board revision, BIOS version and memory type must also match. DDR3, DDR4 and DDR5 are not interchangeable. Check your case clearance, power connectors, RAM kit, M.2/SATA interface and graphics-card clearance before purchase.</p>\n<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>\n<h3>Which processor works with this motherboard?</h3>\n<p>10th/11th Gen Intel support depends on exact board revision and BIOS. Check the manufacturer CPU support list and BIOS requirement for the exact revision.</p>\n<h3>Can I use DDR3 or DDR5 RAM?</h3>\n<p>No. Use only DDR4 memory supported by this board. Desktop RAM generations are not interchangeable.</p>\n<h3>Can I install a dedicated graphics card?</h3>\n<p>Yes, the listing includes PCIe graphics expansion. Confirm the slot, case clearance and power-supply requirements of your chosen GPU.</p>\n<h3>Will an M.2 SSD work?</h3>\n<p>PCIe x16 graphics expansion and M.2/SATA storage vary by model. Confirm whether your specific SSD is PCIe/NVMe or SATA and check the board''s manual before ordering.</p>\n<p>For help matching a processor, RAM kit or graphics card, contact SakoonSay Gaming Store in Faisalabad before purchase.</p>','\n',char(10)),15000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/H510-11TH-GEN-MOTHERBOARD-BIOSTAR-H510MHP-MICRO-ATX-3.png?v=1786224410','https://sakoonsay.com/products/colorful-h510-lga1200-10th-11th-gen-ddr4-motherboard.js','Intel Motherboard',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:20');
