 Desktop RAM generations are not interchangeable.</p>\n<h3>Can I install a dedicated graphics card?</h3>\n<p>Yes, the listing includes PCIe graphics expansion. Confirm the slot, case clearance and power-supply requirements of your chosen GPU.</p>\n<h3>Will an M.2 SSD work?</h3>\n<p>PCIe x16 graphics expansion; SATA storage. Confirm whether your specific SSD is PCIe/NVMe or SATA and check the board''s manual before ordering.</p>\n<p>For help matching a processor, RAM kit or graphics card, contact SakoonSay Gaming Store in Faisalabad before purchase.</p>','\n',char(10)),11000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/H310-8-9TH-GEN-MOTHERBOARD-BIOSTAR-H310MHP-MICRO-ATX-1.png?v=1786223986','https://sakoonsay.com/products/biostar-h310mhp-h310-8th-9th-gen-lga1151-ddr4-motherboard.js','Intel Motherboard',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:20');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3396,'8209088512053','intel-core-i5-6500-6th-gen-3-20ghz-lga1151-processor','Intel Core i5-6500 6th Gen 3.20GHz LGA1151 Processor',replace('<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Upgrade your Intel PC with the </span><strong><span>Core i5-6500 6th Gen Processor</span></strong><span>. Featuring </span><strong><span>4 cores, up to 3.60GHz Turbo frequency, 6MB Intel Smart Cache and Intel HD Graphics 530</span></strong><span>, it delivers reliable performance for office work, everyday computing and affordable gaming builds.</span></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Intel Core i5-6500</span></strong><span> is a 6th Generation Skylake desktop processor designed to provide dependable performance for gaming, office work and everyday computing.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Featuring </span><strong><span>4 physical cores and 4 threads</span></strong><span>, the i5-6500 delivers responsive performance for general multitasking, web browsing, productivity applications and lighter gaming workloads.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The processor operates at a </span><strong><span>3.20GHz base frequency</span></strong><span> and can reach up to </span><strong><span>3.60GHz Max Turbo Frequency</span></strong><span>, providing additional processing performance when applications require it.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Built-in </span><strong><span>Intel HD Graphics 530</span></strong><span> allows compatible systems to provide display output without requiring a dedicated graphics card. For gaming, pairing the processor with a dedicated NVIDIA GeForce or AMD Radeon GPU provides significantly stronger graphics performance.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Using the </span><strong><span>LGA1151 socket</span></strong><span>, the Core i5-6500 is a practical replacement or upgrade processor for compatible 6th Gen Intel systems.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Performance Highlights</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Intel Core i5 6th Generation</span><br><span>• Skylake architecture</span><br><span>• 4 Cores / 4 Threads</span><br><span>• 3.20GHz Base Frequency</span><br><span>• Up to 3.60GHz Turbo Frequency</span><br><span>• 6MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><span>• Intel HD Graphics 530</span><br><span>• LGA1151 Socket</span><br><span>• DDR4 / DDR3L memory support</span><br><span>• 65W TDP</span><br><span>• Reliable everyday performance</span><br><span>• Suitable for budget gaming PCs</span><br><span>• Great for office and home systems</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> Intel</span><br><strong><span>Model:</span></strong><span> Core i5-6500</span><br><strong><span>Generation:</span></strong><span> 6th Gen</span><br><strong><span>Architecture:</span></strong><span> Skylake</span><br><strong><span>Cores:</span></strong><span> 4</span><br><strong><span>Threads:</span></strong><span> 4</span><br><strong><span>Base Frequency:</span></strong><span> 3.20GHz</span><br><strong><span>Max Turbo Frequency:</span></strong><span> Up to 3.60GHz</span><br><strong><span>Cache:</span></strong><span> 6MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><strong><span>Socket:</span></strong><span> LGA1151</span><br><strong><span>Integrated Graphics:</span></strong><span> Intel HD Graphics 530</span><br><strong><span>Memory Support:</span></strong><span> DDR4 / DDR3L</span><br><strong><span>TDP:</span></strong><span> 65W</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Budget Gaming, Office, Home &amp; Everyday Computing</span></p>\n<h2><span>Gaming Performance</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Core i5-6500</span></strong><span> can provide a cost-effective foundation for entry-level gaming when paired with a suitable dedicated graphics card.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For a balanced older-generation gaming build, combine it with </span><strong><span>8GB–16GB RAM, an SSD and an appropriate dedicated GPU</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>It is best suited to esports, lighter games and older titles. For demanding modern games, a newer 6-core or higher processor is recommended.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The Core i5-6500 uses the </span><strong><span>LGA1151 socket</span></strong><span> and is designed for compatible Intel 100-series motherboards such as H110, B150, H170 and Z170.</span></p>\n<p><span>Socket type alone does not guarantee compatibility, so always verify the exact motherboard model and BIOS support before purchase.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),6000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/intel-core-i5-6500-6th-generation-processor_1.jpg?v=1786223457','https://sakoonsay.com/products/intel-core-i5-6500-6th-gen-3-20ghz-lga1151-processor.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:20');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3397,'8209088184373','intel-core-i5-10400f-10th-gen-2-90ghz-lga1200-processor','Intel Core i5-10400F 10th Gen 2.90GHz LGA1200 Processor',replace('<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Build a powerful value-focused gaming PC with the </span><strong><span>Intel Core i5-10400F 10th Gen Processor</span></strong><span>. Featuring </span><strong><span>6 cores, 12 threads, up to 4.30GHz Turbo frequency and 12MB Intel Smart Cache</span></strong><span>, it delivers excellent gaming and multitasking performance when paired with a dedicated graphics card.</span></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Intel Core i5-10400F</span></strong><span> is a 10th Generation Comet Lake desktop processor offering an excellent combination of gaming performance, multitasking capability and value.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Featuring </span><strong><span>6 cores and 12 threads</span></strong><span>, the i5-10400F supports Intel Hyper-Threading Technology, giving it significantly stronger multitasking capability than older 6-core/6-thread Core i5 processors.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The processor operates at a </span><strong><span>2.90GHz base frequency</span></strong><span> and can reach up to </span><strong><span>4.30GHz Max Turbo Frequency</span></strong><span>, providing responsive performance for gaming, productivity and everyday workloads.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>With </span><strong><span>12MB Intel Smart Cache</span></strong><span> and DDR4 memory support, the i5-10400F is an excellent foundation for affordable gaming PCs equipped with a dedicated graphics card.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Important: Dedicated Graphics Card Required</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>“F” designation means the Intel Core i5-10400F does not include integrated graphics</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>A dedicated </span><strong><span>NVIDIA GeForce or AMD Radeon graphics card is required for display output</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>If you need built-in graphics, consider the standard </span><strong><span>Core i5-10400</span></strong><span> instead.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Performance Highlights</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Intel Core i5 10th Generation</span><br><span>• Comet Lake architecture</span><br><span>• 6 Cores / 12 Threads</span><br><span>• Intel Hyper-Threading Technology</span><br><span>• 2.90GHz Base Frequency</span><br><span>• Up to 4.30GHz Max Turbo Frequency</span><br><span>• 12MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><span>• LGA1200 Socket</span><br><span>• DDR4 memory support</span><br><span>• 65W TDP</span><br><span>• Excellent value for gaming</span><br><span>• Strong multitasking performance</span><br><span>• Ideal for dedicated-GPU gaming PCs</span><br><span>• No integrated graphics</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> Intel</span><br><strong><span>Model:</span></strong><span> Core i5-10400F</span><br><strong><span>Generation:</span></strong><span> 10th Gen</span><br><strong><span>Architecture:</span></strong><span> Comet Lake</span><br><strong><span>Cores:</span></strong><span> 6</span><br><strong><span>Threads:</span></strong><span> 12</span><br><strong><span>Base Frequency:</span></strong><span> 2.90GHz</span><br><strong><span>Max Turbo Frequency:</span></strong><span> Up to 4.30GHz</span><br><strong><span>Cache:</span></strong><span> 12MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><strong><span>Socket:</span></strong><span> LGA1200</span><br><strong><span>Integrated Graphics:</span></strong><span> No</span><br><strong><span>Dedicated GPU Required:</span></strong><span> Yes</span><br><strong><span>Memory Type:</span></strong><span> DDR4</span><br><strong><span>TDP:</span></strong><span> 65W</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Gaming, Multitasking &amp; Productivity</span></p>\n<h2><span>Gaming Performance</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Core i5-10400F</span></strong><span> is an excellent choice for an affordable gaming PC thanks to its </span><strong><span>6-core, 12-thread configuration</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Pair it with </span><strong><span>16GB DDR4 RAM, an SSD and a suitable NVIDIA GeForce or AMD Radeon graphics card</span></strong><span> for a balanced 1080p gaming setup.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Its 12 threads also make it a better multitasking option than many older Core i5 processors, particularly for users who run games alongside Discord, browsers and other background applications.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The Core i5-10400F uses the </span><strong><span>LGA1200 socket</span></strong><span> and requires a compatible Intel 400-series motherboard such as supported </span><strong><span>H410, B460, H470 or Z490</span></strong><span> models.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>It is not compatible with older LGA1151 motherboards.</span></p>\n<p><span>Always verify the exact motherboard model and BIOS compatibility before purchase.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),24000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/intel-core-i5-10400f-10th-generation-processor-tray-packed.jpg?v=1786223161','https://sakoonsay.com/products/intel-core-i5-10400f-10th-gen-2-90ghz-lga1200-processor.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:20');
