 provide display output without a dedicated graphics card when paired with a compatible motherboard.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For gaming, simply add a suitable NVIDIA GeForce or AMD Radeon graphics card for significantly stronger graphics performance.</span></p>\n<h3><span>Performance Highlights</span></h3>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Intel Core i5 10th Generation</span><br><span>• Comet Lake architecture</span><br><span>• 6 Cores / 12 Threads</span><br><span>• Intel Hyper-Threading Technology</span><br><span>• 2.90GHz Base Frequency</span><br><span>• Up to 4.30GHz Max Turbo Frequency</span><br><span>• 12MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><span>• Intel UHD Graphics 630</span><br><span>• LGA1200 Socket</span><br><span>• DDR4 memory support</span><br><span>• 65W TDP</span><br><span>• Strong gaming performance</span><br><span>• Excellent multitasking capability</span><br><span>• Great value for gaming and productivity PCs</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> Intel</span><br><strong><span>Model:</span></strong><span> Core i5-10400</span><br><strong><span>Generation:</span></strong><span> 10th Gen</span><br><strong><span>Architecture:</span></strong><span> Comet Lake</span><br><strong><span>Cores:</span></strong><span> 6</span><br><strong><span>Threads:</span></strong><span> 12</span><br><strong><span>Base Frequency:</span></strong><span> 2.90GHz</span><br><strong><span>Max Turbo Frequency:</span></strong><span> Up to 4.30GHz</span><br><strong><span>Cache:</span></strong><span> 12MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><strong><span>Socket:</span></strong><span> LGA1200</span><br><strong><span>Integrated Graphics:</span></strong><span> Intel UHD Graphics 630</span><br><strong><span>Memory Type:</span></strong><span> DDR4</span><br><strong><span>TDP:</span></strong><span> 65W</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Gaming, Multitasking, Office &amp; Productivity</span></p>\n<h2><span>Gaming Performance</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Core i5-10400</span></strong><span> is an excellent value option for a budget or mid-range gaming PC.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Its </span><strong><span>6-core, 12-thread design</span></strong><span> gives it enough processing capability for gaming while running background applications, making it a notable improvement over older 6-core/6-thread Core i5 processors.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Pair it with </span><strong><span>16GB DDR4 RAM, an SSD and a suitable dedicated GPU</span></strong><span> for a balanced 1080p gaming setup.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The Core i5-10400 uses the </span><strong><span>LGA1200 socket</span></strong><span> and requires a compatible Intel 400-series motherboard, such as supported </span><strong><span>H410, B460, H470 or Z490</span></strong><span> models.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>It is not compatible with older LGA1151 motherboards.</span></p>\n<p><span>Always verify the exact motherboard model and BIOS compatibility before purchase.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),26000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/intel-core-i5-10400-10th-gen-processor-tray-packed.jpg?v=1786223050','https://sakoonsay.com/products/intel-core-i5-10400-10th-gen-2-90ghz-lga1200-processor.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:20');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3399,'8209087692853','intel-core-i5-9600kf-9th-gen-3-70ghz-lga1151-unlocked-processor','Intel Core i5-9600KF 9th Gen 3.70GHz LGA1151 Unlocked Processor',replace('<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Power your gaming PC with the </span><strong><span>Intel Core i5-9600KF 9th Gen Processor</span></strong><span>. Featuring </span><strong><span>6 cores, up to 4.60GHz Turbo frequency and an unlocked multiplier</span></strong><span>, it delivers strong gaming performance with overclocking capability. A dedicated graphics card is required.</span></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Intel Core i5-9600KF</span></strong><span> is a 9th Generation Coffee Lake Refresh desktop processor designed for gamers and performance-focused PC builders.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Featuring </span><strong><span>6 physical cores and 6 threads</span></strong><span>, the i5-9600KF delivers strong single-core performance for gaming and responsive everyday computing.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>It operates at a </span><strong><span>3.70GHz base frequency</span></strong><span> and can reach up to </span><strong><span>4.60GHz Max Turbo Frequency</span></strong><span>, giving it significantly higher clock speeds than many standard 9th Gen Core i5 processors.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>“K” designation means the processor has an unlocked multiplier</span></strong><span>, allowing CPU overclocking when paired with a suitable motherboard, cooling solution and system configuration.</span></p>\n<h3><span>Important: Dedicated Graphics Card Required</span></h3>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>“F” designation means the i5-9600KF does not include integrated graphics</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>A dedicated </span><strong><span>NVIDIA GeForce or AMD Radeon graphics card is required</span></strong><span> for display output.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>This makes the i5-9600KF particularly suitable for gaming systems where a dedicated graphics card will already be installed.</span></p>\n<h3><span>Performance Highlights</span></h3>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Intel Core i5 9th Generation</span><br><span>• Coffee Lake Refresh architecture</span><br><span>• 6 Cores / 6 Threads</span><br><span>• 3.70GHz Base Frequency</span><br><span>• Up to 4.60GHz Turbo Frequency</span><br><span>• 9MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><span>• Unlocked multiplier</span><br><span>• Overclocking capable</span><br><span>• LGA1151 Socket</span><br><span>• DDR4 memory support</span><br><span>• 95W TDP</span><br><span>• Strong single-core gaming performance</span><br><span>• Ideal for dedicated-GPU gaming PCs</span><br><span>• No integrated graphics</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> Intel</span><br><strong><span>Model:</span></strong><span> Core i5-9600KF</span><br><strong><span>Generation:</span></strong><span> 9th Gen</span><br><strong><span>Architecture:</span></strong><span> Coffee Lake Refresh</span><br><strong><span>Cores:</span></strong><span> 6</span><br><strong><span>Threads:</span></strong><span> 6</span><br><strong><span>Base Frequency:</span></strong><span> 3.70GHz</span><br><strong><span>Max Turbo Frequency:</span></strong><span> Up to 4.60GHz</span><br><strong><span>Cache:</span></strong><span> 9MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><strong><span>Socket:</span></strong><span> LGA1151</span><br><strong><span>Multiplier:</span></strong><span> Unlocked</span><br><strong><span>Integrated Graphics:</span></strong><span> No</span><br><strong><span>Dedicated GPU Required:</span></strong><span> Yes</span><br><strong><span>Memory Type:</span></strong><span> DDR4</span><br><strong><span>TDP:</span></strong><span> 95W</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Gaming &amp; Performance PC Builds</span></p>\n<h2><span>Gaming Performance</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Core i5-9600KF</span></strong><span> is a strong option for affordable performance-focused gaming builds thanks to its </span><strong><span>high clock speeds and 6 physical cores</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Pair it with </span><strong><span>16GB DDR4 RAM, an SSD and a capable dedicated graphics card</span></strong><span> for a responsive 1080p gaming setup.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Compared with the </span><strong><span>Core i5-9400F</span></strong><span>, the i5-9600KF provides substantially higher base and Turbo frequencies and an unlocked multiplier, making it the better performance-oriented choice when the additional cost is reasonable.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Overclocking</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The i5-9600KF is an </span><strong><span>unlocked processor</span></strong><span>, but CPU overclocking requires a compatible motherboard chipset, typically a suitable </span><strong><span>Z-series motherboard</span></strong><span>, along with adequate CPU cooling.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The Core i5-9600KF uses the </span><strong><span>LGA1151 socket</span></strong><span> and requires a compatible Intel 300-series motherboard.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>It is not compatible with older 100- or 200-series LGA1151 motherboards designed for Intel 6th and 7th Gen processors.</span></p>\n<p><span>Always confirm the exact motherboard and BIOS compatibility before purchase.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),20000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/s-l400.jpg?v=1786222892','https://sakoonsay.com/products/intel-core-i5-9600kf-9th-gen-3-70ghz-lga1151-unlocked-processor.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:23');
