></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>A compatible dedicated </span><strong><span>NVIDIA GeForce or AMD Radeon graphics card is required</span></strong><span> to get display output from a PC using this processor.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>This makes the i5-9400F particularly suitable for gaming systems where a dedicated GPU will already be installed.</span></p>\n<h3><span>Performance Highlights</span></h3>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Intel Core i5 9th Generation</span><br><span>• Coffee Lake Refresh architecture</span><br><span>• 6 Cores / 6 Threads</span><br><span>• 2.90GHz Base Frequency</span><br><span>• Up to 4.10GHz Turbo Frequency</span><br><span>• 9MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><span>• LGA1151 Socket</span><br><span>• DDR4 memory support</span><br><span>• 65W TDP</span><br><span>• Strong budget gaming performance</span><br><span>• Good everyday multitasking performance</span><br><span>• Ideal for dedicated-GPU gaming PCs</span><br><span>• No integrated graphics</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> Intel</span><br><strong><span>Model:</span></strong><span> Core i5-9400F</span><br><strong><span>Generation:</span></strong><span> 9th Gen</span><br><strong><span>Architecture:</span></strong><span> Coffee Lake Refresh</span><br><strong><span>Cores:</span></strong><span> 6</span><br><strong><span>Threads:</span></strong><span> 6</span><br><strong><span>Base Frequency:</span></strong><span> 2.90GHz</span><br><strong><span>Max Turbo Frequency:</span></strong><span> Up to 4.10GHz</span><br><strong><span>Cache:</span></strong><span> 9MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><strong><span>Socket:</span></strong><span> LGA1151</span><br><strong><span>Integrated Graphics:</span></strong><span> No</span><br><strong><span>Dedicated GPU Required:</span></strong><span> Yes</span><br><strong><span>Memory Type:</span></strong><span> DDR4</span><br><strong><span>TDP:</span></strong><span> 65W</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Gaming, Everyday Computing &amp; Productivity</span></p>\n<h2><span>Gaming Performance</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Core i5-9400F</span></strong><span> is a solid choice for an affordable 1080p gaming PC. Its </span><strong><span>6 physical cores and up to 4.10GHz Turbo frequency</span></strong><span> provide enough CPU performance for many esports and mainstream gaming workloads.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For a balanced setup, pair it with </span><strong><span>16GB DDR4 RAM, an SSD and a suitable dedicated graphics card</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For customers choosing between older quad-core processors and the i5-9400F, the </span><strong><span>6-core design makes the i5-9400F a more attractive gaming platform</span></strong><span> when the total build cost is reasonable.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The Core i5-9400F uses the </span><strong><span>LGA1151 socket</span></strong><span> and requires a compatible </span><strong><span>Intel 300-series motherboard</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>It is not compatible with older 100- or 200-series LGA1151 motherboards designed for 6th and 7th Gen Intel processors.</span></p>\n<p><span>Always confirm the exact motherboard model and BIOS support before purchase.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),18000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/2145-front-2603-2177683-240824104502547.jpg?v=1786222753','https://sakoonsay.com/products/intel-core-i5-9400f-9th-gen-2-90ghz-lga1151-processor.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:23');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3401,'8209087397941','intel-core-i5-8500-8th-gen-3-00ghz-lga1151-processor','Intel Core i5-8500 8th Gen 3.00GHz LGA1151 Processor',replace('<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Build a capable gaming or productivity PC with the </span><strong><span>Intel Core i5-8500 8th Gen Processor</span></strong><span>. Featuring </span><strong><span>6 cores, up to 4.10GHz Turbo frequency and Intel UHD Graphics 630</span></strong><span>, it delivers solid performance for 1080p gaming, multitasking, office work and everyday computing.</span></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Intel Core i5-8500</span></strong><span> is an 8th Generation Coffee Lake desktop processor offering an excellent balance between performance, power efficiency and value.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Featuring </span><strong><span>6 physical cores and 6 threads</span></strong><span>, the i5-8500 provides significantly stronger multi-core capability than older quad-core Core i5 processors. This makes it a practical choice for gaming, multitasking and productivity systems.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The processor operates at a </span><strong><span>3.00GHz base frequency</span></strong><span> and can reach up to </span><strong><span>4.10GHz Max Turbo Frequency</span></strong><span>, providing responsive performance in games and demanding everyday applications.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Integrated </span><strong><span>Intel UHD Graphics 630</span></strong><span> provides display functionality without requiring a dedicated graphics card when paired with a compatible motherboard. For gaming, adding a dedicated NVIDIA GeForce or AMD Radeon GPU provides significantly better performance.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>With its </span><strong><span>LGA1151 socket and 65W TDP</span></strong><span>, the i5-8500 is an excellent upgrade option for customers who already own a compatible Intel 300-series motherboard.</span></p>\n<h3><span>Performance Highlights</span></h3>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Intel Core i5 8th Generation</span><br><span>• Coffee Lake architecture</span><br><span>• 6 Cores / 6 Threads</span><br><span>• 3.00GHz Base Frequency</span><br><span>• Up to 4.10GHz Turbo Frequency</span><br><span>• 9MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><span>• Intel UHD Graphics 630</span><br><span>• LGA1151 Socket</span><br><span>• DDR4 memory support</span><br><span>• 65W TDP</span><br><span>• Strong everyday performance</span><br><span>• Good 1080p gaming potential with dedicated GPU</span><br><span>• Great for multitasking and productivity</span><br><span>• Excellent value for compatible 300-series systems</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> Intel</span><br><strong><span>Model:</span></strong><span> Core i5-8500</span><br><strong><span>Generation:</span></strong><span> 8th Gen</span><br><strong><span>Architecture:</span></strong><span> Coffee Lake</span><br><strong><span>Cores:</span></strong><span> 6</span><br><strong><span>Threads:</span></strong><span> 6</span><br><strong><span>Base Frequency:</span></strong><span> 3.00GHz</span><br><strong><span>Max Turbo Frequency:</span></strong><span> Up to 4.10GHz</span><br><strong><span>Cache:</span></strong><span> 9MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><strong><span>Socket:</span></strong><span> LGA1151</span><br><strong><span>Integrated Graphics:</span></strong><span> Intel UHD Graphics 630</span><br><strong><span>Memory Type:</span></strong><span> DDR4</span><br><strong><span>TDP:</span></strong><span> 65W</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Gaming, Office, Home &amp; Productivity</span></p>\n<h2><span>Gaming Performance</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Core i5-8500</span></strong><span> remains a solid option for budget gaming systems thanks to its </span><strong><span>6 physical cores and up to 4.10GHz Turbo frequency</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Pair it with </span><strong><span>16GB DDR4 RAM, an SSD and a suitable dedicated graphics card</span></strong><span> for a balanced 1080p gaming PC.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Compared with the i5-8400, the i5-8500 offers slightly higher base and Turbo clock speeds, making it the better choice when both processors are available at a similar price.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The Core i5-8500 requires a compatible </span><strong><span>Intel 300-series LGA1151 motherboard</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Despite using LGA1151, it is </span><strong><span>not compatible with older 100- or 200-series motherboards</span></strong><span> designed for Intel 6th and 7th Gen processors.</span></p>\n<p><span>Always verify the exact motherboard model and BIOS compatibility before purchase.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),16000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/intel-core-i5-8500-8th-generation-processor.jpg?v=1786222578','https://sakoonsay.com/products/intel-core-i5-8500-8th-gen-3-00ghz-lga1151-processor.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:23');
