onger performance.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The Core i5-8400 uses the </span><strong><span>LGA1151 socket</span></strong><span> and is designed for compatible Intel 300-series motherboards.</span></p>\n<h3><span>Performance Highlights</span></h3>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Intel Core i5 8th Generation</span><br><span>• Coffee Lake architecture</span><br><span>• 6 Cores / 6 Threads</span><br><span>• 2.80GHz Base Frequency</span><br><span>• Up to 4.00GHz Turbo Frequency</span><br><span>• 9MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><span>• Intel UHD Graphics 630</span><br><span>• LGA1151 Socket</span><br><span>• DDR4 memory support</span><br><span>• 65W TDP</span><br><span>• Solid gaming performance</span><br><span>• Good multitasking capability</span><br><span>• Great for budget gaming PCs</span><br><span>• Excellent upgrade for compatible 300-series systems</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> Intel</span><br><strong><span>Model:</span></strong><span> Core i5-8400</span><br><strong><span>Generation:</span></strong><span> 8th Gen</span><br><strong><span>Architecture:</span></strong><span> Coffee Lake</span><br><strong><span>Cores:</span></strong><span> 6</span><br><strong><span>Threads:</span></strong><span> 6</span><br><strong><span>Base Frequency:</span></strong><span> 2.80GHz</span><br><strong><span>Max Turbo Frequency:</span></strong><span> Up to 4.00GHz</span><br><strong><span>Cache:</span></strong><span> 9MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><strong><span>Socket:</span></strong><span> LGA1151</span><br><strong><span>Integrated Graphics:</span></strong><span> Intel UHD Graphics 630</span><br><strong><span>Memory Type:</span></strong><span> DDR4</span><br><strong><span>TDP:</span></strong><span> 65W</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Gaming, Office, Home &amp; Productivity</span></p>\n<h2><span>Gaming Performance</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Core i5-8400</span></strong><span> is a solid option for an affordable gaming PC thanks to its </span><strong><span>6 physical cores and up to 4.00GHz Turbo frequency</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Pair it with </span><strong><span>16GB DDR4 RAM, an SSD and a balanced dedicated graphics card</span></strong><span> for a capable 1080p gaming setup.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For customers upgrading from older 2nd, 3rd, 4th or 6th Gen quad-core i5 processors, the i5-8400 provides additional CPU cores and improved overall platform performance.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Although the Core i5-8400 uses the </span><strong><span>LGA1151 socket</span></strong><span>, it is </span><strong><span>not compatible with older 100- and 200-series LGA1151 motherboards</span></strong><span> designed for 6th/7th Gen processors.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>It requires a compatible </span><strong><span>Intel 300-series motherboard</span></strong><span>, such as supported H310, B360, B365, H370 or Z370/Z390 models.</span></p>\n<p><span>Always verify the exact motherboard and BIOS compatibility before purchase.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),15000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/61i7rxqiz3l.-ac-uf894_1000-ql80--2603-2176798-240824103958098.jpg?v=1786222450','https://sakoonsay.com/products/intel-core-i5-8400-8th-gen-2-80ghz-lga1151-processor.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:23');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3403,'8209085988917','intel-core-i5-3470-3rd-gen-3-20ghz-lga1155-processor','Intel Core i5-3470 3rd Gen 3.20GHz LGA1155 Processor',replace('<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Upgrade your LGA1155 PC with the </span><strong><span>Intel Core i5-3470 3rd Gen Processor</span></strong><span>. Featuring </span><strong><span>4 cores, up to 3.60GHz Turbo frequency and Intel HD Graphics 2500</span></strong><span>, it delivers reliable performance for office work, everyday computing and affordable entry-level gaming builds.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Full Description</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Intel Core i5-3470</span></strong><span> is a 3rd Generation Ivy Bridge desktop processor offering dependable quad-core performance for affordable PC upgrades.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Featuring </span><strong><span>4 physical cores and 4 threads</span></strong><span>, the i5-3470 provides responsive performance for everyday multitasking, office applications, web browsing, multimedia and lighter gaming workloads.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The processor operates at a </span><strong><span>3.20GHz base frequency</span></strong><span> and can reach up to </span><strong><span>3.60GHz Max Turbo Frequency</span></strong><span>, providing additional processing power when applications demand it.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Built-in </span><strong><span>Intel HD Graphics 2500</span></strong><span> provides basic graphics functionality when paired with a compatible motherboard. For gaming, adding a dedicated NVIDIA GeForce or AMD Radeon graphics card will provide significantly better performance.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The processor uses the </span><strong><span>LGA1155 socket</span></strong><span>, making it a practical upgrade for customers who already own a compatible 2nd/3rd Gen Intel motherboard and want better performance without replacing the complete platform.</span></p>\n<h3><span>Performance Highlights</span></h3>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Intel Core i5 3rd Generation</span><br><span>• Ivy Bridge architecture</span><br><span>• 4 Cores / 4 Threads</span><br><span>• 3.20GHz Base Frequency</span><br><span>• Up to 3.60GHz Turbo Frequency</span><br><span>• 6MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><span>• Intel HD Graphics 2500</span><br><span>• LGA1155 Socket</span><br><span>• 77W TDP</span><br><span>• Reliable quad-core performance</span><br><span>• Great for office and home PCs</span><br><span>• Suitable for affordable entry-level gaming</span><br><span>• Excellent upgrade for compatible LGA1155 systems</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> Intel</span><br><strong><span>Model:</span></strong><span> Core i5-3470</span><br><strong><span>Generation:</span></strong><span> 3rd Gen</span><br><strong><span>Architecture:</span></strong><span> Ivy Bridge</span><br><strong><span>Cores:</span></strong><span> 4</span><br><strong><span>Threads:</span></strong><span> 4</span><br><strong><span>Base Frequency:</span></strong><span> 3.20GHz</span><br><strong><span>Max Turbo Frequency:</span></strong><span> Up to 3.60GHz</span><br><strong><span>Cache:</span></strong><span> 6MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><strong><span>Socket:</span></strong><span> LGA1155</span><br><strong><span>Integrated Graphics:</span></strong><span> Intel HD Graphics 2500</span><br><strong><span>Memory Support:</span></strong><span> DDR3</span><br><strong><span>TDP:</span></strong><span> 77W</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Office, Home, Everyday Computing &amp; Entry-Level Gaming</span></p>\n<h2><span>Gaming Performance</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Core i5-3470</span></strong><span> can still provide a practical foundation for low-cost gaming when paired with a suitable dedicated graphics card.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For a balanced setup, pair it with </span><strong><span>8GB–16GB RAM, an SSD and an appropriate dedicated GPU</span></strong><span>. It is best suited to esports, lighter games and older titles rather than demanding modern AAA gaming.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The Core i5-3470 uses the </span><strong><span>LGA1155 socket</span></strong><span> and requires a compatible motherboard and BIOS.</span></p>\n<p><span>If upgrading an older 2nd Gen LGA1155 motherboard, confirm that its BIOS supports </span><strong><span>3rd Generation Ivy Bridge processors</span></strong><span> before purchase.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),3000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/intel-core-i5-3470-3rd-generation-processor.jpg?v=1786222249','https://sakoonsay.com/products/intel-core-i5-3470-3rd-gen-3-20ghz-lga1155-processor.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:23');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3404,'8209085694005','intel-core-i5-2400-2nd-gen-3-10ghz-lga1155-processor','Intel Core i5-2400 2nd Gen 3.10GHz LGA1155 Processor',replace('<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Build or upgrade an affordable Intel PC with the </span><strong><span>Intel Core i5-2400 2nd Gen Processor</span></strong><span>. Featuring </span><strong><span>4 cores, up to 3.40GHz Turbo frequency and Intel HD Graphics 2000</span></strong><span>, it provides dependable performance for office work, everyday computing and entry-level PC builds.</span></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Intel Core i5-2400</span></strong><span> is a 2nd Generation Sandy Bridge desktop processor designed to deliver reliable performance for everyday computing at an affordable cost.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Featuring </span><strong><span>4 physical cores and 4 threads</span></strong><span>, the i5-2400 handles office applications, web browsing, multimedia and general multitasking smoothly when paired with sufficient RAM and an SSD.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The processor runs at a </span><strong><span>3.10GHz base frequency</span></strong><span> and can reach up to </span><strong><span>3.40GHz Max Turbo Frequency</span></strong><span>, providing additional performance when workloads demand it.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Built-in </span><strong><span>Intel HD Graphics 2000</span></strong><span> can provide basic display functionality when used with a compatible motherboard. For gaming, a dedicated NVIDIA GeForce or AMD Radeon graphics card is strongly recommended.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The i5-2400 uses the popular </span><strong><span>LGA1155 socket</span></strong><span>, making it a practical replacement or upgrade processor for compatible older Intel systems.</span></p>\n<h3><span>Performance Highlights</span></h3>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Intel Core i5 2nd Generation</span><br><span>• Sandy Bridge architecture</span><br><span>• 4 Cores / 4 Threads</span><br><span>• 3.10GHz Base Frequency</span><br><span>• Up to 3.40GHz Turbo Frequency</span><br><span>• 6MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><span>• Intel HD Graphics 2000</span><br><span>• LGA1155 Socket</span><br><span>• 95W TDP</span><br><span>• Reliable everyday performance</span><br><span>• Good for office and home PCs</span><br><span>• Suitable for affordable LGA1155 upgrades</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> Intel</span><br><strong><span>Model:</span></strong><span> Core i5-2400</span><br><strong><span>Generation:</span></strong><span> 2nd Gen</span><br><strong><span>Architecture:</span></strong><span> Sandy Bridge</span><br><strong><span>Cores:</span></strong><span> 4</span><br><strong><span>Threads:</span></strong><span> 4</span><br><strong><span>Base Frequency:</span></strong><span> 3.10GHz</span><br><strong><span>Max Turbo Frequency:</span></strong><span> Up to 3.40GHz</span><br><strong><span>Cache:</span></strong><span> 6MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><strong><span>Socket:</span></strong><span> LGA1155</span><br><strong><span>Integrated Graphics:</span></strong><span> Intel HD Graphics 2000</span><br><strong><span>TDP:</span></strong><span> 95W</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Office, Home, Everyday Computing &amp; Entry-Level Gaming</span></p>\n<h2><span>Gaming Performance</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Core i5-2400</span></strong><span> can be used for older and lighter games when paired with a suitable dedicated graphics card.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For the best experience on this platform, combine it with </span><strong><span>8GB or more RAM, an SSD and a balanced dedicated GPU</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For modern CPU-intensive gaming, a newer-generation processor is recommended.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p><span>The Core i5-2400 requires a compatible </span><strong><span>LGA1155 motherboard</span></strong><span>. Always verify the motherboard model, chipset and BIOS support before purchasing.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),2000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/intel-core-i5-2400-2nd-generation-processor.jpg?v=1786222141','https://sakoonsay.com/products/intel-core-i5-2400-2nd-gen-3-10ghz-lga1155-processor.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:23');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3405,'8209084809269','intel-core-i7-10700-10th-gen-2-90ghz-lga1200-processor','Intel Core i7-10700 10th Gen 2.90GHz LGA1200 Processor',replace('<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Power your gaming and productivity PC with the </span><strong><span>Intel Core i7-10700 10th Gen Processor</span></strong><span>. Featuring </span><strong><span>8 cores, 16 threads, up to 4.80GHz Turbo frequency and Intel UHD Graphics 630</span></strong><span>, it delivers excellent multitasking and strong gaming performance for compatible LGA1200 motherboards.</span></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Intel Core i7-10700</span></strong><span> is a high-performance 10th Generation Comet Lake desktop processor designed for gaming, streaming, multitasking and demanding productivity workloads.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Featuring </span><strong><span>8 cores and 16 threads</span></strong><span>, the i7-10700 offers a major multitasking advantage over older-generation Core i7 processors. Its Hyper-Threading capability makes it particularly suitable for users who game while running background applications, stream content or handle demanding productivity workloads.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The processor operates at a </span><strong><span>2.90GHz base frequency</span></strong><span> and can reach up to </span><strong><span>4.80GHz Max Turbo Frequency</span></strong><span>, delivering fast and responsive performance when additional processing power is required.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>With </span><strong><span>16MB Intel Smart Cache</span></strong><span>, the i7-10700 provides strong performance across gaming and everyday applications.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Integrated </span><strong><span>Intel UHD Graphics 630</span></strong><span> also allows compatible systems to provide display output without requiring a dedicated graphics card. For serious gaming, pair the processor with a suitable NVIDIA GeForce or AMD Radeon GPU.</span></p>\n<h3><span>Performance Highlights</span></h3>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Intel Core i7 10th Generation</span><br><span>• Comet Lake architecture</span><br><span>• 8 Cores / 16 Threads</span><br><span>• 2.90GHz Base Frequency</span><br><span>• Up to 4.80GHz Max Turbo Frequency</span><br><span>• 16MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><span>• Intel Hyper-Threading Technology</span><br><span>• Intel UHD Graphics 630</span><br><span>• LGA1200 Socket</span><br><span>• DDR4 memory support</span><br><span>• 65W TDP</span><br><span>• Strong gaming performance</span><br><span>• Excellent multitasking capability</span><br><span>• Suitable for gaming, streaming and productivity</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> Intel</span><br><strong><span>Model:</span></strong><span> Core i7-10700</span><br><strong><span>Generation:</span></strong><span> 10th Gen</span><br><strong><span>Architecture:</span></strong><span> Comet Lake</span><br><strong><span>Cores:</span></strong><span> 8</span><br><strong><span>Threads:</span></strong><span> 16</span><br><strong><span>Base Frequency:</span></strong><span> 2.90GHz</span><br><strong><span>Max Turbo Frequency:</span></strong><span> Up to 4.80GHz</span><br><strong><span>Cache:</span></strong><span> 16MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><strong><span>Socket:</span></strong><span> LGA1200</span><br><strong><span>Integrated Graphics:</span></strong><span> Intel UHD Graphics 630</span><br><strong><span>Memory Type:</span></strong><span> DDR4</span><br><strong><span>TDP:</span></strong><span> 65W</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Gaming, Streaming, Multitasking &amp; Productivity</span></p>\n<h2><span>Gaming Performance</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Core i7-10700</span></strong><span> is a strong choice for gaming systems thanks to its </span><strong><span>8-core, 16-thread design and high Turbo frequency</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Pair it with </span><strong><span>16GB or 32GB DDR4 RAM, an SSD and a capable dedicated graphics card</span></strong><span> for an excellent 1080p or 1440p gaming setup, depending primarily on the GPU.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Its additional threads also make it considerably better suited to heavy multitasking and streaming than many older Core i7 processors.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The Intel Core i7-10700 uses the </span><strong><span>LGA1200 socket</span></strong><span> and requires a compatible Intel 400-series motherboard, such as selected </span><strong><span>H410, B460, H470 or Z490</span></strong><span> models.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>It is </span><strong><span>not compatible with LGA1151 motherboards</span></strong><span> used by older Intel generations.</span></p>\n<p><span>Always verify the exact motherboard model and BIOS compatibility before purchase.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),50000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/intel-core-i7-10700-10th-gen-processor-tray-packed.jpg?v=1786221724','https://sakoonsay.com/products/intel-core-i7-10700-10th-gen-2-90ghz-lga1200-processor.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:23');
