-9700</span></strong><span> remains a capable gaming CPU thanks to its </span><strong><span>8 physical cores and high 4.70GHz Turbo frequency</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Pair it with </span><strong><span>16GB or more DDR4 RAM, an SSD and a suitable dedicated graphics card</span></strong><span> for a balanced gaming setup. It is particularly attractive as an upgrade for customers who already own a compatible Intel 300-series motherboard.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The i7-9700 uses the </span><strong><span>LGA1151 socket</span></strong><span>, but it requires a compatible </span><strong><span>Intel 300-series motherboard</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>It is </span><strong><span>not compatible with older 100/200-series LGA1151 motherboards</span></strong><span> designed for 6th and 7th Generation processors.</span></p>\n<p><span>Always verify the motherboard model and BIOS version before purchase.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),40000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/I7-9700-9TH-GENERATION-PROCESSOR.jpg?v=1786221579','https://sakoonsay.com/products/intel-core-i7-9700-9th-gen-3-00ghz-lga1151-processor.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:23');
