lights</span></h3>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Intel Core i7 8th Generation</span><br><span>• Coffee Lake architecture</span><br><span>• 6 Cores / 12 Threads</span><br><span>• 3.20GHz Base Frequency</span><br><span>• Up to 4.60GHz Turbo Frequency</span><br><span>• 12MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><span>• Intel UHD Graphics 630</span><br><span>• LGA1151 Socket</span><br><span>• DDR4 memory support</span><br><span>• 65W TDP</span><br><span>• Strong gaming performance</span><br><span>• Excellent multitasking capability</span><br><span>• Suitable for gaming and productivity PCs</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> Intel</span><br><strong><span>Model:</span></strong><span> Core i7-8700</span><br><strong><span>Generation:</span></strong><span> 8th Gen</span><br><strong><span>Architecture:</span></strong><span> Coffee Lake</span><br><strong><span>Cores:</span></strong><span> 6</span><br><strong><span>Threads:</span></strong><span> 12</span><br><strong><span>Base Frequency:</span></strong><span> 3.20GHz</span><br><strong><span>Max Turbo Frequency:</span></strong><span> 4.60GHz</span><br><strong><span>Cache:</span></strong><span> 12MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><strong><span>Socket:</span></strong><span> LGA1151</span><br><strong><span>Integrated Graphics:</span></strong><span> Intel UHD Graphics 630</span><br><strong><span>Memory Type:</span></strong><span> DDR4</span><br><strong><span>TDP:</span></strong><span> 65W</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Gaming, Streaming, Multitasking &amp; Productivity</span></p>\n<h2><span>Gaming Performance</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Core i7-8700</span></strong><span> remains a capable gaming processor thanks to its </span><strong><span>6-core, 12-thread configuration and high Turbo frequency</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Pair it with </span><strong><span>16GB DDR4 RAM, an SSD and a suitable dedicated GPU</span></strong><span> for a balanced gaming system. It is particularly attractive for customers upgrading an existing compatible 8th/9th Gen Intel platform.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Although the i7-8700 uses </span><strong><span>LGA1151</span></strong><span>, it is </span><strong><span>not compatible with older 100/200-series LGA1151 motherboards</span></strong><span> designed for 6th/7th Gen CPUs.</span></p>\n<p><span>Use a compatible </span><strong><span>Intel 300-series motherboard</span></strong><span>, and always verify the specific motherboard model and BIOS support before purchase.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),30000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/intel-core-i7-8700-8th-generation-processor.jpg?v=1786181035','https://sakoonsay.com/products/intel-core-i7-8700-8th-gen-3-20ghz-lga1151-processor.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:23');
