socket</span></strong><span>, the Core i7-6700 is compatible with supported Intel 100-series motherboards and selected compatible platforms.</span></p>\n<h3><span>Performance Highlights</span></h3>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• Intel Core i7 6th Generation</span><br><span>• Skylake architecture</span><br><span>• 4 Cores / 8 Threads</span><br><span>• 3.40GHz Base Frequency</span><br><span>• Up to 4.00GHz Turbo Frequency</span><br><span>• 8MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><span>• Intel HD Graphics 530</span><br><span>• LGA1151 Socket</span><br><span>• DDR4 / DDR3L memory support</span><br><span>• 65W TDP</span><br><span>• Strong multitasking performance</span><br><span>• Suitable for budget gaming builds</span><br><span>• Great upgrade for compatible LGA1151 systems</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> Intel</span><br><strong><span>Model:</span></strong><span> Core i7-6700</span><br><strong><span>Generation:</span></strong><span> 6th Gen</span><br><strong><span>Architecture:</span></strong><span> Skylake</span><br><strong><span>Cores:</span></strong><span> 4</span><br><strong><span>Threads:</span></strong><span> 8</span><br><strong><span>Base Frequency:</span></strong><span> 3.40GHz</span><br><strong><span>Max Turbo Frequency:</span></strong><span> 4.00GHz</span><br><strong><span>Cache:</span></strong><span> 8MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><strong><span>Socket:</span></strong><span> LGA1151</span><br><strong><span>Integrated Graphics:</span></strong><span> Intel HD Graphics 530</span><br><strong><span>TDP:</span></strong><span> 65W</span><br><strong><span>Memory Support:</span></strong><span> DDR4 / DDR3L</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Gaming, Multitasking, Office &amp; Productivity</span></p>\n<h2><span>Gaming Performance</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Core i7-6700</span></strong><span> remains a useful option for affordable gaming PCs when paired with a balanced dedicated graphics card.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Its </span><strong><span>8-thread design</span></strong><span> gives it an advantage over many older Core i5 processors for multitasking and games that can make use of additional threads.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>For the best overall experience, pair it with </span><strong><span>16GB DDR4 RAM, an SSD and a suitable dedicated graphics card</span></strong><span>.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p><span>The Core i7-6700 uses the </span><strong><span>LGA1151 socket</span></strong><span>, but not every LGA1151 motherboard supports 6th Gen processors. Always confirm the motherboard chipset and BIOS compatibility before purchase.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),13000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/intel-core-i7-6700-6th-generation-processor_1.jpg?v=1786180739','https://sakoonsay.com/products/intel-core-i7-6700-6th-gen-3-40ghz-lga1151-processor.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:23');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3409,'8208983916597','intel-core-i5-7500-7th-gen-3-40ghz-lga1151-processor','Intel Core i5-7500 7th Gen 3.40GHz LGA1151 Processor',replace('<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Upgrade your LGA1151 PC with the </span><strong><span>Intel Core i5-7500 7th Gen Processor</span></strong><span>. Featuring 4 cores, up to 3.80GHz Turbo frequency and Intel HD Graphics 630, it delivers dependable performance for everyday computing, office work and affordable gaming builds.</span></p>\n<h2></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Intel Core i5-7500</span></strong><span> is a 7th Generation Kaby Lake desktop processor designed to provide reliable performance for gaming, productivity and everyday computing.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>With </span><strong><span>4 physical cores and 4 threads</span></strong><span>, the i5-7500 provides a solid balance of responsiveness and multitasking performance. It operates at a </span><strong><span>3.40GHz base frequency</span></strong><span> and can boost up to </span><strong><span>3.80GHz</span></strong><span>, giving your system extra performance when demanding applications need it.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The processor includes </span><strong><span>Intel HD Graphics 630</span></strong><span>, allowing compatible systems to provide display output without requiring a dedicated graphics card. For gaming, pair the i5-7500 with a suitable dedicated NVIDIA GeForce or AMD Radeon GPU for significantly better performance.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>Its </span><strong><span>LGA1151 socket</span></strong><span> makes it suitable for compatible Intel 100- and 200-series motherboards, although motherboard chipset and BIOS compatibility should always be checked before purchase.</span></p>\n<h3><span>Performance Highlights</span></h3>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>• 7th Generation Intel Core i5</span><br><span>• 4 Cores / 4 Threads</span><br><span>• 3.40GHz Base Frequency</span><br><span>• Up to 3.80GHz Turbo Frequency</span><br><span>• 6MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><span>• Intel HD Graphics 630</span><br><span>• LGA1151 Socket</span><br><span>• DDR4 / DDR3L memory support</span><br><span>• 65W TDP</span><br><span>• Great for budget gaming PCs</span><br><span>• Excellent for office and everyday computing</span><br><span>• Good upgrade option for compatible LGA1151 systems</span></p>\n<h2><span>Specifications</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong><span>Brand:</span></strong><span> Intel</span><br><strong><span>Model:</span></strong><span> Core i5-7500</span><br><strong><span>Generation:</span></strong><span> 7th Gen</span><br><strong><span>Architecture:</span></strong><span> Kaby Lake</span><br><strong><span>Cores:</span></strong><span> 4</span><br><strong><span>Threads:</span></strong><span> 4</span><br><strong><span>Base Frequency:</span></strong><span> 3.40GHz</span><br><strong><span>Max Turbo Frequency:</span></strong><span> 3.80GHz</span><br><strong><span>Cache:</span></strong><span> 6MB Intel Smart Cache</span><br><strong><span>Socket:</span></strong><span> LGA1151</span><br><strong><span>Integrated Graphics:</span></strong><span> Intel HD Graphics 630</span><br><strong><span>TDP:</span></strong><span> 65W</span><br><strong><span>Use Case:</span></strong><span> Budget Gaming, Office, Home &amp; Everyday Computing</span></p>\n<h2><span>Gaming Performance</span></h2>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>The </span><strong><span>Core i5-7500</span></strong><span> is a practical processor for affordable gaming builds, especially when paired with an appropriate dedicated graphics card.</span></p>\n<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span>It remains suitable for lighter esports and older gaming titles, while newer CPU-intensive games may be limited by its 4-core/4-thread design. For the best experience, pair it with sufficient DDR4 RAM, an SSD and a balanced graphics card.</span></p>\n<h2><span>Compatibility Note</span></h2>\n<p><span>The i5-7500 uses the </span><strong><span>LGA1151 socket</span></strong><span>, but socket type alone does not guarantee motherboard compatibility. Check the motherboard chipset, model and BIOS version before purchase.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),7500,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/intel-core-i5-7500-7th-generation-processor.jpg?v=1786180075','https://sakoonsay.com/products/intel-core-i5-7500-7th-gen-3-40ghz-lga1151-processor.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:26');
