vel! 🚀</p>','\n',char(10)),12500,14000,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/THUNDERXSTARRGBGAMiNGCASETGC-621WiTH3XARGBFAN.png?v=1741204031','https://sakoonsay.com/products/thunder-x-star-rgb-gaming-case-tgc-621-with-3x-argb-fan.js','PC Case',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:54');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3478,'7733153464373','gigabyte-h410m-h-ultra-durable-motherboard','GIGABYTE H410M H Ultra Durable Motherboard',replace('<p>Build or upgrade a compatible Intel or AMD desktop PC with the <strong>GIGABYTE H410M H Ultra Durable motherboard</strong>. This listing is aimed at Pakistan buyers who need a clear platform match for their processor, DDR memory, graphics card and storage. Confirm the exact model and revision before ordering because motherboard features can vary by revision.</p>\n<h2>Specifications</h2>\n<table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Chipset</th>\n<td>Intel H410</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>CPU socket</th>\n<td>LGA1200</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Memory</th>\n<td>DDR4; Up to 64GB as listed; dual-channel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Form factor</th>\n<td>Micro-ATX</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Expansion and storage</th>\n<td>PCIe x16 graphics expansion and SATA/M.2 storage varies by revision</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Condition</th>\n<td>As listed; confirm exact stock condition</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>Compatibility guidance</h2>\n<p>10th Gen Intel Core, Pentium Gold and Celeron processors. Do not choose a motherboard by socket name alone: chipset generation, board revision, BIOS version and memory type must also match. DDR3, DDR4 and DDR5 are not interchangeable. Check your case clearance, power connectors, RAM kit, M.2/SATA interface and graphics-card clearance before purchase.</p>\n<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>\n<h3>Which processor works with this motherboard?</h3>\n<p>10th Gen Intel Core, Pentium Gold and Celeron processors. Check the manufacturer CPU support list and BIOS requirement for the exact revision.</p>\n<h3>Can I use DDR3 or DDR5 RAM?</h3>\n<p>No. Use only DDR4 memory supported by this board. Desktop RAM generations are not interchangeable.</p>\n<h3>Can I install a dedicated graphics card?</h3>\n<p>Yes, the listing includes PCIe graphics expansion. Confirm the slot, case clearance and power-supply requirements of your chosen GPU.</p>\n<h3>Will an M.2 SSD work?</h3>\n<p>PCIe x16 graphics expansion and SATA/M.2 storage varies by revision. Confirm whether your specific SSD is PCIe/NVMe or SATA and check the board''s manual before ordering.</p>\n<p>For help matching a processor, RAM kit or graphics card, contact SakoonSay Gaming Store in Faisalabad before purchase.</p>','\n',char(10)),15000,25000,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/gigabyte-h410m-h-ultra-durable-motherboard.webp?v=1727879902','https://sakoonsay.com/products/gigabyte-h410m-h-ultra-durable-motherboard.js','Intel Motherboard',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:54');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3479,'7733153595445','amd-ryzen-7-5800x-8-core-16-thread-unlocked-desktop-processor-used','AMD Ryzen 7 5800X 8-Core, 16-Thread Unlocked Desktop Processor Used',replace('<p>The AMD Ryzen 7 5800X 8-Core, 16-Thread Unlocked Desktop Processor is a powerhouse for mainstream desktop systems, delivering elite gaming performance and multitasking capabilities that make it a top choice for gamers, creators, and enthusiasts alike. With a blazing fast 4.7 GHz Max Boost clock speed, the Ryzen 7 5800X pushes the boundaries of performance, ensuring smooth and lag-free experiences even in the most demanding applications.</p>\n<h3>Unmatched Gaming Performance</h3>\n<p>Built for gamers who crave elite performance, the AMD Ryzen 7 5800X is capable of delivering 100+ FPS in popular AAA titles. Whether you’re into high-resolution gaming or competitive esports, this processor guarantees exceptional frame rates and immersive gameplay. Paired with a high-performance GPU and fast memory, the Ryzen 7 5800X unlocks the potential for smooth 1440p and 4K gaming, providing the edge you need in every session.</p>\n<h3>Overclocking and Multitasking</h3>\n<p>The AMD Ryzen 7 5800X 8-Core, 16-Thread comes unlocked for overclocking, allowing enthusiasts to push their system further. With a base clock of 3.8 GHz and a boost clock of up to 4.7 GHz, this processor is designed for extreme performance. With AMD’s Precision Boost technology, the CPU dynamically adjusts its clock speeds to ensure optimal performance, even when running the most intensive tasks.</p>\n<p>Thanks to its 16-thread architecture, the Ryzen 7 5800X excels in multitasking environments. Whether you''re editing 4K videos, rendering 3D models, or streaming your gameplay, the Ryzen 7 5800X provides exceptional performance without compromising speed or responsiveness. Its 36MB of combined cache ensures lightning-fast data access, significantly improving performance in complex computing tasks.</p>\n<h3>Advanced Socket AM4 Platform</h3>\n<p>The <a href="https://www.amd.com/en/products/processors/desktops/ryzen/5000-series/amd-ryzen-7-5800x.html">AMD Ryzen 7 5800X</a> is compatible with the advanced Socket AM4 platform, which supports PCIe 4.0 on X570 and B550 motherboards. PCIe 4.0 ensures faster data transfer rates for GPUs, SSDs, and other components, making it future-proof for upcoming hardware innovations. Additionally, the processor supports DDR4 memory with speeds up to 3200 MHz, further optimizing system performance and responsiveness.</p>\n<h3>Enhanced Efficiency &amp; Cooling</h3>\n<p>While the AMD Ryzen 7 5800X delivers high-end performance, it requires a capable cooling solution to maintain peak operation. The processor does not come with a stock cooler, as AMD recommends using a high-performance aftermarket cooler to achieve optimal thermal efficiency. This ensures the processor stays cool even when operating under full load or during overclocking sessions.</p>\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>8 Cores &amp; 16 Threads:</strong> Exceptional multitasking and productivity for creators, streamers, and professionals.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Max Boost Clock of 4.7 GHz:</strong> Experience ultra-fast computing speeds and responsiveness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Unlocked for Overclocking:</strong> Push the limits of your system with AMD’s precision overclocking features.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>36MB Cache:</strong> Faster access to data ensures smoother performance for gaming, content creation, and more.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>PCIe 4.0 &amp; DDR4-3200 Support:</strong> Ready for the latest technologies and hardware upgrades.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Compatibility:</strong> Advanced Socket AM4 platform, ideal for X570 and B550 motherboards.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Ideal for Gamers and Creators</h3>\n<p>If you’re building a gaming PC that’s ready to take on the latest titles with ease, or a content creation machine capable of handling intensive workloads, the AMD Ryzen 7 5800X is an excellent choice. Its ability to deliver high FPS in games, combined with robust multitasking and processing power, makes it the perfect processor for enthusiasts who demand the best from their systems.</p>\n<p>Upgrade your desktop setup with the AMD Ryzen 7 5800X and experience the next level of gaming, productivity, and multitasking performance.</p>\n','\n',char(10)),45000,52000,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/amd-ryzen-7-5800x-8-core-16-thread-unlocked-desktop-processor-u.webp?v=1727879903','https://sakoonsay.com/products/amd-ryzen-7-5800x-8-core-16-thread-unlocked-desktop-processor-used.js','AMD Processor',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:58');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3480,'7733153366069','amd-ryzen-5-1600x-6-core-12-thread-unlocked-desktop-processor','AMD Ryzen 5 1600X 6-Core, 12-Thread Unlocked Desktop Processor',replace('<p>Unlock next-level performance for gaming, content creation, and multitasking with the <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 1600X Processor</strong>. Engineered for enthusiasts and power users, the Ryzen 5 1600X is designed to deliver superior speed, multitasking capabilities, and advanced features that cater to high-demand applications. With its impressive 6 cores and 12 threads, this unlocked desktop processor ensures smooth and responsive performance across all your tasks, whether you''re gaming at high frame rates, editing videos, or running intensive software.</p>\n<h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>High Clock Speeds for Superior Performance:</strong><br>\nWith a base clock of 3.6 GHz and a boost clock of up to 4.0 GHz, the AMD Ryzen 5 1600X is built to handle demanding workloads with ease. The <strong>Precision Boost Technology</strong> dynamically adjusts the clock speeds to maximize performance in real-time, ensuring optimal output in both single-threaded and multi-threaded applications.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>6 Cores / 12 Threads – Unlocked for Overclocking:</strong><br>\nThe Ryzen 5 1600X features 6 powerful cores and 12 threads, making it an excellent choice for multitasking and gaming. Whether you''re streaming while gaming, rendering 3D models, or editing videos, the 1600X delivers exceptional efficiency and smoothness. Plus, it''s fully unlocked, allowing users to overclock and push performance to the next level.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Socket AM4 Compatibility &amp; DDR4 Support:</strong><br>\nDesigned to be compatible with the versatile <strong>AM4 socket</strong>, this processor fits perfectly with a wide range of motherboards, providing flexibility for upgrades and future-proofing. The Ryzen 5 1600X also supports <strong>DDR4 memory</strong>, ensuring faster data transfer rates and improved overall system performance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Advanced Cache System:</strong><br>\nThe Ryzen 5 1600X is equipped with <strong>3 MB L2 cache</strong> and <strong>16 MB L3 cache</strong>, allowing faster access to frequently used data. This contributes to reduced latency and higher efficiency when executing intensive tasks, making it ideal for gaming, video editing, and other data-heavy operations.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Extended Frequency Range (XFR) Technology:</strong><br>\nFeaturing <strong>XFR (Extended Frequency Range)</strong>, the Ryzen 5 1600X automatically boosts its clock speeds beyond the standard limits when sufficient cooling is available. This dynamic overclocking ensures maximum performance under optimal thermal conditions, allowing you to extract even more power from your processor.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>High Maximum Temperature &amp; Thermal Solution:</strong><br>\nWith a <strong>maximum operating temperature of 95°C</strong>, the Ryzen 5 1600X is designed to handle extreme workloads without overheating. However, to maintain peak performance and longevity, it requires a high-quality thermal solution (sold separately) to keep temperatures within safe limits.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Ideal for Gaming and Multitasking:</strong></h3>\n<p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 1600X</strong> offers a perfect balance of high-performance and value for gamers and creators. Its multi-threaded architecture makes it an ideal choice for modern AAA gaming, streaming, and handling resource-heavy applications. Whether you''re playing the latest titles or working on multiple tasks simultaneously, the 1600X provides a seamless and lag-free experience.</p>\n<h3><strong>Future-Proof Your System:</strong></h3>\n<p>As part of AMD’s <strong>Ryzen lineup</strong>, the 1600X is built on cutting-edge technology to ensure your system is ready for future challenges. With support for high-speed DDR4 memory and the AM4 socket, this processor allows for easy upgrades and ensures compatibility with future developments in technology.</p>\n<h3><strong>Why Choose AMD Ryzen 5 1600X?</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Unlocked for Overclocking</strong>: Tailor your performance needs by pushing your CPU beyond stock speeds.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>High Efficiency</strong>: 6 cores and 12 threads for excellent multitasking capabilities.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Great for Gaming</strong>: Boost your gaming rig with a processor that can handle high-performance gaming and streaming without compromise.</li>\n</ul>\n','\n',char(10)),10500,12000,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/amd-ryzen-5-1600x-processor.webp?v=1727879901','https://sakoonsay.com/products/amd-ryzen-5-1600x-6-core-12-thread-unlocked-desktop-processor.js','AMD Processor',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:58');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3481,'7733153333301','amd-ryzen-5-1600-processor-6-cores-12-threads-3-6ghz-boost','AMD Ryzen 5 1600 Processor – 6 Cores, 12 Threads, 3.6GHz Boost',replace('<p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 1600 Processor</strong> is the perfect solution for gamers, content creators, and multitaskers looking to elevate their system''s performance. Powered by AMD’s cutting-edge <strong>Zen architecture</strong>, the Ryzen 5 1600 offers exceptional multitasking capabilities and delivers superior performance in both gaming and productivity applications. With <strong>6 cores</strong> and <strong>12 threads</strong>, it is designed to handle even the most demanding tasks, ensuring that your PC runs smoothly and efficiently, whether you''re gaming, editing videos, or running multiple applications simultaneously.</p>\n<h3><strong>Unmatched Performance with Precision Boost</strong></h3>\n<p>The Ryzen 5 1600 operates at a base clock of <strong>3.2 GHz</strong>, but with <strong>Precision Boost</strong> technology, it can dynamically scale up to <strong>3.6 GHz</strong> when more power is needed. This allows for rapid response times, faster loading speeds, and an overall enhanced user experience. Whether you''re diving into AAA games or working on high-resolution projects, this processor will keep up with your workload.</p>\n<h3><strong>Powerful Multitasking with 6 Cores and 12 Threads</strong></h3>\n<p>With <strong>6 cores</strong> and <strong>12 threads</strong>, the Ryzen 5 1600 is a powerhouse in multitasking. The extra threads ensure that you can run demanding programs, such as video editing software or 3D rendering applications, while gaming or streaming without any performance lag. Its multithreading capabilities make it an excellent choice for users looking to do more with their system, from productivity tasks to entertainment.</p>\n<h3><strong>Advanced Cache System for Enhanced Performance</strong></h3>\n<p>The Ryzen 5 1600 is equipped with a total of <strong>19 MB cache</strong> (3MB L2 cache and 16MB L3 cache), which greatly enhances the processor’s efficiency. The large cache memory helps to reduce latency, leading to faster data retrieval, smoother operations, and better overall performance in both gaming and professional tasks.</p>\n<h3><strong>AM4 Socket Compatibility and PCIe 3.0 Support</strong></h3>\n<p>Designed to be compatible with the <strong>AM4 socket</strong>, the Ryzen 5 1600 ensures compatibility with a wide range of motherboards. This allows you to easily upgrade your existing system or build a new one with future-proof technology. Additionally, with <strong>PCIe 3.0 x16 support</strong>, this processor ensures high-speed communication with the latest GPUs and storage devices, making it ideal for high-performance gaming rigs or workstations.</p>\n<h3><strong>Efficient Cooling with Wraith Spire Cooler</strong></h3>\n<p>Included with the AMD Ryzen 5 1600 is the <strong>Wraith Spire Cooler</strong>, a high-performance cooling solution that keeps the CPU cool under heavy loads. The Wraith Spire not only provides excellent thermal performance, ensuring that the processor stays at optimal temperatures even during intense gaming sessions, but it also operates quietly, making it a perfect fit for noise-conscious users.</p>\n<h3><strong>Unlocked for Overclocking Enthusiasts</strong></h3>\n<p>The AMD Ryzen 5 1600 is <strong>unlocked</strong>, allowing you to push the boundaries of your system’s performance with overclocking. For tech enthusiasts and power users, this processor offers the flexibility to increase clock speeds and fine-tune your system to achieve higher benchmarks and performance metrics.</p>\n<h3><strong>Energy Efficiency and Thermal Performance</strong></h3>\n<p>With a maximum temperature of <strong>95°C</strong>, the Ryzen 5 1600 maintains efficiency while delivering high-level performance. This processor is engineered to balance power consumption and heat output, ensuring that your system runs cool and stable even during long hours of use.</p>\n<h3><strong>Ideal for Gaming and Content Creation</strong></h3>\n<p>Whether you''re building a gaming rig or a workstation for content creation, the AMD Ryzen 5 1600 is an excellent choice. Its powerful multithreading, high base clock speed, and fast cache make it perfect for <strong>gaming</strong>, <strong>streaming</strong>, and running <strong>content creation software</strong> like Adobe Premiere Pro, Blender, and more. You can expect smooth frame rates in modern games and faster rendering times in productivity applications.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Specifications:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Base Clock Speed:</strong> 3.2 GHz</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Boost Clock Speed:</strong> 3.6 GHz (Precision Boost)</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cores/Threads:</strong> 6 cores, 12 threads</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cache:</strong> 3 MB (L2) / 16 MB (L3)</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Socket Type:</strong> AM4</li>\n<li>\n<strong>PCI Express Version:</strong> PCIe 3.0 x16</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thermal Solution:</strong> Wraith Spire Cooler</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Max Temperature:</strong> 95°C</li>\n</ul>\n','\n',char(10)),9500,11000,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/amd-ryzen-5-1600-processor.webp?v=1727879901','https://sakoonsay.com/products/amd-ryzen-5-1600-processor-6-cores-12-threads-3-6ghz-boost.js','AMD Processor',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:58');
