https://wa.me/923007912922">contact SakoonSay on WhatsApp</a>.</p>','\n',char(10)),95000,90000,0,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/61eroWIablL._AC_SL1200.jpg?v=1741011922','https://sakoonsay.com/products/msi-gaming-geforce-rtx-3060-12gb-15-gbps-gdrr6.js','Graphics Cards',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:58');
