SakoonSay on <a href="https://wa.me/923007912922">WhatsApp</a> to confirm condition, included accessories and warranty terms for the unit you are buying.</p>','\n',char(10)),110000,NULL,0,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/81W0ZbeEWJS._AC_SL1500.jpg?v=1740745177','https://sakoonsay.com/products/evga-geforce-rtx-3070-ti-ftw3-ultra-gaming.js','Graphics Cards',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:58');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3485,'7866507001909','gigabyte-gtx-1060-3gb-gddr5-graphics-card','GIGABYTE  GTX 1060 3GB GDDR5 Graphics Card',replace('<h2>GIGABYTE GeForce GTX 1060 Windforce OC 3GB Graphics Card</h2>\n<p>The GIGABYTE GeForce GTX 1060 Windforce OC 3GB is a Pascal-generation graphics card for 1080p gaming, esports, everyday graphics and older creative workloads. Actual performance varies by game settings, drivers and system configuration.</p>\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\n<table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>GPU</th>\n<td>NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Memory</th>\n<td>3GB GDDR5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Memory bus</th>\n<td>192-bit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Interface</th>\n<td>PCI Express 3.0 x16</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Cooling</th>\n<td>GIGABYTE WINDFORCE 2X</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Clock reference</th>\n<td>Boost up to 1797MHz in OC mode; 1771MHz in Gaming mode</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3>Compatibility guidance</h3>\n<p>Use a compatible PCI Express x16 slot and check case clearance, power connectors and PSU capacity before installation. Install the appropriate NVIDIA driver for the operating system.</p>\n<h3>Frequently asked questions</h3>\n<h4>Is it suitable for 1080p gaming?</h4><p>It is designed for 1080p-class gaming, but the best settings and frame rate depend on the individual game and its 3GB VRAM requirement.</p>\n<h4>Does it support multiple displays?</h4><p>The Windforce OC model provides multiple display outputs; confirm the exact ports on the physical card before ordering.</p>\n<h4>Will it fit every PC?</h4><p>No. Check the PCIe x16 slot, case space, power connection and PSU capacity first.</p>','\n',char(10)),26000,30000,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/61doLPA9QzL._AC_SL1500.jpg?v=1740744751','https://sakoonsay.com/products/gigabyte-gtx-1060-3gb-gddr5-graphics-card.js','Graphics Cards',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:58');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3486,'7866499399733','msi-gtx-1070-gaming-x-8gb','MSI GeForce GTX 1070 GAMING X 8G 8GB GDDR5 — Without Box',replace('<h2>MSI GeForce GTX 1070 GAMING X 8G</h2><p>NVIDIA Pascal graphics with 8GB GDDR5 memory and MSI''s red-and-black dual-fan cooler. Supplied without a retail box. Manufacturer reference images show the front, backplate and display outputs.</p><h3>Specifications</h3><ul>\n<li>GPU: NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070; 1,920 CUDA cores</li>\n<li>Memory: 8GB GDDR5, 256-bit interface</li>\n<li>OC Mode: 1,607 MHz base / 1,797 MHz boost</li>\n<li>Gaming Mode: 1,582 MHz base / 1,771 MHz boost</li>\n<li>Silent Mode: 1,506 MHz base / 1,683 MHz boost</li>\n<li>Interface: PCI Express 3.0 x16</li>\n<li>Outputs: 3 × DisplayPort 1.4, 1 × HDMI 2.0b, 1 × dual-link DVI-D; up to four displays</li>\n<li>Power connectors: 1 × 6-pin and 1 × 8-pin PCIe</li>\n<li>Power consumption: 150W; recommended PSU: 500W</li>\n<li>Dimensions: 279 × 140 × 42 mm</li>\n</ul><h3>Frequently asked questions</h3><p><strong>Does it include a box?</strong><br>No. This listing is for the graphics card without a retail box.</p><p><strong>What power supply do I need?</strong><br>MSI recommends a 500W power supply with the required 6-pin and 8-pin PCIe connectors.</p><p><strong>Will it fit my PC?</strong><br>Check that your motherboard has a compatible PCIe x16 slot and your case has clearance for the dimensions listed above.</p>','\n',char(10)),43000,47000,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/msi-gtx-1070-gaming-x-8g-front.webp?v=1792044243','https://sakoonsay.com/products/msi-gtx-1070-gaming-x-8gb.js','Graphics Cards',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:04:58');
