e.</p>\n<h3>Can I install a dedicated graphics card?</h3>\n<p>Yes, the listing includes PCIe graphics expansion. Confirm the slot, case clearance and power-supply requirements of your chosen GPU.</p>\n<h3>Will an M.2 SSD work?</h3>\n<p>M.2/SATA storage and PCIe x16 graphics expansion. Confirm whether your specific SSD is PCIe/NVMe or SATA and check the board''s manual before ordering.</p>\n<p>For help matching a processor, RAM kit or graphics card, contact SakoonSay Gaming Store in Faisalabad before purchase.</p>','\n',char(10)),11500,20000,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/gigabyte-h310m-h-20-lga1151-micro-atx-motherboard.webp?v=1727879902','https://sakoonsay.com/products/gigabyte-h310m-h-2-0-lga1151-micro-atx-motherboard.js','Intel Motherboard',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:05:04');
