ory</strong> – Faster speeds for ultra-smooth gaming.<br data-end="788" data-start="785">✅ <strong data-end="818" data-start="790">192-bit Memory Interface</strong> – Improved data bandwidth for high performance.<br data-end="869" data-start="866">✅ <strong data-end="901" data-start="871">Boost Clock Up to 1830 MHz</strong> – Power through demanding AAA titles.<br data-end="942" data-start="939">✅ <strong data-end="974" data-start="944">NVIDIA Turing Architecture</strong> – Advanced graphics &amp; power efficiency.<br data-end="1017" data-start="1014">✅ <strong data-end="1047" data-start="1019">MSI Twin Frozr 7 Cooling</strong> – Keeps your GPU cool and quiet.<br data-end="1083" data-start="1080">✅ <strong data-end="1102" data-start="1085">TORX 3.0 Fans</strong> – Enhanced airflow for superior thermal performance.<br data-end="1158" data-start="1155">✅ <strong data-end="1185" data-start="1160">Zero Frozr Technology</strong> – Silent operation during low loads.<br data-end="1225" data-start="1222">✅ <strong data-end="1262" data-start="1227">DirectX 12 &amp; OpenGL 4.6 Support</strong> – Better visuals and rendering speeds.<br data-end="1304" data-start="1301">✅ <strong data-end="1318" data-start="1306">VR-Ready</strong> – Experience next-gen virtual reality gaming.<br data-end="1367" data-start="1364">✅ <strong data-end="1389" data-start="1369">RGB Mystic Light</strong> – Customize your GPU lighting effects.</p>\n<h2 data-end="1477" data-start="1432"><strong data-end="1475" data-start="1435">Powerful Performance for Every Gamer</strong></h2>\n<p data-end="1703" data-start="1478">The <strong data-end="1512" data-start="1482">GTX 1660 Super Gaming X 6G</strong> is built for <strong data-end="1571" data-start="1526">high FPS gaming in popular esports titles</strong> like <strong data-end="1624" data-start="1577">CS:GO, Valorant, Fortnite, and Apex Legends</strong> while also delivering <strong data-end="1700" data-start="1647">smooth performance in AAA games at ultra se