="col-left col">Cooling</div>\n<div class="col-right col">Dual Fan IceStorm</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class="col-left col">Slot Size</div>\n<div class="col-right col">Dual Slot</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class="col-left col">SLI</div>\n<div class="col-right col">No</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class="col-left col">Supported OS</div>\n<div class="col-right col">Windows 10 / 8 / 7</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class="col-left col">Card Length</div>\n<div class="col-right col">210mm x 128mm</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class="col-left col">Accessories</div>\n<div class="col-right col">Dual 4-pin to 6-pin adapter<br>User Manual</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>Zotac Graphic Card GTX 1060 6GB AMP Edition Price in Pakistan</h1>\n<p><span>The ZOTAC GeForce GTX 1060 graphics card is loaded with innovative new gaming technologies, making it the perfect choice for the latest high-definition games. Powered by NVIDIA Pascal™—the most advanced GPU architecture ever created— the ZOTAC GeForce GTX 1060 delivers brilliant performance that opens the door to virtual reality and beyond.</span></p>','\n',char(10)),35000,NULL,0,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/zt-p10600b-10m_inage2_2048x2048_9900450a-d16b-4561-aa41-78a84eeed0bf.webp?v=1727942228','https://sakoonsay.com/products/zotac-geforce-gtx-1060-amp-edition-graphics-card.js','Graphics Cards',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:05:07');
