rong>, this card ensures an <strong data-start="1981" data-end="2046">immersive experience with rich details and smooth frame rates</strong>.</p>\n<h2 data-start="2051" data-end="2100"><strong data-start="2054" data-end="2098">Advanced Cooling for Maximum Performance</strong></h2>\n<p data-start="2101" data-end="2345">Equipped with <strong data-start="2115" data-end="2144">Dual-X Cooling Technology</strong>, the <strong data-start="2150" data-end="2176">Sapphire Nitro+ RX 590</strong> features <strong data-start="2186" data-end="2264">dual powerful fans, precision-engineered heat pipes, and a robust heatsink</strong> to maintain <strong data-start="2277" data-end="2317">low temperatures and quiet operation</strong> under heavy gaming loads.</p>\n<h2 data-start="2347" data-end="2392"><strong data-start="2350" data-end="2390">Why Buy from SakoonSay Gaming Store?</strong></h2>\n<p data-start="2393" data-end="2527">✔ <strong data-start="2395" data-end="2430">100% Genuine &amp; Original Product</strong><br data-start="2430" data-end="2433">✔ <strong data-start="2435" data-end="2477">Fast &amp; Secure Shipping Across Pakistan</strong><br data-start="2477" data-end="2480">✔ <strong data-start="2482" data-end="2525">Best Prices &amp; Reliable Customer Support</strong></p>\n<p data-start="2529" data-end="2625">🔥 <strong data-start="2532" data-end="2620">Upgrade your gaming setup with the Sapphire Nitro+ RX 590 8GB Special Edition today!</strong> 🔥</p>','\n',char(10)),33000,33000,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/sapphire-radeon-nitro-rx590-8gb-256bit-ddr5-special-edition-gra.webp?v=1727879905','https://sakoonsay.com/products/sapphire-radeon-nitro-rx590-8gb-graphics-card.js','AMD GPUs',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:05:07');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3508,'7733153988661','msi-gaming-radeon-rx-5700-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card','MSI Gaming Radeon RX 5700 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card',replace('<p><strong>Upgrade Your Gaming Experience with the MSI Gaming Radeon RX 5700 8GB GDDR6 Graphics Card</strong></p>\n<p>Elevate your gaming setup with the MSI Gaming Radeon RX 5700, engineered for superior performance and stunning visuals. This high-end graphics card features 8GB of GDDR6 memory and a robust 256-bit memory interface, ensuring smooth gameplay and quick load times for even the most demanding titles.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Chipset:</strong> <a href="https://www.msi.com/Graphics-Card/Radeon-RX-5700-mech-oc">Radeon RX 5700</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Boost Clock Speed:</strong> 1750 MHz, delivering incredible power and responsiveness</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Video Memory:</strong> 8GB GDDR6, providing ample space for high-resolution textures and complex graphics</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Memory Interface:</strong> 256-bit for efficient data processing</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Outputs:</strong> Three DisplayPort 1.4 and one HDMI 2.0b port, offering versatile connectivity options for multiple monitors and VR setups</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Whether you''re a gamer seeking high frame rates or a content creator demanding precision, the <a href="https://sakoonsay.com/msi-gaming-radeon-rx-5700-review-unleashing-smooth-1440p-performance/">MSI Gaming Radeon RX 5700</a> delivers exceptional performance. Experience the latest in gaming technology and take your visuals to the next level with this advanced graphics card.</p>\n<p><strong>Why Choose MSI Gaming Radeon RX 5700?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Superior performance with advanced GPU architecture</li>\n<li>Enhanced cooling for long-lasting stability</li>\n<li>Versatile connectivity options for seamless integration with your setup</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Get ready to push your gaming boundaries with the MSI Gaming Radeon RX 5700. Order now and experience the power of next-gen graphics!</p>\n','\n',char(10)),50000,56000,0,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/untitled-design.webp?v=1727879905','https://sakoonsay.com/products/msi-gaming-radeon-rx-5700-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card.js','AMD GPUs',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:05:07');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3509,'7733153955893','msi-gtx-960-4gb-gddr5-oc-graphics-card','MSI GTX 960 4Gb GDDR5 Oc Graphics Card',replace('<h2>MSI GeForce GTX 960 4GB GDDR5 OC Graphics Card</h2>\n<p>The MSI GeForce GTX 960 4GB GDDR5 OC is an older graphics card for budget gaming PCs, esports, everyday graphics and compatible creative workloads. The 4GB memory capacity can help in supported games, but overall performance remains dependent on the older GTX 960 platform.</p>\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\n<table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>GPU</th>\n<td>NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Memory</th>\n<td>4GB GDDR5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Memory bus</th>\n<td>128-bit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Core clock</th>\n<td>1178MHz base / 1241MHz boost</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Interface</th>\n<td>PCI Express x16 3.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Power</th>\n<td>120W; 1 × 8-pin connector; 400W recommended PSU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Outputs</th>\n<td>DVI, HDMI and DisplayPort</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Cooling</th>\n<td>MSI Armor 2X thermal design</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3>Compatibility guidance</h3>\n<p>Check the PCIe x16 slot, case clearance, 8-pin power connection and PSU capacity before installation. Confirm the display connector you need and install a compatible NVIDIA driver.</p>\n<h3>Frequently asked questions</h3>\n<h4>Is 4GB VRAM enough for every modern game?</h4><p>No. Game requirements vary, and the GTX 960 platform is better suited to older games, esports and lighter settings.</p>\n<h4>What power supply is recommended?</h4><p>MSI lists one 8-pin connector and a 400W recommended PSU for this model.</p>\n<h4>Is this product new or used?</h4><p>This listing describes the card as used. Condition and checking details should be confirmed before ordering.</p>','\n',char(10)),23000,26000,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/msi-gtx-960-4gb-gddr5-oc-graphics-card.webp?v=1727879905','https://sakoonsay.com/products/msi-gtx-960-4gb-gddr5-oc-graphics-card.js','Graphics Cards',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:05:10');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3510,'7733153923125','sapphire-radeon-pulse-rx-580-8gb-gddr5-dual-hdmi-dvi-d-dual-dp-oc-with-backplate-graphics-card','SAPPHIRE Radeon Pulse RX 580 8GB GDDR5 Graphics Card',replace('<p>Elevate your gaming experience with the SAPPHIRE Radeon Pulse RX 580 8GB GDDR5 OC Graphics Card. Powered by the AMD Radeon RX 580 graphics coprocessor, this GPU offers a blazing-fast clock speed of 1366 MHz, ensuring smooth and immersive gameplay. Equipped with 8GB of GDDR5 memory, the RX 580 is designed for high-performance gaming, enabling you to tackle the latest AAA titles with ease.</p>\n<p>Featuring dual HDMI, DVI-D, and dual DisplayPort outputs, this graphics card supports multi-monitor setups, perfect for gamers and content creators alike. The robust backplate not only adds durability but also enhances heat dissipation, keeping your card cool during intense gaming sessions. With SAPPHIRE''s renowned reliability and performance, the Radeon Pulse RX 580 is your ultimate upgrade for seamless, high-quality visuals.</p>\n<p>Ideal for gamers seeking exceptional value and top-tier performance, the <a href="https://sakoonsay.com/sapphire-radeon-pulse-rx-580-8gb-gddr5-graphics-card-the-ultimate-review-for-gamers-and-content-creators/">SAPPHIRE Radeon Pulse RX 580 8GB GDDR5</a> is your go-to choice for a powerful, future-ready gaming rig.</p>\n<table class="a-normal a-spacing-micro">\n<tbody>\n<tr class="a-spacing-small po-graphics_coprocessor">\n<td class="a-span3"><span class="a-size-base a-text-bold">Graphics Coprocessor</span></td>\n<td class="a-span9"><span class="a-size-base po-break-word">AMD Radeon RX 580</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class="a-spacing-small po-brand">\n<td class="a-span3"><span class="a-size-base a-text-bold">Brand</span></td>\n<td class="a-span9"><span class="a-size-base po-break-word">Sapphire</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class="a-spacing-small po-graphics_ram.size">\n<td class="a-span3"><span class="a-size-base a-text-bold">Graphics Ram Size</span></td>\n<td class="a-span9"><span class="a-size-base po-break-word">8 GB</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class="a-spacing-small po-gpu_clock_speed">\n<td class="a-span3"><span class="a-size-base a-text-bold">GPU Clock Speed</span></td>\n<td class="a-span9"><span class="a-size-base po-break-word">1366 MHz</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class="a-spacing-small po-video_output_interface">\n<td class="a-span3"><span class="a-size-base a-text-bold">Video Output Interface</span></td>\n<td class="a-span9"><span class="a-size-base po-break-word">DisplayPort</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>\n<h3>More About Sapphire RX 580 8GB</h3>\n<p>Unleash the full potential of your gaming setup with the SAPPHIRE Radeon Pulse RX 580 8GB GDDR5 Graphics Card. <strong>Firstly</strong>, powered by the AMD Radeon RX 580 graphics coprocessor, this card delivers exceptional performance, allowing you to experience smooth and immersive gameplay. <strong>Furthermore</strong>, with 8GB of GDDR5 memory and a GPU clock speed of 1366 MHz, you''ll enjoy high frame rates and stunning visuals in even the most demanding titles.</p>\n<p><strong>In addition</strong>, the <a href="https://www.sapphiretech.com/en/consumer/pulse-rx-580-8g-g5">SAPPHIRE Radeon Pulse RX 580</a> is equipped with multiple video output interfaces, including Dual HDMI, DVI-D, and Dual DisplayPort, offering versatile connectivity options for multi-monitor setups. <strong>Moreover</strong>, the OC (Overclocked) Edition ensures enhanced performance right out of the box, while the sturdy backplate provides additional durability and heat dissipation.</p>\n<p><strong>Whether</strong> you''re a hardcore gamer, content creator, or just looking to upgrade your system, the SAPPHIRE Radeon Pulse RX 580 8GB GDDR5 Graphics Card is the perfect choice for top-tier performance at an unbeatable value. <strong>Ultimately</strong>, elevate your gaming experience today with this reliable and powerful graphics card from Sapphire.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>AMD Radeon RX 580 GPU for superior gaming performance</li>\n<li>8GB GDDR5 memory for high-speed data processing</li>\n<li>1366 MHz GPU clock speed for smooth gameplay</li>\n<li>Dual HDMI, DVI-D, and Dual DisplayPort for multiple display options</li>\n<li>OC Edition with backplate for improved cooling and durability</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Ideal For:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gaming enthusiasts seeking high performance</li>\n<li>Multi-monitor setups with versatile output options</li>\n<li>Users needing reliable, overclocked graphics power</li>\n</ul>\n','\n',char(10)),27000,29000,0,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/untitled-design-1.webp?v=1727879905','https://sakoonsay.com/products/sapphire-radeon-pulse-rx-580-8gb-gddr5-dual-hdmi-dvi-d-dual-dp-oc-with-backplate-graphics-card.js','AMD GPUs',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:05:10');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3511,'7733153890357','nvidia-geforce-gtx-760-graphics-card-2gb-gddr5-256-bit','NVIDIA GeForce GTX 760 Graphics Card - 2GB GDDR5, 256-bit',replace('<p>Experience a new level of gaming excellence with the <strong>NVIDIA GeForce GTX 760 Graphics Card</strong>. Engineered for serious gamers and multimedia enthusiasts, this powerful graphics card combines cutting-edge technology with advanced features to deliver smooth, high-definition visuals and exceptional frame rates. Whether you''re diving into the latest AAA titles or exploring virtual worlds, the GTX 760 ensures a seamless and immersive experience.</p>\n<p><strong>Unmatched Processing Power</strong></p>\n<p>At the core of the GeForce GTX 760 lies <strong>1152 CUDA cores</strong>, providing the muscle needed to handle demanding graphics tasks with ease. Complemented by <strong>96 Texture Mapping Units (TMUs)</strong> and <strong>32 Render Output Units (ROPs)</strong>, this graphics card excels in rendering detailed textures and complex scenes quickly and efficiently. The result is stunning graphics performance that brings your games and applications to life.</p>\n<p><strong>High-Speed Memory and Bandwidth</strong></p>\n<p>Equipped with <strong>2 GB of GDDR5 memory</strong> and a <strong>256-bit bus width</strong>, the GTX 760 offers high-speed data transfer rates essential for high-resolution gaming and graphic-intensive applications. The GDDR5 memory type ensures faster loading times and smoother frame rates, eliminating lag and enhancing your overall gaming experience. This robust memory configuration allows you to run multiple applications simultaneously without compromising performance.</p>\n<p><strong>Advanced Technologies for Superior Gaming</strong></p>\n<p>The NVIDIA GeForce GTX 760 supports the latest DirectX and OpenGL standards, ensuring compatibility with the newest games and software. NVIDIA''s proprietary technologies like <strong>PhysX</strong> and <strong>Adaptive VSync</strong> enhance visual effects and optimize performance, providing a smoother and more realistic gaming experience. With support for NVIDIA SLI technology, you can link multiple GPUs for even greater performance.</p>\n<p><strong>Efficient Cooling and Overclocking Potential</strong></p>\n<p>Designed with a focus on thermal efficiency, the GTX 760 features advanced cooling solutions that keep the card running at optimal temperatures during intense gaming sessions. The efficient cooling system not only extends the lifespan of the card but also provides headroom for overclocking. Enthusiasts can push the GTX 760 beyond its base specifications to extract even more performance.</p>\n<p><strong>Multi-Monitor and 4K Support</strong></p>\n<p>With multiple output options including HDMI, DisplayPort, and DVI, the GTX 760 supports multi-monitor setups and 4K resolutions. Expand your workspace or gaming view across multiple screens for increased productivity or a more immersive experience. The card''s ability to handle high-resolution displays makes it a versatile choice for both gaming and professional applications.</p>\n<p><strong>Easy Integration and Compatibility</strong></p>\n<p>The GTX 760 is compatible with a wide range of systems thanks to its standard PCI Express interface. Its compact design ensures it fits comfortably in most PC cases, making it an ideal upgrade for those looking to enhance their system''s graphics capabilities without extensive modifications.</p>\n<p><strong>Why Choose NVIDIA GeForce GTX 760?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Powerful Performance:</strong> 1152 CUDA cores deliver exceptional processing power.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>High-Speed Memory:</strong> 2 GB GDDR5 memory with a 256-bit bus for fast data transfer.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Advanced Features:</strong> Supports the latest DirectX, OpenGL, PhysX, and Adaptive VSync technologies.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Connectivity:</strong> Multiple output options for various display configurations.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Efficient Cooling:</strong> Advanced cooling design for optimal performance and longevity.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Upgrade Your Gaming Experience Today</strong></p>\n<p>Don''t settle for mediocre graphics performance. Upgrade to the <a href="https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/geforce/graphics-cards/geforce-gtx-760/specifications/"><strong>NVIDIA GeForce GTX 760 Graphics Card</strong></a> and enjoy high-definition gaming, faster rendering times, and a more responsive computing experience. Whether you''re a hardcore gamer, a creative professional, or someone who demands the best from their PC, the GTX 760 is the perfect choice to take your system to the next level.</p>\n','\n',char(10)),14000,19000,0,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/nvidia-geforce-gtx-760-graphics-card.webp?v=1727879904','https://sakoonsay.com/products/nvidia-geforce-gtx-760-graphics-card-2gb-gddr5-256-bit.js','Graphics Cards',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:05:10');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3512,'7733153857589','gigabyte-graphic-card-gtx-750-ti-2gb-windforce-dual-fan','Gigabyte GTX 750 TI 2GB Windforce Dual Fan  Graphic Card',replace('<p>Experience the power of budget gaming with the <strong>Gigabyte GTX 750 TI 2GB Windforce Dual Fan Graphics Card</strong>. Ideal for gamers looking for smooth 1080p performance without breaking the bank, this card is equipped with 2GB of GDDR5 memory and NVIDIA''s advanced Maxwell architecture, providing an enhanced gaming experience for titles like Dota 2, CS</p>\n<div></div>\n<p>, and Fortnite. The <strong>Gigabyte GTX 750 TI 2GB Windforce Dual Fan</strong> is perfect for those who want reliable gaming at an affordable price point.</p>\n<p>What sets this graphics card apart is the <strong>Windforce Dual Fan</strong> cooling system. Designed to deliver optimal heat dissipation, it ensures that your GPU runs at peak performance while keeping temperatures low. The unique fan blade design not only increases airflow but also reduces noise, so you can focus on your gameplay without distractions.</p>\n<p>Another key feature of the <strong>Gigabyte GTX 750 TI 2GB Windforce Dual Fan</strong> is its power efficiency. This GPU consumes significantly less power compared to other models in its class, eliminating the need for external power connectors and making it an excellent choice for gamers who are upgrading their system on a budget. You’ll enjoy hours of uninterrupted gaming with low energy consumption.</p>\n<p>This graphics card is the ultimate choice for those building a cost-effective gaming rig in Pakistan. Whether you''re looking for an upgrade or building from scratch, the <strong>Gigabyte GTX 750 TI 2GB Windforce Dual Fan Graphics Card</strong> delivers top-tier performance without sacrificing affordability.</p>\n<p>Get your <strong>Gigabyte GTX 750 TI 2GB Windforce Dual Fan</strong> now at SakoonSay Gaming Store, the #1 computer shop online in Pakistan.</p>\n<p>Upgrade your gaming setup with the reliable <a href="https://www.gigabyte.com/Graphics-Card/GV-N75TWF2-2GI-rev-20#ov">Gigabyte GTX 750 TI 2GB</a> Windforce Dual Fan Graphics Card and enjoy a high-performance gaming experience without breaking the bank! Available now at SakoonSay Gaming Store, Pakistan’s #1 online computer shop.</p>\n','\n',char(10)),13000,17000,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/gigabyte-gtx-750-ti-2gb-windforce-dual-fan-graphic-card.webp?v=1727879904','https://sakoonsay.com/products/gigabyte-graphic-card-gtx-750-ti-2gb-windforce-dual-fan.js','Graphics Cards',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:05:10');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3513,'7733153824821','msi-gtx-950-2gd5-oc-graphics-cards','MSI GTX 950 2GD5 OC Graphics Cards',replace('<h2>MSI GeForce GTX 950 2GD5 OC Graphics Card</h2>\n<p>The MSI GeForce GTX 950 2GD5 OC is an older graphics card for compatible budget systems, esports, everyday graphics and older games. Its 2GB memory capacity makes it better suited to lighter workloads than modern AAA titles.</p>\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\n<table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>GPU</th>\n<td>NVIDIA GeForce GTX 950</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Memory</th>\n<td>2GB GDDR5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Memory bus</th>\n<td>128-bit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Core clock</th>\n<td>1076MHz base / 1253MHz boost</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Interface</th>\n<td>PCI Express x16 3.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Power</th>\n<td>90W; 1 × 6-pin connector; 350W recommended PSU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Outputs</th>\n<td>DVI, HDMI and DisplayPort</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3>Compatibility guidance</h3>\n<p>Check the PCIe x16 slot, case space, 6-pin power connection and PSU capacity before installation. Driver and display compatibility should also be confirmed for the target PC.</p>\n<h3>Frequently asked questions</h3>\n<h4>What type of gaming is it suitable for?</h4><p>It is better suited to esports, older games and light graphics workloads than current demanding AAA games.</p>\n<h4>How much VRAM does it have?</h4><p>This MSI model has 2GB of GDDR5 memory on a 128-bit bus.</p>\n<h4>Does it need a 6-pin connector?</h4><p>MSI lists one 6-pin power connector and a 350W recommended PSU.</p>','\n',char(10)),16000,20000,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/msi-gtx-950-2gd5-oc-graphics-cards.webp?v=1727879903','https://sakoonsay.com/products/msi-gtx-950-2gd5-oc-graphics-cards.js','Graphics Cards',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:05:10');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3514,'7733153792053','msi-armor-2x-gtx-960-2gb-oc-dual-fan-hdcp-ready-sli-support','MSI Armor 2X GTX 960 2GB OC Dual Fan HDCP Ready SLI Support',replace('<h2>MSI Armor 2X GTX 960 2GB OC Graphics Card</h2>\n<p>The MSI Armor 2X GTX 960 2GB OC is a Maxwell-generation graphics card for older gaming systems, esports titles, everyday graphics and display output. It is best matched with games and applications that fit within its 2GB VRAM capacity.</p>\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\n<table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>GPU</th>\n<td>NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Memory</th>\n<td>2GB GDDR5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Memory bus</th>\n<td>128-bit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Core clock</th>\n<td>1178MHz base / 1241MHz boost</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Interface</th>\n<td>PCI Express x16 3.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Power</th>\n<td>120W; 1 × 6-pin connector; 400W recommended PSU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Outputs</th>\n<td>1 × DVI-I, 1 × HDMI and 3 × DisplayPort</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3>Compatibility guidance</h3>\n<p>Check for a PCIe x16 slot, one 6-pin power connection, adequate case clearance and a suitable power supply. Display-port availability should be matched to your monitor or adapter.</p>\n<h3>Frequently asked questions</h3>\n<h4>Is this card for modern high-end gaming?</h4><p>No. It is an older 2GB card intended for compatible older games, esports and general graphics use.</p>\n<h4>Can I connect multiple monitors?</h4><p>The manufacturer lists DVI, HDMI and DisplayPort outputs. Confirm the physical ports on the listed unit before ordering.</p>\n<h4>Does it require extra power?</h4><p>MSI lists one 6-pin connector and a 400W recommended PSU for this model.</p>','\n',char(10)),17000,22000,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/msi-armor-2x-gtx-960-2gb-oc.webp?v=1727879904','https://sakoonsay.com/products/msi-armor-2x-gtx-960-2gb-oc-dual-fan-hdcp-ready-sli-support.js','Graphics Cards',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:05:10');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3515,'7733153726517','msi-radeon-rx-580-8gb-gddr5-2480-graphics-card-dvi-single-port','MSI Radeon RX 580 8GB GDDR5 2480 Graphics Card (DVI single port)',replace('<p>The <strong>MSI Radeon RX 580 8GB GDDR5</strong> listed here is the <strong>single-DVI-port version</strong>. Compare its current price in Pakistan and check your monitor connection before choosing it for a desktop upgrade.</p><h2>Listed hardware</h2><ul>\n<li>Graphics processor: AMD Radeon RX 580</li>\n<li>Memory: 8GB GDDR5</li>\n<li>Display output: one DVI port</li>\n</ul><h2>Check compatibility before buying</h2><p>This listing does not offer native HDMI or DisplayPort outputs. Send us your monitor model and a photo of its inputs if you need help checking a connection or adapter. Also confirm the exact card label, power connector, power-supply suitability and case clearance with us before ordering.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Can I connect multiple monitors?</h3><p>This particular card has one listed display output. Do not assume it has the multi-monitor connections found on other RX 580 models.</p><h3>What gaming performance should I expect?</h3><p>Results depend on the game, resolution, graphics settings and the rest of your PC. Ask for a test of the available unit in your intended game; no fixed FPS figure is promised.</p><p><a href="/collections/graphics-cards">Compare other graphics cards</a> if you need a different display connection or GPU model.</p><h2>Price, availability and ordering</h2><p>Check the price and availability shown on this page before ordering. Free delivery is available across Pakistan; cash-on-delivery orders require a 10% advance. Read our <a href="/pages/faq">delivery, payment and warranty FAQs</a>, or contact SakoonSay on <a href="https://wa.me/923007912922">WhatsApp</a> to confirm condition, included accessories and warranty terms for the unit you are buying.</p>','\n',char(10)),21000,25000,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/untitled-design-2-02.webp?v=1727879903','https://sakoonsay.com/products/msi-radeon-rx-580-8gb-gddr5-2480-graphics-card-dvi-single-port.js','AMD GPUs',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:05:10');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3516,'7733153759285','asus-h81m-c-mainboard-micro-atx','ASUS H81M-C LGA1150 Micro-ATX Motherboard – Intel H81 DDR3',replace('<p><strong>ASUS H81M-C Micro-ATX Motherboard</strong> for affordable Intel 4th Gen desktop upgrades and budget PC builds.</p>\n<h2>Key specifications</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Socket:</strong> LGA1150 for compatible 4th Gen Intel Core i7, i5, i3, Pentium and Celeron processors</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Chipset:</strong> Intel H81 Express</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Memory:</strong> 2 DDR3 DIMM slots, dual-channel, up to 16GB; DDR3 1600/1333/1066MHz support</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Expansion:</strong> 1× PCIe 2.0 x16, 2× PCIe 2.0 x1 and 1× PCI slot</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Storage:</strong> 2× SATA 6Gb/s and 2× SATA 3Gb/s</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Display:</strong> DVI-D and D-Sub outputs; integrated graphics depend on the installed CPU</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Network and audio:</strong> Realtek Gigabit LAN and 7.1-channel HD audio</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Form factor:</strong> Micro-ATX</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Compatibility note</h2>\n<p>Confirm the LGA1150 socket, DDR3 memory requirement and board condition before ordering. A compatible Intel CPU, DDR3 RAM, storage, power supply and case are required to build a complete PC.</p>\n<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>\n<h3>Which processors does the ASUS H81M-C support?</h3>\n<p>It supports compatible Intel 4th Generation Core i7, i5 and i3 processors, plus Pentium and Celeron CPUs for the LGA1150 socket.</p>\n<h3>How much RAM can it support?</h3>\n<p>It supports up to 16GB of DDR3 memory across two DIMM slots, subject to the installed CPU and compatible memory modules.</p>\n<h3>Is this motherboard suitable for a gaming PC?</h3>\n<p>It can support a budget gaming PC when paired with a compatible 4th Gen Intel processor, DDR3 RAM and a discrete graphics card.</p>','\n',char(10)),4500,8000,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/asus-h81m-c-mainboard-micro-atx.webp?v=1727879904','https://sakoonsay.com/products/asus-h81m-c-mainboard-micro-atx.js','Intel Motherboard',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:05:10');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3517,'7733153693749','asus-h110m-k-micro-atx-ddr4-lga-1151-motherboards','ASUS H110M-K Micro ATX DDR4 LGA 1151 Motherboards',replace('<div id="productOverview_feature_div" class="celwidget">\n<div id="poExpander" class="a-expander-collapsed-height a-row a-expander-container a-spacing-none a-expander-partial-collapse-container">\n<div class="a-expander-content a-expander-partial-collapse-content">\n<div class="a-section a-spacing-small a-spacing-top-small">\n<table class="a-normal a-spacing-micro">\n<tbody>\n<tr class="a-spacing-small po-brand">\n<td class="a-span3"><span class="a-size-base a-text-bold">Brand</span></td>\n<td class="a-span9"><span class="a-size-base po-break-word">ASUS</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class="a-spacing-small po-cpu_model.socket">\n<td class="a-span3"><span class="a-size-base a-text-bold">CPU Socket</span></td>\n<td class="a-span9"><span class="a-size-base po-break-word">LGA 1151</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class="a-spacing-small po-compatible_devices">\n<td class="a-span3"><span class="a-size-base a-text-bold">Compatible Devices</span></td>\n<td class="a-span9"><span class="a-size-base po-break-word">Personal Computer</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class="a-spacing-small po-ram_memory.technology">\n<td class="a-span3"><span class="a-size-base a-text-bold">RAM Memory Technology</span></td>\n<td class="a-span9"><span class="a-size-base po-break-word">DDR4</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class="a-spacing-small po-chipset_type">\n<td class="a-span3"><span class="a-size-base a-text-bold">Chipset Type</span></td>\n<td class="a-span9"><span class="a-size-base po-break-word">Intel H110</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class="a-spacing-small po-memory_clock_speed">\n<td class="a-span3"><span class="a-size-base a-text-bold">Memory Clock Speed</span></td>\n<td class="a-span9"><span class="a-size-base po-break-word">2133 MHz</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class="a-spacing-small po-platform">\n<td class="a-span3"><span class="a-size-base a-text-bold">Platform</span></td>\n<td class="a-span9"><span class="a-size-base po-break-word">Windows 10</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class="a-spacing-small po-model_name">\n<td class="a-span3"><span class="a-size-base a-text-bold">Model Name</span></td>\n<td class="a-span9"><span class="a-size-base po-break-word">ASUS COMPUTER INTL</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class="a-spacing-small po-memory_storage_capacity">\n<td class="a-span3"><span class="a-size-base a-text-bold">Memory Storage Capacity</span></td>\n<td class="a-span9"><span class="a-size-base po-break-word">1024 MB</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class="a-spacing-small po-ram_memory.maximum_size">\n<td class="a-span3"><span class="a-size-base a-text-bold">RAM Memory Maximum Size</span></td>\n<td class="a-span9"><span class="a-size-base po-break-word">32 GB</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The ASUS H110M-K Micro ATX DDR4 LGA 1151 Motherboard is designed for top-tier performance and reliability, making it an excellent choice for both home and office PCs. Built with the Intel H110 chipset, this motherboard supports 6th and 7th generation Intel processors, ensuring powerful performance for a range of computing tasks. With DDR4 memory compatibility and a maximum memory capacity of 32GB, this motherboard delivers fast and efficient multitasking, perfect for gamers, content creators, and professionals alike.</p>\n<p>One of the standout features of the <a href="https://www.asus.com/motherboards-components/motherboards/prime/h110m-k/">ASUS H110M-K</a> is its <strong>5X Protection II</strong> technology, providing all-round protection with advanced hardware safeguards to ensure system durability. From overvoltage protection to enhanced components, ASUS has integrated premium safety features to keep your PC running smoothly, even under heavy loads.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Fan Xpert</strong> technology ensures optimal cooling, keeping your system cool while maintaining quiet performance. Whether you''re gaming, editing, or streaming, the balanced cooling provided by Fan Xpert makes the experience seamless and efficient.</p>\n<p>This motherboard is equipped with <strong>integrated DVI and VGA ports</strong>, allowing dual-monitor support, which is ideal for productivity and immersive gaming setups. It also supports <strong>UEFI BIOS</strong> with EZ Flash 3, providing an intuitive BIOS interface for quick and easy system updates and adjustments.</p>\n<p>Fully compatible with <strong>Windows 10</strong>, the ASUS H110M-K motherboard is a reliable and future-proof option for your next PC build. Experience top performance, enhanced protection, and easy multitasking with this feature-packed motherboard. Perfect for personal computers, this board is designed to deliver long-lasting reliability and performance.</p>\n<p>If you want to buy ASUS H110M-K Micro ATX DDR4 Motherboard feel free to add in your cart.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>','\n',char(10)),6000,13000,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/asus-h110m-k-micro-atx-ddr4-lga-1151-motherboards.webp?v=1727879903','https://sakoonsay.com/products/asus-h110m-k-micro-atx-ddr4-lga-1151-motherboards.js','Intel Motherboard',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:05:10');
