pan></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id="featurebullets_feature_div" class="celwidget" data-feature-name="featurebullets" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-c-content-id="featurebullets" data-csa-c-slot-id="featurebullets_feature_div" data-csa-c-asin="B07ZHDZ1K6" data-csa-c-is-in-initial-active-row="false" data-csa-c-id="m9hk8g-k1xkun-wkbh2f-al6rt" data-cel-widget="featurebullets_feature_div">\n<div id="feature-bullets" class="a-section a-spacing-medium a-spacing-top-small">\n<hr>\n<h1 class="a-size-base-plus a-text-bold">About this item</h1>\n<ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini">\n<li class="a-spacing-mini"><span class="a-list-item">Memory Speed:14 Gbps.Digital Max Resolution:7680x4320</span></li>\n<li class="a-spacing-mini"><span class="a-list-item">Chipset: NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 Super</span></li>\n<li class="a-spacing-mini"><span class="a-list-item">Boost clock: 1815 MHz</span></li>\n<li class="a-spacing-mini"><span class="a-list-item">Memory Interface: 192-Bit</span></li>\n<li class="a-spacing-mini"><span class="a-list-item">Video Memory: 6GB GDDR6</span></li>\n<li class="a-spacing-mini"><span class="a-list-item">Output: DisplayPort x 3 (V1. 4)/ HDMI 2. 0B x 1</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>Upgrade your gaming experience with the <a href="https://www.msi.com/Graphics-Card/GeForce-GTX-1660-SUPER-VENTUS-XS-OC">MSI Ventus GTX 1660 Super 6GB GDDR6</a> Graphics Card, designed for gamers who demand high performance without breaking the bank. Powered by the NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 Ti chipset, this graphics card delivers smooth, stutter-free gameplay with stunning visuals. With a boost clock of 1815 MHz and a memory speed of 14 Gbps, you can enjoy fast load times, quick rendering, and a responsive gaming experience.</p>\n<p>The 6GB GDDR6 video memory and 192-bit memory interface ensure that you can handle the most graphically demanding games and applications at high settings. Whether you''re into competitive eSports or immersive single-player adventures, the MSI Ventus GTX 1660 Super provides the power you need to enjoy seamless 1080p and even 4K gaming at a digital max resolution of 7680x4320.</p>\n<p>This card offers versatile connectivity options with three DisplayPort 1.4 outputs and one HDMI 2.0b port, allowing you to set up multiple monitors for an enhanced gaming or productivity setup. The efficient cooling system ensures optimal performance by keeping your GPU temperatures in check, even during long gaming sessions.</p>\n<p>Designed for gamers and creators alike, the MSI Ventus GTX 1660 Super is an excellent choice for those looking to upgrade their PC with a graphics card that balances performance and affordability. Whether you''re gaming, streaming, or creating content, this card provides the speed and power you need for an unbeatable experience.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 Super chipset</li>\n<li>1815 MHz Boost Clock for high-performance gaming</li>\n<li>6GB GDDR6 video memory with 192-bit memory interface</li>\n<li>Multiple output options: 3x DisplayPort 1.4, 1x HDMI 2.0b</li>\n<li>Supports up to 4K resolution at 7680x4320</li>\n</ul>\n','\n',char(10)),47000,50000,0,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/msi-ventus-gtx-1660-super-6gb-gdrr6-192-bit-graphics-card.webp?v=1727879903','https://sakoonsay.com/products/msi-ventus-gtx-1660-super-6gb-gdrr6-192-bit-graphics-card.js','Graphics Cards',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:05:10');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3519,'7733153562677','msi-h61-3rd-gen-motherboard-micro-atx','MSI H61 3rd Gen Motherboard Micro ATX',replace('<table class="a-normal a-spacing-micro">\n<tbody>\n<tr class="a-spacing-small po-brand">\n<td class="a-span3"><span class="a-size-base a-text-bold">Brand</span></td>\n<td class="a-span9"><span class="a-size-base po-break-word">MSI</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class="a-spacing-small po-cpu_model.socket">\n<td class="a-span3"><span class="a-size-base a-text-bold">CPU Socket</span></td>\n<td class="a-span9"><span class="a-size-base po-break-word">LGA 1155</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class="a-spacing-small po-compatible_devices">\n<td class="a-span3"><span class="a-size-base a-text-bold">Compatible Devices</span></td>\n<td class="a-span9"><span class="a-size-base po-break-word">Personal Computer</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class="a-spacing-small po-ram_memory.technology">\n<td class="a-span3"><span class="a-size-base a-text-bold">RAM Memory Technology</span></td>\n<td class="a-span9"><span class="a-size-base po-break-word">DDR3</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class="a-spacing-small po-chipset_type">\n<td class="a-span3"><span class="a-size-base a-text-bold">Chipset Type</span></td>\n<td class="a-span9"><span class="a-size-base po-break-word">Intel H61 Express</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div class="flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow">\n<div class="min-h-[20px] text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" dir="auto" data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="121acce4-a423-4a09-b058-b506b9579cd5">\n<div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]">\n<div class="markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light">\n<p>The <a href="https://www.msi.com/Motherboard/H61M-P31-G3/Specification"><strong>MSI H61 3rd Gen Micro ATX Motherboard</strong></a> is designed to provide reliable and efficient performance for both everyday computing and gaming setups. Equipped with the <strong>LGA 1155 socket</strong>, this motherboard supports <strong>3rd generation Intel Core processors</strong>, ensuring smooth and responsive performance for personal computers. Whether you''re building a home PC, office setup, or budget-friendly gaming rig, the MSI H61 motherboard offers the power and features you need.</p>\n<p>This motherboard is built around the <strong>Intel H61 Express chipset</strong>, which provides stability and optimized system performance. The <strong>DDR3 memory support</strong> allows for faster data transfers and improved system multitasking. With the capability to support up to <strong>16GB of DDR3 RAM</strong>, the MSI H61 is a perfect fit for users seeking enhanced memory performance at an affordable price point.</p>\n<p>Its <strong>Micro ATX form factor</strong> is compact yet packed with essential features. This makes it an excellent choice for space-conscious builders who don’t want to compromise on quality or performance. Despite its smaller size, the board offers enough slots and connectivity options for expanding your system’s capabilities, including USB ports, PCI slots, and SATA connectors.</p>\n<p>The MSI H61 motherboard comes with built-in <strong>advanced protection features</strong> to ensure durability and longevity. Whether you''re using it for home use, office tasks, or light gaming, this motherboard delivers reliable and efficient performance.</p>\n<p>Additionally, the <strong>MSI UEFI BIOS</strong> provides an intuitive interface for easy system updates and optimizations, allowing users to get the most out of their PC. The board is fully compatible with <strong>Windows operating systems</strong>, making it an excellent choice for a variety of computing needs.</p>\n<p>For users looking for a dependable and cost-effective motherboard for 3rd gen Intel processors, the <strong>MSI H61 Micro ATX Motherboard</strong> offers an ideal balance of performance, reliability, and expandability.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="mt-1 flex gap-3 empty:hidden -ml-2">\n<div class="items-center justify-start rounded-xl p-1 flex">\n<div class="flex items-center"><button class="rounded-lg text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-main-surface-secondary" aria-label="Copy" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button"> </button></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n','\n',char(10)),4500,6500,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/msi-h61-3rd-gen-motherboard-micro-atx.webp?v=1727879902','https://sakoonsay.com/products/msi-h61-3rd-gen-motherboard-micro-atx.js','Intel Motherboard',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:05:15');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3520,'7733153529909','amd-ryzen-5-3600-6-core-12-thread-unlocked-desktop-processor','AMD Ryzen 5 3600 AM4 Processor – 6 Cores, 12 Threads',replace('<h2>AMD Ryzen 5 3600 Processor in Pakistan</h2><p>Build or upgrade your AM4 desktop with the AMD Ryzen 5 3600, available from SakoonSay Gaming Store in Faisalabad. This 6-core, 12-thread processor supports gaming, everyday multitasking and content creation. Gaming performance depends on your graphics card, settings and other components.</p><h3>Specifications</h3><ul>\n<li>6 CPU cores and 12 threads</li>\n<li>3.6GHz base clock; up to 4.2GHz maximum boost</li>\n<li>AM4 socket</li>\n<li>3MB L2 cache and 32MB L3 cache</li>\n<li>65W default TDP</li>\n<li>Dual-channel DDR4 memory, up to 3200 MT/s</li>\n<li>PCIe 4.0 x16; available connectivity depends on the motherboard</li>\n<li>Unlocked for overclocking</li>\n<li>Dedicated graphics card required</li>\n</ul><h3>Compatibility and cooling</h3><p>Check your motherboard manufacturer''s CPU support list and required BIOS version for the Ryzen 5 3600 before purchase. AM4 socket alone does not guarantee compatibility. Use a compatible AM4 CPU cooler. Confirm cooler inclusion, packaging, condition and warranty with the store before ordering.</p><h3>Frequently asked questions</h3><p><strong>Does the Ryzen 5 3600 have integrated graphics?</strong><br>No. A dedicated graphics card is required for display output.</p><p><strong>Does it support DDR4-3200 RAM?</strong><br>Yes, up to 3200 MT/s. Achievable speed also depends on the memory configuration and motherboard.</p><p><strong>Will it work with my AM4 motherboard?</strong><br>Check the exact board''s CPU support list and BIOS requirements first.</p><p><strong>Is a cooler included?</strong><br>Please confirm this listing''s package contents with SakoonSay before ordering.</p>','\n',char(10)),21000,20000,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/amd-ryzen-5-3600-6-core-12-thread-unlocked-desktop-processor.webp?v=1727879902','https://sakoonsay.com/products/amd-ryzen-5-3600-6-core-12-thread-unlocked-desktop-processor.js','AMD Processor',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:05:15');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3521,'7733153497141','asus-q87m-e-csm-ddr3-1600-lga-1150-motherboard','ASUS Q87M-E/CSM DDR3 1600 LGA 1150 Motherboard',replace('<p>Build or upgrade a compatible Intel or AMD desktop PC with the <strong>ASUS Q87M-E/CSM DDR3 1600 LGA 1150 motherboard</strong>. This listing is aimed at Pakistan buyers who need a clear platform match for their processor, DDR memory, graphics card and storage. Confirm the exact model and revision before ordering because motherboard features can vary by revision.</p>\n<h2>Specifications</h2>\n<table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Chipset</th>\n<td>Intel Q87</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>CPU socket</th>\n<td>LGA1150</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Memory</th>\n<td>DDR3; Up to 32GB DDR3; dual-channel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Form factor</th>\n<td>Micro-ATX</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Expansion and storage</th>\n<td>PCIe x16 graphics expansion and SATA storage</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Condition</th>\n<td>As listed; confirm exact stock condition</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2>Compatibility guidance</h2>\n<p>4th Gen Intel Core, Pentium and Celeron; verify exact CPU support. Do not choose a motherboard by socket name alone: chipset generation, board revision, BIOS version and memory type must also match. DDR3, DDR4 and DDR5 are not interchangeable. Check your case clearance, power connectors, RAM kit, M.2/SATA interface and graphics-card clearance before purchase.</p>\n<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>\n<h3>Which processor works with this motherboard?</h3>\n<p>4th Gen Intel Core, Pentium and Celeron; verify exact CPU support. Check the manufacturer CPU support list and BIOS requirement for the exact revision.</p>\n<h3>Can I use DDR3 or DDR5 RAM?</h3>\n<p>No. Use only DDR3 memory supported by this board. Desktop RAM generations are not interchangeable.</p>\n<h3>Can I install a dedicated graphics card?</h3>\n<p>Yes, the listing includes PCIe graphics expansion. Confirm the slot, case clearance and power-supply requirements of your chosen GPU.</p>\n<h3>Will an M.2 SSD work?</h3>\n<p>PCIe x16 graphics expansion and SATA storage. Confirm whether your specific SSD is PCIe/NVMe or SATA and check the board''s manual before ordering.</p>\n<p>For help matching a processor, RAM kit or graphics card, contact SakoonSay Gaming Store in Faisalabad before purchase.</p>','\n',char(10)),8000,10000,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/asus-q87m-ecsm-ddr3-1600-lga-1150-motherboard.webp?v=1727879902','https://sakoonsay.com/products/asus-q87m-e-csm-ddr3-1600-lga-1150-motherboard.js','Intel Motherboard',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:05:15');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3522,'7733153398837','msi-geforce-gtx-1060-6gt-oc-price-in-pakistan','MSI GeForce GTX 1060 6GT OC',replace('<div class="flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow">\n<div class="min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5" dir="auto" data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="77ecaa1d-46db-4e38-b8c4-7b4104b39e78">\n<div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]">\n<div class="markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light">\n<p><strong>Boost Your Gaming Performance with the MSI GeForce GTX 1060 6GT OC</strong></p>\n<p>Experience the power of next-level gaming with the MSI GeForce GTX 1060 6GT OC, an affordable yet high-performing graphics card built for gamers and creators alike. Powered by the <strong>NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 chipset</strong>, this GPU delivers the perfect balance of performance and efficiency, ensuring you get smooth and immersive gaming experiences without breaking the bank. Equipped with <strong>6GB of GDDR5 memory</strong>, this card can handle demanding games and applications, making it an ideal choice for gamers looking to play at 1080p with high frame rates, as well as content creators working with video editing, 3D rendering, and other intensive tasks.</p>\n<h3><strong>High-Performance Gaming with Advanced NVIDIA Technology</strong></h3>\n<p>The MSI GeForce GTX 1060 6GT OC features <strong>NVIDIA’s Pascal architecture</strong>, which is renowned for its power efficiency and superior performance. Whether you''re battling it out in fast-paced multiplayer titles or exploring open-world RPGs, this card provides the speed and responsiveness required for lag-free gaming. The GTX 1060 is optimized for modern AAA games, supporting DirectX 12 and Vulkan for enhanced visuals and smoother gameplay.</p>\n<h3><strong>Efficient Cooling with Dual Fan Design</strong></h3>\n<p>The MSI GeForce GTX 1060 6GT OC is designed to stay cool under pressure, thanks to its <strong>dual-fan cooling system</strong>. The fans efficiently dissipate heat, ensuring stable performance during long gaming sessions. The advanced cooling design prevents overheating, allowing you to push your graphics card to its limits without worrying about thermal throttling.</p>\n<h3><strong>Optimized for 1080p Gaming</strong></h3>\n<p>With <strong>6GB of GDDR5 memory</strong>, the <a href="https://www.msi.com/Graphics-Card/GeForce-GTX-1060-6GT-OCV1/Specification">GTX 1060 6GT OC</a> is tailored for 1080p gaming. It provides more than enough power to run the latest games at high settings with a smooth frame rate. Games like Fortnite, Apex Legends, and Call of Duty: Warzone run seamlessly, giving you an edge in competitive play.</p>\n<h3><strong>Multiple Display Support for Versatile Connectivity</strong></h3>\n<p>The MSI GTX 1060 6GT OC offers versatile connectivity options for multi-display setups. It features:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>1 HDMI port</strong>, allowing for high-definition video and audio output.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>1 DisplayPort</strong> for supporting higher resolutions and refresh rates, perfect for those using a high-refresh monitor for competitive gaming.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>1 DVI port</strong>, ensuring compatibility with older monitors and displays.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>These multiple output options make the card perfect for those looking to connect multiple monitors for gaming, streaming, or productivity tasks.</p>\n<h3><strong>Compact Size and Easy Installation</strong></h3>\n<p>Measuring at <strong>243mm</strong> in length, the MSI GeForce GTX 1060 6GT OC fits comfortably in most mid-tower and full-tower cases. With a <strong>2-slot space requirement</strong>, it offers flexibility for builds with limited space, ensuring a hassle-free installation experience.</p>\n<h3><strong>Power Requirements and Efficiency</strong></h3>\n<p>The MSI GTX 1060 6GT OC is powered by <strong>1 x 6-pin power connector</strong>, and it requires a minimum recommended <strong>400W power supply (PSU)</strong>. Its energy-efficient design ensures you get maximum performance without excessive power consumption, helping you maintain a cost-effective and eco-friendly gaming setup.</p>\n<h3><strong>Why Choose the MSI GeForce GTX 1060 6GT OC?</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Affordable high-performance gaming</strong>: Play the latest titles with high frame rates at 1080p settings.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Advanced NVIDIA technology</strong>: Powered by the Pascal architecture, optimized for DirectX 12 and Vulkan.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Durable and efficient cooling</strong>: Dual-fan cooling system for optimal thermal management.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile connectivity options</strong>: HDMI, DisplayPort, and DVI support for multi-monitor setups.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Compact and easy installation</strong>: Fits comfortably in most PC cases with a minimal power requirement.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Upgrade your gaming rig with the <strong>MSI GeForce GTX 1060 6GT OC</strong> and enjoy stunning visuals, fast performance, and seamless gameplay. Whether you''re building a new PC or upgrading an existing one, this graphics card delivers everything you need for a high-performance gaming experience without compromise.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Specifications:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Chipset Manufacturer</strong>: NVIDIA</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Video Chipset</strong>: GeForce GTX 1060</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Memory Size</strong>: 6GB GDDR5</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Power Connector</strong>: 1 x 6-pin</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Minimum PSU Requirement</strong>: 400W</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Dimensions</strong>: 243mm length, 2-slot space requirement</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Output Ports</strong>: 1 x HDMI, 1 x DisplayPort, 1 x DVI</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="mb-2 flex gap-3 empty:hidden -ml-2">\n<div class="items-center justify-start rounded-xl p-1 flex">\n<div class="flex items-center">\n<p> </p>\n<div class="flex"></div>\n<div class="flex items-center pb-0"><span class="overflow-hidden text-clip whitespace-nowrap text-sm">4o</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n','\n',char(10)),35000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/msi-geforce-gtx-1060-6gt-oc-graphics-card.webp?v=1727879902','https://sakoonsay.com/products/msi-geforce-gtx-1060-6gt-oc-price-in-pakistan.js','Graphics Cards',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:05:15');
