irm the package contents with SakoonSay before ordering.</p>','\n',char(10)),12500,20000,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/amd-ryzen-5-2600-processor-01.webp?v=1727879901','https://sakoonsay.com/products/amd-ryzen-5-2600-processor.js','AMD Processor',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:05:15');
