isting is marked <strong>with box</strong>. Please confirm the card''s physical condition, included accessories and applicable warranty terms with SakoonSay Gaming Store before ordering.</p>\n\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<h3>How much VRAM does this RTX 4060 Ti have?</h3>\n<p>This listing has 8GB of GDDR6 graphics memory.</p>\n<h3>Does it support DLSS 3?</h3>\n<p>Yes. Compatible games can use NVIDIA DLSS 3 features, including Frame Generation where supported.</p>\n<h3>Is the box included?</h3>\n<p>Yes. This listing is the with-box version.</p>','\n',char(10)),120000,125000,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/gigabyte-rtx-4060-ti-windforce-oc-v2-8g-front.png?v=1791572983','https://sakoonsay.com/products/gigabyte-geforce-rtx-4060-ti-windforce-oc-v2-8g-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card-with-box.js','Graphics Cards',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:02:43');
