 Install the latest NVIDIA driver after installation. For a white-themed build, pair it with a suitable white case, motherboard and power supply.</p>\n\n<h2>Condition and Purchase Note</h2>\n<p>Please confirm the exact physical condition, packaging, included accessories and applicable warranty terms with SakoonSay Gaming Store before purchase. Product availability can change quickly.</p>\n\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<h3>How much VRAM does this GALAX RTX 3060 Ti have?</h3>\n<p>This listing has 8GB of GDDR6 graphics memory with a 256-bit memory interface.</p>\n<h3>Is this suitable for 1440p gaming?</h3>\n<p>Yes, it can support 1440p gaming in compatible titles, but the final frame rate depends on game settings and the rest of the PC.</p>\n<h3>Does it support ray tracing and DLSS?</h3>\n<p>Yes. Compatible games can use NVIDIA ray tracing and DLSS features.</p>\n<h3>What does 1-Click OC mean?</h3>\n<p>It refers to the GALAX software feature that can apply a supported one-click overclock profile when the system and software are configured correctly.</p>\n<h3>Is this a white graphics card?</h3>\n<p>Yes. The GALAX EX White model has a white dual-fan cooler design.</p>\n<h3>What should I check before buying?</h3>\n<p>Check power-supply requirements, PCIe power connectors, case clearance, motherboard compatibility, physical condition and warranty terms.</p>','\n',char(10)),80000,85000,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/galax-rtx-3060-ti-ex-white-1-click-oc-front.png?v=1791572726','https://sakoonsay.com/products/galax-geforce-rtx-3060-ti-ex-white-1-click-oc-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card.js','Graphics Cards',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:02:43');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3922,'15405605650485','amd-ryzen-7-3700x-8-core-16-thread-zen-2-processor-price-in-pakistan-am4-ddr4-pcie-4-0','AMD Ryzen 7 3700X 8-Core 16-Thread Zen 2 Processor Price in Pakistan | AM4 DDR4 PCIe 4.0',replace('<h2>AMD Ryzen 7 3700X Price in Pakistan – 8-Core 16-Thread Zen 2 AM4 Processor</h2><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 7 3700X</strong> is an 8-core, 16-thread Zen 2 Matisse desktop processor for compatible AM4 gaming PCs, streaming, workstations and productivity builds. <strong>SakoonSay Gaming Store price: Rs. 29,999.</strong> <strong>Available stock: 0 pcs (out of stock).</strong> This product is listed under AMD tray/OEM part number <strong>100-000000071</strong>.</p><h3>AMD Ryzen 7 3700X specifications</h3><ul>\n<li>Architecture: Zen 2 (Matisse), Ryzen 3000 desktop series</li>\n<li>CPU cores / threads: 8 / 16</li>\n<li>Base clock: 3.6GHz; maximum boost clock: up to 4.4GHz</li>\n<li>Cache: 4MB L2 and 32MB L3</li>\n<li>CPU socket: AMD AM4</li>\n<li>Official memory support: DDR4-3200 in supported configurations</li>\n<li>PCI Express: PCIe 4.0 on supported platforms</li>\n<li>Default TDP: 65W</li>\n<li>Integrated graphics: none; dedicated graphics card required for display output</li>\n<li>Tray/OEM SKU: 100-000000071</li>\n<li>Manufacturer packaging identifiers: 100-100000071BOX (boxed) and 100-100000071MPK (MPK). These do not mean boxed retail packaging is included with this tray listing.</li>\n</ul><h3>AM4 motherboard BIOS compatibility</h3><p>Requires an AM4 motherboard with Ryzen 7 3700X CPU support and DDR4 RAM. Compatible models can include selected X570, B550, X470 and B450 motherboards, depending on board revision and BIOS. <strong>Verify the exact motherboard manufacturer''s CPU support list and required BIOS version before ordering or installing.</strong> Some older AM4 boards may need a BIOS update, and not every AM4 board supports every Ryzen CPU. PCIe 4.0 requires a compatible board and devices; other boards may run PCIe 3.0. Not compatible with AM5 or DDR5.</p><h3>Cooling and dedicated graphics requirements</h3><p>The Ryzen 7 3700X has a 65W default TDP. Use an appropriately rated AM4-compatible cooler, suitable thermal paste and adequate case ventilation. <strong>Whether a cooler or thermal paste is included in this particular tray/OEM offer has not been verified.</strong> The processor has no integrated graphics, so a dedicated GPU is required for monitor output.</p><h3>Ryzen 7 3700X vs Ryzen 7 3800X</h3><p>Both offer 8 cores, 16 threads, Zen 2 architecture and the AM4 platform. Ryzen 7 3700X has 3.6GHz base and up to 4.4GHz boost with 65W default TDP; Ryzen 7 3800X has 3.9GHz base and up to 4.5GHz boost with 105W default TDP.</p><h3>Condition, packaging and warranty</h3><p><strong>The physical condition, exact OEM/tray packaging contents and warranty for this specific SakoonSay offer have not been independently verified.</strong> Confirm details with SakoonSay Gaming Store before purchasing. Retail packaging and accessories are not promised.</p><h3>Frequently asked questions</h3><p><strong>How many cores and threads does Ryzen 7 3700X have?</strong> 8 cores and 16 threads.</p><p><strong>What are Ryzen 7 3700X base and boost clocks?</strong> 3.6GHz base and up to 4.4GHz maximum boost.</p><p><strong>Does Ryzen 7 3700X support B450 and B550 motherboards?</strong> Selected models may support it; verify the exact motherboard and BIOS on the manufacturer CPU support list.</p><p><strong>Does Ryzen 7 3700X support DDR5?</strong> No. It uses AM4 and DDR4, with official support up to DDR4-3200 in supported configurations.</p><p><strong>Does it support PCIe 4.0?</strong> Yes, on compatible AM4 motherboards and devices.</p><p><strong>Does Ryzen 7 3700X have integrated graphics?</strong> No. A dedicated graphics card is needed.</p><p><strong>Is Ryzen 7 3700X a 65W CPU?</strong> Yes, its default TDP is 65W.</p><p><strong>Does the tray/OEM offer include a cooler?</strong> Cooler inclusion has not been verified; confirm before purchasing.</p><p><strong>Is Ryzen 7 3700X currently in stock?</strong> No. Available stock is zero.</p><p><small><strong>Image disclosure:</strong> The featured image is an AI-generated illustration, not a photo of SakoonSay''s actual inventory. Any serial or manufacturing markings depicted are fictional. Official manufacturer reference: <a href="https://www.amd.com/en/products/processors/desktops/ryzen/3000-series/amd-ryzen-7-3700x.html">AMD Ryzen 7 3700X specifications</a>.</small></p>','\n',char(10)),27999,NULL,0,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/amd-ryzen-7-3700x-ai-illustration.png?v=1791562669','https://sakoonsay.com/products/amd-ryzen-7-3700x-8-core-16-thread-zen-2-processor-price-in-pakistan-am4-ddr4-pcie-4-0.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:02:43');
