800XT?</strong> No. The 3800XT has a higher maximum boost frequency.</p><p><strong>Does this tray/OEM offer include a cooler or retail box?</strong> Contents have not been verified; confirm with SakoonSay.</p><p><strong>Is the CPU currently in stock?</strong> No. Available inventory is zero.</p><p><small><strong>Image disclosure:</strong> The featured image is an AI-generated illustration, not a photograph of actual SakoonSay inventory. Any depicted serial or manufacturing markings are fictional. Manufacturer reference: <a href="https://www.amd.com/en/products/processors/desktops/ryzen/3000-series/amd-ryzen-7-3800x.html">AMD Ryzen 7 3800X official specifications</a>.</small></p>','\n',char(10)),32999,NULL,0,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/amd-ryzen-7-3800x-ai-illustration.png?v=1791562147','https://sakoonsay.com/products/amd-ryzen-7-3800x-8-core-16-thread-zen-2-processor-price-in-pakistan-am4-ddr4-pcie-4-0.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:02:46');
