RTX 3070 system, subject to the CPU and other components.</p>\n\n<h2>Condition and Image Note</h2>\n<p>Please confirm the exact physical condition, box or accessories and applicable warranty terms with SakoonSay Gaming Store before purchase. The current product image is an AI-generated illustrative representation; verify the physical card before dispatch.</p>\n\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<h3>Is the ZOTAC RTX 3070 suitable for 1440p gaming?</h3>\n<p>Yes. It is designed for strong 1440p performance, although the final frame rate varies by game and settings.</p>\n<h3>How much VRAM does this GPU have?</h3>\n<p>This model has 8GB of GDDR6 memory with a 256-bit memory interface.</p>\n<h3>Does it support ray tracing and DLSS?</h3>\n<p>Yes. Compatible games can use hardware ray tracing and NVIDIA DLSS features.</p>\n<h3>Can I use it in a white gaming PC build?</h3>\n<p>Yes. The Twin Edge OC White Edition is designed to match white-themed PC builds.</p>\n<h3>What power supply should I use?</h3>\n<p>A quality 650W-class power supply is a common recommendation, but the correct requirement depends on the complete PC configuration and power connectors.</p>\n<h3>Will it fit my case?</h3>\n<p>Check the card dimensions, case GPU clearance and cable space before ordering.</p>','\n',char(10)),87000,90000,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/zotac-rtx-3070-white-gpu-only-front-back-ai.png?v=1791561772','https://sakoonsay.com/products/zotac-gaming-geforce-rtx-3070-twin-edge-oc-white-edition-8gb-gddr6.js','Graphics Card',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:02:46');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3925,'15405580746805','amd-ryzen-7-8700f-8-core-16-thread-zen-4-am5-processor-price-in-pakistan-ddr5-pcie-4-0','AMD Ryzen 7 8700F 8-Core 16-Thread Zen 4 AM5 Processor Price in Pakistan | DDR5 PCIe 4.0',replace('<h2>AMD Ryzen 7 8700F Price in Pakistan – 8-Core 16-Thread Zen 4 AM5 Desktop Processor</h2><p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 7 8700F</strong> is an 8-core, 16-thread Zen 4 Phoenix desktop processor for gaming, streaming, content creation and productivity builds with a <strong>dedicated graphics card</strong>. Featuring a 65W default TDP, AM5 platform and DDR5 support, it is a versatile option for new PC builds. <strong>SakoonSay Gaming Store price: Rs. 46,999.</strong> <strong>Current stock: 0 pcs (out of stock).</strong> Listed as tray/OEM variant; AMD tray SKU <strong>100-000001590</strong>.</p><h3>Official AMD Ryzen 7 8700F specifications</h3><ul>\n<li>Architecture: AMD Zen 4 (Phoenix), Ryzen 8000 series desktop</li>\n<li>Cores / threads: 8 / 16</li>\n<li>Base clock: 4.1GHz; maximum boost: up to 5.0GHz</li>\n<li>Cache: 8MB L2 + 16MB L3</li>\n<li>Socket: AMD AM5</li>\n<li>Official memory support: DDR5-5200 in supported two-DIMM configurations; achievable speeds depend on DIMM count and configuration</li>\n<li>PCI Express: PCIe 4.0; available lanes depend on motherboard/platform configuration</li>\n<li>Default TDP: 65W</li>\n<li>Integrated graphics: none; discrete graphics card required for video output</li>\n<li>AMD Ryzen AI: up to 16 TOPS on supported software/platform configurations</li>\n<li>Tray/OEM SKU: 100-000001590</li>\n<li>Other manufacturer packaging identifiers: 100-100001590BOX, 100-100001590CBX, 100-100001590MPK, 100-100001590CPK. These do not imply retail-box packaging for this listing.</li>\n</ul><h3>Ryzen 7 8700F vs Ryzen 7 8700G</h3><p>Both are 8-core / 16-thread Zen 4 AM5 desktop CPUs, but the Ryzen 7 8700F <strong>does not include integrated graphics</strong>. Unlike the 8700G, the 8700F needs a dedicated GPU to display an image. Check other platform differences before substituting CPUs.</p><h3>AM5 motherboard BIOS and DDR5 compatibility</h3><p>Requires a compatible AM5 motherboard, DDR5 memory and a discrete GPU. Select A620, B650, B650E, X670 and X670E boards may support this CPU, sometimes only after a BIOS update. <strong>Check the exact motherboard manufacturer''s CPU support list, board revision and required BIOS version for the Ryzen 7 8700F before purchase.</strong> AM4 motherboards and DDR4 RAM are not compatible. Although AM5 boards may advertise PCIe 5.0, the processor''s own PCIe interface is PCIe 4.0.</p><h3>Cooling and system requirements</h3><p>Use an appropriately rated AM5-compatible CPU cooler, thermal paste, good airflow and a compatible PSU. <strong>Whether a cooler, thermal paste or retail packaging is included in this particular tray/OEM offer has not been verified.</strong> Install a dedicated graphics card to use a monitor.</p><h3>Condition, warranty and packaging</h3><p><strong>Physical condition, exact OEM/tray package contents and warranty terms for this specific SakoonSay offer are not verified.</strong> Confirm with SakoonSay Gaming Store before ordering. No boxed cooler or manufacturer''s retail packaging is promised.</p><h3>Frequently asked questions</h3><p><strong>Does Ryzen 7 8700F have integrated graphics?</strong> No. A dedicated graphics card is required.</p><p><strong>How many cores and threads does Ryzen 7 8700F have?</strong> 8 cores and 16 threads.</p><p><strong>What are the Ryzen 7 8700F clock speeds?</strong> 4.1GHz base and up to 5.0GHz maximum boost.</p><p><strong>Does it support DDR4?</strong> No. Ryzen 7 8700F uses AM5 and DDR5, with official support up to DDR5-5200 in supported configurations.</p><p><strong>Does it support PCIe 5.0?</strong> The processor supports PCIe 4.0; a PCIe 5.0-capable motherboard does not change the CPU''s interface generation.</p><p><strong>Does it work with B650 motherboards?</strong> Only if the exact model and BIOS support the 8700F; verify with the motherboard manufacturer.</p><p><strong>Does Ryzen 7 8700F support Ryzen AI?</strong> Yes, up to 16 TOPS under supported conditions.</p><p><strong>Is a CPU cooler included?</strong> Cooler inclusion for this specific tray/OEM offer is unverified.</p><p><strong>Is this CPU in stock?</strong> No. Available inventory is zero.</p><p><small><strong>Image disclosure:</strong> Featured image is an AI-generated illustration, not a photograph of actual SakoonSay inventory. Serial and manufacturing markings shown are fictional. Official manufacturer reference: <a href="https://www.amd.com/en/products/processors/desktops/ryzen/8000-series/amd-ryzen-7-8700f.html">AMD Ryzen 7 8700F</a>.</small></p>','\n',char(10)),46999,NULL,0,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/amd-ryzen-7-8700f-ai-illustration.png?v=1791561114','https://sakoonsay.com/products/amd-ryzen-7-8700f-8-core-16-thread-zen-4-am5-processor-price-in-pakistan-ddr5-pcie-4-0.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:02:46');
