ible with AM5 or DDR5 boards.</p>\n<h3>Integrated Radeon graphics and gaming</h3>\n<p>The Ryzen 5 5600G can output video and run supported applications without a discrete graphics card when paired with a motherboard that exposes video outputs. Dual-channel DDR4 can help integrated graphics performance. A dedicated GPU can be added for more demanding gaming. Actual FPS depends on game, RAM, cooling, settings and GPU.</p>\n<h3>DDR4 and PCIe 3.0 considerations</h3>\n<p>The CPU supports DDR4-3200 memory and PCIe 3.0. Unlike the Ryzen 5 5600 non-G, the 5600G does not provide PCIe 4.0 connectivity. Memory overclocking beyond official specifications is not guaranteed.</p>\n<h3>Cooling, warranty and package contents</h3>\n<p>This listing is for a tray/OEM model. <strong>Cooler inclusion, warranty terms, physical condition and packaging contents have not been independently verified for this store offering.</strong> Ask SakoonSay Gaming Store to confirm these details before ordering. Do not assume that the retail boxed cooler is included.</p>\n<h3>Frequently asked questions</h3>\n<p><strong>Does Ryzen 5 5600G need a graphics card?</strong> No, it has integrated Radeon Graphics, provided your motherboard supports video output.</p>\n<p><strong>Is Ryzen 5 5600G the same as Ryzen 5 5600?</strong> No. The 5600G includes integrated graphics and PCIe 3.0; the non-G 5600 has no integrated graphics and supports PCIe 4.0 with compatible platforms.</p>\n<p><strong>Does it work with B450?</strong> Only if the exact motherboard model and BIOS support this CPU. Check the manufacturer CPU support list.</p>\n<p><strong>Does it support DDR5?</strong> No. This AM4 processor uses DDR4.</p>\n<p><strong>Is it available?</strong> Inventory is currently 0 units; contact the store for future availability.</p>','\n',char(10)),37999,NULL,0,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/amd-ryzen-5-5600g-ai-illustration.png?v=1791550266','https://sakoonsay.com/products/amd-ryzen-5-5600g-6-core-12-th