port multiplier overclocking on appropriate boards such as compatible P67 or Z68 models, with suitable BIOS, power delivery and cooling. H61 and H67 boards generally do not offer equivalent CPU multiplier overclocking. Overclocking performance is not guaranteed and may increase heat, power draw and instability. Select cooling appropriate to the 95W processor TDP and intended settings.</p><h3>Uses</h3><p>Suitable for upgrades and repairs of compatible older DDR3 desktops, basic productivity and legacy gaming systems. Actual gaming performance depends on the graphics card, memory, storage and game requirements. Integrated Intel HD Graphics 3000 display support depends on motherboard display outputs.</p><h3>Frequently Asked Questions</h3><p><strong>Does i7-2700K support DDR3?</strong> Yes, Intel specifies DDR3-1066/1333 in dual-channel configurations, subject to motherboard limits.</p><p><strong>Will it work with H61?</strong> Some H61 motherboards support this CPU; verify the exact board model and BIOS CPU support list.</p><p><strong>Can I overclock the i7-2700K?</strong> Its multiplier is unlocked, but you need a compatible overclocking-capable motherboard, BIOS, cooling and power delivery.</p><p><strong>Does it have graphics?</strong> Yes, Intel HD Graphics 3000.</p><p><strong>Does it include a cooler, warranty or a guaranteed condition?</strong> No claim is made about included cooler, warranty or physical condition; confirm details with SakoonSay before purchase.</p><p><strong>Is it in stock?</strong> No, 0 units currently available.</p><p><small>Reference: <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/sku/61275/intel-core-i72700k-processor-8m-cache-up-to-3-90-ghz/ordering.html">Intel official ordering information</a>. Featured image is AI-generated illustrative artwork of the Intel Core i7-2700K processor, not a photograph of actual SakoonSay inventory. Cosmetic markings and batch codes may differ from actual stock.</small></p>','\n',char(10)),6999,NUL