INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3954,'15405102202933','intel-core-i7-3770k-3rd-gen-processor-price-in-pakistan-unlocked-lga1155','Intel Core i7-3770K 3rd Gen Processor Price in Pakistan | Unlocked LGA1155',replace('<h2>Intel Core i7-3770K 3rd Gen Processor Price in Pakistan</h2><p>The <strong>Intel Core i7-3770K</strong> is an unlocked 3rd Generation Ivy Bridge desktop processor for compatible LGA1155 DDR3 motherboards. Shop the Intel i7-3770K processor at SakoonSay Gaming Store, Faisalabad, Pakistan. <strong>Listed price: Rs. 7,999.</strong> Availability: <strong>in stock (3 units at the time of update)</strong>.</p><h3>Intel Core i7-3770K official specifications</h3><ul>\n<li>Model: Intel Core i7-3770K, 3rd Generation Ivy Bridge, 22nm</li>\n<li>CPU cores / threads: 4 cores / 8 threads, Hyper-Threading</li>\n<li>Base clock: 3.50GHz; maximum Intel Turbo Boost 2.0: 3.90GHz</li>\n<li>Cache: 8MB Intel Smart Cache</li>\n<li>Socket: FCLGA1155 (LGA1155)</li>\n<li>Processor TDP: 77W (not full system power draw)</li>\n<li>Memory: dual-channel DDR3-1333/1600, up to 32GB subject to motherboard and configuration</li>\n<li>Integrated graphics: Intel HD Graphics 4000</li>\n<li>PCI Express: 3.0 subject to platform support</li>\n<li>Intel tray/OEM ordering SKU: CM8063701211700</li>\n<li>S-spec: SR0PL; stepping: E1</li>\n<li>Multiplier: unlocked K-series processor, subject to suitable board/BIOS/cooling</li>\n</ul><h3>LGA1155 motherboard and BIOS compatibility</h3><p>Confirm the exact motherboard CPU support list and minimum BIOS version before purchasing. Intel 7-series boards such as Z77, Z75, H77 and B75 may support the processor depending on the board and BIOS. Certain H61 and other Intel 6-series LGA1155 boards may require a manufacturer-provided Ivy Bridge BIOS update and may not support this CPU. An LGA1155 socket by itself is not proof of support. The i7-3770K is not compatible with LGA1150 or LGA1151 motherboards or DDR4/DDR5-only boards.</p><h3>Unlocked overclocking and cooling</h3><p>The K-series i7-3770K supports multiplier overclocking when paired with a motherboard and firmware that enable it, typically a compatible Z77/Z75 platform. Not all LGA1155 chipsets permit CPU multiplier overclocking. Overclocking raises heat and power demands and may affect stability; use an appropriately rated cooler and verify BIOS settings. No particular overclock or performance result is guaranteed.</p><h3>Uses and performance</h3><p>The 4-core/8-thread processor can be used for compatible legacy gaming PCs, everyday productivity and multitasking. Gaming results depend on GPU, RAM, storage and software. Intel HD Graphics 4000 supports basic display output where the motherboard offers compatible ports.</p><h3>Intel i7-3770K FAQs</h3><p><strong>Does the i7-3770K support DDR3?</strong> Yes, Intel specifies DDR3-1333/1600, subject to motherboard support.</p><p><strong>Does i7-3770K work on H61?</strong> Only on specific supported H61 motherboards with a suitable Ivy Bridge-compatible BIOS. Check the motherboard manufacturer''s CPU list.</p><p><strong>Can the i7-3770K be overclocked?</strong> Its multiplier is unlocked, but suitable chipset, BIOS, cooling and power delivery are required.</p><p><strong>Does it have integrated graphics?</strong> Yes, Intel HD Graphics 4000.</p><p><strong>Does the processor include a cooler, warranty or a specific physical condition?</strong> Cooler inclusion, condition and warranty have not been verified; confirm with SakoonSay before ordering.</p><p><strong>Is it currently available?</strong> Yes, 3 units available at the time of update; stock may change. Contact SakoonSay Gaming Store for an updated stock estimate.</p><p><small>Intel references: <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/sku/65523/intel-core-i73770k-processor-8m-cache-up-to-3-90-ghz/specifications.html">official specifications</a> and <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/sku/65523/intel-core-i73770k-processor-8m-cache-up-to-3-90-ghz/ordering.html">official tray SKU and S-spec</a>. Featured image is AI-generated illustrative artwork of the Intel Core i7-3770K model, not a real photograph of SakoonSay inventory. Cosmetic markings and batch codes may differ from actual stock.</small></p>','\n',char(10)),7999,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/intel-core-i7-3770k-ai-illustration_b298de41-7e08-4ada-8eac-748ee4c1d9a3.png?v=1791540627','https://sakoonsay.com/products/intel-core-i7-3770k-3rd-gen-processor-price-in-pakistan-unlocked-lga1155.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:02:56');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3955,'15405093519413','intel-core-i7-4770s-4th-gen-processor-price-in-pakistan-65w-lga1150','Intel Core i7-4770S 4th Gen Processor Price in Pakistan | 65W LGA1150',replace('<h2>Intel Core i7-4770S 4th Gen Processor Price in Pakistan</h2><p>Explore the <strong>Intel Core i7-4770S 4th Generation Haswell desktop processor</strong> at SakoonSay Gaming Store, Faisalabad, Pakistan. Listed price: <strong>Rs. 6,999</strong>. The i7-4770S offers four CPU cores, eight threads, a 3.10GHz base frequency, up to 3.90GHz Intel Turbo Boost and a 65W thermal design power (TDP), making it an option for upgrading compatible LGA1150 DDR3 desktops where lower rated processor power matters.</p><h3>Intel Core i7-4770S specifications</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Generation / architecture:</strong> 4th Gen Intel Core i7, Haswell, 22nm</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cores / threads:</strong> 4 / 8 with Hyper-Threading</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Base clock / maximum turbo:</strong> 3.10GHz / 3.90GHz</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cache:</strong> 8MB Intel Smart Cache</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Socket:</strong> FCLGA1150</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Processor TDP:</strong> 65W (not whole-system power consumption)</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Supported memory:</strong> DDR3-1333/1600 and DDR3L-1333/1600, subject to motherboard support</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Integrated graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4600</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Official tray/OEM ordering code:</strong> CM8064601465504</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Intel S-spec:</strong> SR14H</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Stepping:</strong> C0</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Intel lifecycle:</strong> Discontinued</li>\n</ul><h3>LGA1150 motherboard and BIOS compatibility</h3><p>The i7-4770S is designed for supported LGA1150 desktop motherboards. Depending on the exact board and BIOS version, examples may include Intel H81, B85, H87, Z87, H97 and Z97 chipset-based motherboards. <strong>Socket match alone does not guarantee compatibility:</strong> confirm that your motherboard manufacturer''s CPU support list explicitly includes i7-4770S and check the minimum BIOS revision before ordering. It does not fit LGA1151, LGA1200 or DDR4/DDR5-only systems.</p><h3>Suitable upgrades and performance</h3><p>Four cores and eight threads can handle compatible older office PCs, multitasking, general productivity and some older games with an appropriate graphics card. Actual results depend on memory, graphics card, cooling and application demands. Intel HD Graphics 4600 provides basic integrated display capabilities when motherboard video outputs support them. The CPU requires suitable cooling; whether a cooler is included is unverified.</p><h3>Intel Core i7-4770S price and availability in Pakistan</h3><p><strong>Price: Rs. 6,999.</strong> <strong>Currently in stock: 5 units at the time of this update; availability may change.</strong> Contact SakoonSay Gaming Store in Faisalabad to confirm availability and compatibility. <strong>Product condition, cooler/accessory inclusion and warranty are not verified</strong> and should not be assumed from this listing.</p><h3>Frequently asked questions</h3><p><strong>Does the Intel i7-4770S support DDR3 RAM?</strong> Yes, supported DDR3/DDR3L 1333MHz or 1600MHz memory on compatible LGA1150 boards.</p><p><strong>What is the difference between i7-4770 and i7-4770S?</strong> The S variant has a lower 65W rated TDP and a 3.10GHz base clock. Both offer 4 cores, 8 threads and up to 3.90GHz turbo.</p><p><strong>Will i7-4770S work on H81 or B85?</strong> It may work if the specific motherboard model and installed BIOS explicitly support it.</p><p><strong>Does i7-4770S have built-in graphics?</strong> Yes, Intel HD Graphics 4600, subject to compatible motherboard display connections.</p><p><strong>Is the CPU unlocked for overclocking?</strong> No, this is not a K-series unlocked multiplier model.</p><p><strong>Is a CPU cooler or warranty included?</strong> These details have not been verified. Please contact the store before purchasing.</p><p><small>Manufacturer references: <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/sku/75124/intel-core-i74770s-processor-8m-cache-up-to-3-90-ghz/specifications.html">Intel specifications</a> and <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/sku/75124/intel-core-i74770s-processor-8m-cache-up-to-3-90-ghz/ordering.html">Intel tray ordering information</a>. Featured image is AI-generated illustrative artwork of an Intel Core i7-4770S processor, not an authentic product photograph or a depiction of SakoonSay inventory. Etched markings and cosmetic details may not match the physical item.</small></p>','\n',char(10)),6999,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/intel-core-i7-4770s-ai-illustration_6f0fc31d-216d-4e3b-ae53-c2ac9196fb39.png?v=1791540335','https://sakoonsay.com/products/intel-core-i7-4770s-4th-gen-processor-price-in-pakistan-65w-lga1150.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:02:56');
