dels may include selected H81, B85, H87, Z87, H97 and Z97 boards. BIOS revisions, board power delivery and memory compatibility matter. Z-series chipsets are generally appropriate for unlocked multiplier overclocking; other chipsets may operate the CPU at supported standard speeds. It does <strong>not</strong> fit LGA1151, LGA1200 or modern DDR4/DDR5 platforms. Verify your motherboard model and BIOS version before ordering.</p><h3>Gaming and everyday PC upgrades</h3><p>Four cores and eight threads can serve office work, web browsing, general multitasking, older games and light editing on a properly configured PC. Actual performance depends on GPU, RAM, storage and software. Intel HD Graphics 4600 supports basic display tasks on motherboards with compatible video output. A cooling solution suitable for the 84W TDP is required; included cooler is not confirmed.</p><h3>Intel Core i7-4770K price in Pakistan and availability</h3><p><strong>Listed price: Rs. 9,999.</strong> <strong>Currently out of stock: 0 units available.</strong> SakoonSay Gaming Store is based in Faisalabad and serves customers across Pakistan. Please confirm current stock and compatibility before placing an order. Product condition, included accessories, cooler and warranty have not been verified and are not promised.</p><h3>Frequently asked questions</h3><p><strong>What is the difference between Intel i7-4770 and i7-4770K?</strong> Both have 4 cores and 8 threads; the K model offers an unlocked CPU multiplier and a 3.50GHz base frequency. Turbo frequency is up to 3.90GHz on both.</p><p><strong>Does i7-4770K support DDR4?</strong> No. This 4th Gen platform uses compatible DDR3 or DDR3L RAM.</p><p><strong>Will it work in an H81 motherboard?</strong> Only when the exact motherboard model and BIOS list i7-4770K support.</p><p><strong>Can I overclock this CPU?</strong> The multiplier is unlocked, but overclocking depends on a suitable motherboard, BIOS, power delivery and cooling.</p><p><strong>Does the CPU include a cooler or warranty?</strong> These have not been confirmed for this listing; contact SakoonSay before ordering.</p><p><small>Specifications and tray identification verified against <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/sku/75123/intel-core-i74770k-processor-8m-cache-up-to-3-90-ghz/specifications.html">Intel specifications</a> and <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/sku/75123/intel-core-i74770k-processor-8m-cache-up-to-3-90-ghz/ordering.html">Intel ordering information</a>. Featured photograph shows an actual Intel Core i7-4770K SR147 processor and is sourced as a third-party reference from <a href="https://compsoft.com.ua/p23713785-protsessor-intel-core.html">CompSoft''s product listing</a>; it is not a photograph of SakoonSay stock. Image reuse rights have not been verified; replace with a licensed or store-owned photograph when available.</small></p>','\n',char(10)),9999,NULL,0,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/intel-core-i7-4770k-sr147-real-cpu-reference_0a3c551c-8fbb-4355-8f81-b46c567f79f0.jpg?v=1791539932','https://sakoonsay.com/products/intel-core-i7-4770k-4th-gen-processor-price-in-pakistan-3-9ghz-lga1150.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:02:56');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3957,'15405085982773','intel-core-i7-4790k-4th-gen-processor-price-in-pakistan-4-4ghz-lga1150','Intel Core i7-4790K 4th Gen Processor Price in Pakistan | 4.4GHz LGA1150',replace('<h2>Intel Core i7-4790K 4th Gen Processor Price in Pakistan</h2><p>Explore the <strong>Intel Core i7-4790K 4th Generation Devil''s Canyon desktop processor</strong> at <strong>Rs. 11,999</strong> from SakoonSay Gaming Store, Faisalabad, Pakistan. With <strong>4 cores, 8 threads, a 4.00GHz base frequency and up to 4.40GHz Intel Turbo Boost</strong>, the unlocked i7-4790K is an upgrade option for supported LGA1150 DDR3 desktop computers, older gaming PCs and everyday multitasking.</p><h3>Intel Core i7-4790K specifications</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Generation:</strong> 4th Gen Intel Core i7, Devil''s Canyon (22nm)</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cores / threads:</strong> 4 / 8</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Base / max turbo:</strong> 4.00GHz / 4.40GHz</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Intel Smart Cache:</strong> 8MB</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Socket:</strong> FCLGA1150</li>\n<li>\n<strong>TDP:</strong> 88W</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Integrated graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4600</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Memory:</strong> DDR3-1333/1600 or DDR3L-1333/1600 at 1.5V; maximum 32GB depending on system</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Multiplier:</strong> Unlocked; overclocking requires compatible board and suitable cooling</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Official Intel tray SKU:</strong> CM8064601710501</li>\n<li>\n<strong>S-spec:</strong> SR219</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Stepping:</strong> C0</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Packaging category:</strong> Tray/OEM</li>\n</ul><h3>LGA1150 motherboard compatibility</h3><p>The Intel Core i7-4790K uses the <strong>LGA1150</strong> socket. Compatible motherboards may include selected H81, B85, H87, Z87, H97 and Z97 models, but support depends on the exact motherboard, manufacturer CPU support list and BIOS revision. Some 8-series motherboards require a BIOS update for Devil''s Canyon CPUs. Multiplier overclocking generally requires an appropriate Z-series board and adequate cooling. This processor is <strong>not compatible with LGA1151 or LGA1200</strong> motherboards. Confirm your motherboard model and BIOS before purchase.</p><h3>Gaming, productivity and graphics</h3><p>The i7-4790K can be paired with a compatible graphics card for older games, everyday office applications, browsing and light editing. Results in modern games depend on the GPU, RAM, storage and software requirements. Intel HD Graphics 4600 provides basic display output when the motherboard offers supported display connectors. The 88W processor needs an appropriate cooling solution; cooler inclusion is not confirmed.</p><h3>Intel i7-4790K price and stock in Pakistan</h3><p><strong>Price: Rs. 11,999.</strong> <strong>Currently out of stock: 0 units available.</strong> SakoonSay Gaming Store serves customers in Faisalabad and across Pakistan. Check current availability, CPU compatibility and ordering details before purchase. New or used condition, warranty period, and bundled accessories have not been verified and are not promised.</p><h3>Frequently asked questions</h3><p><strong>Is i7-4790K better than i7-4790?</strong> The unlocked i7-4790K has a higher 4.00GHz base and up to 4.40GHz turbo frequency compared with the standard i7-4790; real-world performance depends on the workload and system.</p><p><strong>Will i7-4790K work on an H81 or B85 motherboard?</strong> Only when that exact board model and BIOS list the CPU as supported. Confirm before ordering.</p><p><strong>Can i7-4790K use DDR4 RAM?</strong> No. This platform uses supported DDR3/DDR3L memory, not DDR4.</p><p><strong>Does it have integrated graphics?</strong> Yes, Intel HD Graphics 4600, subject to compatible motherboard display output.</p><p><strong>Does it come with a cooler or warranty?</strong> Cooler inclusion and warranty terms are not verified; please contact the store before ordering.</p><p><small>Featured photo is a genuine Intel Core i7-4790K installed on a motherboard, photographed by Metro Wind, sourced from <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Intel_i7_4790k_on_Board.jpg">Wikimedia Commons</a> under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/">CC BY-SA 2.0</a>; no edits made. This is a reference image, not a photo of SakoonSay inventory. Technical references: <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/sku/80807/intel-core-i74790k-processor-8m-cache-up-to-4-40-ghz/specifications.html">Intel specifications</a> and <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/sku/80807/intel-core-i74790k-processor-8m-cache-up-to-4-40-ghz/ordering.html">Intel ordering information</a>.</small></p>','\n',char(10)),11999,NULL,0,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/intel-i7-4790k-genuine-on-motherboard-metro-wind_f3a581ea-de26-436d-bc54-03d9ac62e29a.jpg?v=1791539760','https://sakoonsay.com/products/intel-core-i7-4790k-4th-gen-processor-price-in-pakistan-4-4ghz-lga1150.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:02:56');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3958,'15405082476597','intel-core-i7-6700t-6th-gen-processor-price-in-pakistan-35w-lga1151','Intel Core i7-6700T 6th Gen Processor Price in Pakistan | 35W LGA1151',replace('<h2>Intel Core i7-6700T 6th Gen Processor Price in Pakistan</h2><p>Explore the <strong>Intel Core i7-6700T 6th Generation Skylake desktop processor</strong> at <strong>Rs. 11,999</strong> from SakoonSay Gaming Store in Faisalabad, Pakistan. Designed for compatible power-efficient desktop systems, the i7-6700T offers <strong>4 cores, 8 threads, 2.80GHz base frequency, up to 3.60GHz Intel Turbo Boost</strong> and a <strong>35W TDP</strong>. It can be a practical upgrade for supported office desktops, compact PCs and everyday multitasking systems.</p><h3>Intel Core i7-6700T specifications</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Generation / architecture:</strong> Intel Core i7 6th Gen, Skylake, 14nm</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Core / thread count:</strong> 4 cores / 8 threads</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Processor base frequency:</strong> 2.80GHz</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Maximum turbo frequency:</strong> 3.60GHz</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cache:</strong> 8MB Intel Smart Cache</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thermal design power (TDP):</strong> 35W</li>\n<li>\n<strong>CPU socket:</strong> FCLGA1151</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Integrated graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 530</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Supported memory:</strong> DDR4-1866/2133 or DDR3L-1333/1600 at 1.35V, up to 64GB depending on system and motherboard</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Multiplier:</strong> Locked</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Official Intel tray ordering SKU:</strong> CM8066201920202</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Tray S-spec:</strong> SR2L3; earlier S-spec SR2BU</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Stepping:</strong> R0</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Packaging category:</strong> Tray/OEM</li>\n</ul><h3>Compatible motherboards and RAM</h3><p>The Intel i7-6700T uses an LGA1151 socket and requires a motherboard whose manufacturer specifically lists support for this CPU. Many Intel 100-series chipset boards and selected 200-series boards can support 6th Gen Skylake processors with the correct BIOS. Not all LGA1151 boards work: Intel 300-series motherboards intended for 8th/9th Gen CPUs are not compatible with the i7-6700T. Check the exact motherboard model, CPU support list, BIOS version, supported DDR4/DDR3L memory and cooling arrangement before purchasing.</p><h3>Who should choose the 35W i7-6700T?</h3><p>The i7-6700T is suitable for customers seeking a lower-power compatible processor for office work, browsing, accounting applications, light editing and some older games. The 35W design favors lower power requirements over the higher sustained clock speeds of standard i7-6700 and unlocked i7-6700K models. Gaming and editing performance depends on graphics card, RAM, storage, software and thermal conditions. Intel HD Graphics 530 can provide display output where supported by the motherboard.</p><h3>Intel i7-6700T price and availability in Pakistan</h3><p><strong>Listed price: Rs. 11,999.</strong> <strong>Currently in stock: 10 units at the time of this update; availability may change.</strong> SakoonSay Gaming Store serves customers in Faisalabad and throughout Pakistan. Please confirm availability, motherboard compatibility, and order details before purchasing. New/used condition, included cooler, warranty duration and accessories have not been verified and are not promised in this listing.</p><h3>Frequently asked questions</h3><p><strong>Is the Intel Core i7-6700T a desktop CPU?</strong> Yes. It is a 6th Gen Skylake desktop processor using the LGA1151 socket.</p><p><strong>What is the difference between i7-6700T and i7-6700?</strong> The i7-6700T has a 35W TDP and 2.80GHz base/3.60GHz turbo speeds, while the standard i7-6700 is a higher-clocked 65W model.</p><p><strong>Can I install i7-6700T in an H110 or B150 motherboard?</strong> Only if the specific motherboard model and BIOS support the processor; verify the manufacturer CPU compatibility list.</p><p><strong>Does the i7-6700T have built-in graphics?</strong> Yes, Intel HD Graphics 530; motherboard display output support is required.</p><p><strong>Does it include a CPU cooler or warranty?</strong> These details have not been confirmed for store stock; contact SakoonSay before ordering.</p><p><small>Product image: genuine Intel Core i7-6700T SR2L3 physical CPU reference photograph from <a href="https://www.ebay.co.uk/p/1853389304">third-party eBay listing</a>, not SakoonSay''s own unit; commercial image rights are unverified. Intel technical references: <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/sku/88200/intel-core-i76700t-processor-8m-cache-up-to-3-60-ghz/specifications.html">official specifications</a>, <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/sku/88200/intel-core-i76700t-processor-8m-cache-up-to-3-60-ghz/ordering.html">ordering details</a>.</small></p>','\n',char(10)),11999,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/intel-core-i7-6700t-sr2l3-real-cpu-reference.jpg?v=1791539382','https://sakoonsay.com/products/intel-core-i7-6700t-6th-gen-processor-price-in-pakistan-35w-lga1151.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:02:56');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3959,'15405073793077','intel-core-i7-6700k-6th-gen-processor-price-in-pakistan-4-2ghz-lga1151','Intel Core i7-6700K 6th Gen Processor Price in Pakistan | 4.2GHz LGA1151',replace('<h2>Intel Core i7-6700K 6th Gen Processor Price in Pakistan</h2><p>Shop the <strong>Intel Core i7-6700K 6th Generation Skylake desktop processor</strong> at <strong>Rs. 14,999</strong> from SakoonSay Gaming Store in Faisalabad, Pakistan. The unlocked i7-6700K delivers <strong>4 cores, 8 threads, a 4.00GHz base clock and up to 4.20GHz Intel Turbo Boost</strong>, making it a practical option for compatible older gaming desktops, workstation upgrades and everyday multitasking.</p><h3>Intel Core i7-6700K technical specifications</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Generation / architecture:</strong> 6th Gen Intel Core i7, Skylake (14nm)</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cores / threads:</strong> 4 / 8</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Base / maximum turbo frequency:</strong> 4.00GHz / 4.20GHz</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cache:</strong> 8MB Intel Smart Cache</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Socket:</strong> FCLGA1151</li>\n<li>\n<strong>TDP:</strong> 91W</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Integrated GPU:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 530</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Memory support:</strong> DDR4-1866/2133 or DDR3L-1333/1600 at 1.35V, up to 64GB, depending on motherboard</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Multiplier:</strong> Unlocked, subject to compatible motherboard and adequate cooling</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Intel tray ordering SKU:</strong> CM8066201919901</li>\n<li>\n<strong>S-spec:</strong> SR2L0 (earlier revision SR2BR)</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Stepping:</strong> R0</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Packaging type:</strong> Tray/OEM processor listing</li>\n</ul><h3>Motherboard compatibility and cooling</h3><p>The Core i7-6700K requires a compatible LGA1151 motherboard. Intel 100-series motherboards are typical matches; some 200-series boards also support 6th Gen CPUs when listed in the manufacturer CPU support list and with an appropriate BIOS. The shared LGA1151 name does <strong>not</strong> mean Intel 300-series 8th/9th Gen boards are compatible. Check the exact motherboard model and BIOS version before ordering. The 91W processor requires an appropriate CPU cooler; <strong>cooler inclusion is not confirmed</strong> for this listing. Overclocking requires a suitable unlocked chipset motherboard and cooling, and may affect reliability.</p><h3>Gaming, editing and everyday use</h3><p>The i7-6700K can be paired with a compatible graphics card for older and less demanding PC games, office applications, browsing and light content creation. Performance in modern games and editing workloads varies with the GPU, RAM, storage and software requirements. Intel HD Graphics 530 provides integrated display capability where supported by the motherboard.</p><h3>Intel i7-6700K price and availability in Pakistan</h3><p><strong>Listed price: Rs. 14,999.</strong> <strong>Currently in stock: 5 units at the time of this update; availability may change.</strong> Customers in Faisalabad and across Pakistan can check with SakoonSay Gaming Store for availability and compatibility before ordering. This listing does not assert new or used condition, warranty duration, or included accessories; please confirm these details with the store.</p><h3>Frequently asked questions</h3><p><strong>Is the Intel Core i7-6700K unlocked?</strong> Yes. Multiplier overclocking depends on motherboard chipset and cooling.</p><p><strong>Does the i7-6700K work with H110, B150, Z170 or Z270?</strong> Compatibility depends on the individual board and BIOS; check the manufacturer''s CPU support list. Z-series chipsets are typically required for multiplier overclocking.</p><p><strong>Can it run without a separate graphics card?</strong> It has Intel HD Graphics 530; display output requires compatible motherboard video connections and firmware support.</p><p><strong>Does the processor include a cooler or a warranty?</strong> Neither cooler inclusion nor warranty terms have been verified for this stock; confirm before purchase.</p><p><small>Processor photo is a genuine i7-6700K model reference, not a photo of SakoonSay''s own unit. Image credit: Eric Gaba (Wikimedia Commons user Sting), <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Intel_CPU_Core_i7_6700K_Skylake_top.jpg">Wikimedia Commons</a>, <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>; image used unmodified. Technical information: <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/sku/88195/intel-core-i76700k-processor-8m-cache-up-to-4-20-ghz/specifications.html">Intel official specifications</a> and <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/sku/88195/intel-core-i76700k-processor-8m-cache-up-to-4-20-ghz/ordering.html">Intel ordering codes</a>.</small></p>','\n',char(10)),14999,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/intel-core-i7-6700k-real-cpu-eric-gaba-commons.jpg?v=1791539221','https://sakoonsay.com/products/intel-core-i7-6700k-6th-gen-processor-price-in-pakistan-4-2ghz-lga1151.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:02:56');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3960,'15405066649653','intel-core-i7-7700t-7th-gen-processor-price-in-pakistan-35w-lga1151','Intel Core i7-7700T 7th Gen Processor Price in Pakistan | 35W LGA1151',replace('<h2>Intel Core i7-7700T 7th Generation Processor Price in Pakistan</h2><p>Buy the <strong>Intel Core i7-7700T processor in Pakistan</strong> from SakoonSay Gaming Store, Faisalabad, at <strong>Rs. 15,999</strong>. This 7th Generation Kaby Lake desktop CPU features <strong>4 cores, 8 threads, 2.90GHz base frequency, up to 3.80GHz Intel Turbo Boost</strong> and a power-efficient <strong>35W TDP</strong>. It is designed for compatible LGA1151 desktop PC upgrades, office computers and compact low-power systems.</p><h3>Intel Core i7-7700T specifications</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Model:</strong> Intel Core i7-7700T (7th Gen Kaby Lake)</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cores / Threads:</strong> 4 / 8</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Base / Max Turbo:</strong> 2.90GHz / 3.80GHz</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cache:</strong> 8MB Intel Smart Cache</li>\n<li>\n<strong>TDP:</strong> 35W</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Socket:</strong> FCLGA1151</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Memory:</strong> DDR4-2133/2400 or DDR3L-1333/1600, subject to motherboard compatibility; up to 64GB</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Integrated graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 630</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Overclocking:</strong> Locked</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Official Intel tray SKU:</strong> CM8067702868416</li>\n<li>\n<strong>S-spec:</strong> SR339</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Stepping:</strong> B0</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Shipping configuration:</strong> Tray/OEM</li>\n</ul><h3>Motherboard and RAM compatibility</h3><p>The Intel Core i7-7700T uses the LGA1151 socket and can work with supported Intel 100-series and 200-series chipset desktop motherboards, subject to the motherboard maker''s CPU support list and BIOS version. Not every LGA1151 motherboard is compatible: Intel 300-series motherboards for 8th/9th Gen CPUs do not support this 7th Gen processor. Check the exact motherboard model, firmware, memory type and thermal design before purchasing.</p><h3>Is the i7-7700T good for gaming and office PCs?</h3><p>Its 4-core/8-thread design can handle compatible office and everyday applications and some games when paired with suitable components. The 35W TDP prioritizes reduced power use; demanding gaming performance depends on the GPU, RAM, cooling, game and settings. Intel HD Graphics 630 enables basic display output with a compatible motherboard, while a dedicated GPU is recommended for demanding games.</p><h3>Intel Core i7-7700T price and availability in Pakistan</h3><p><strong>Price: Rs. 15,999.</strong> Currently in stock: 10 units at the time of this update; availability can change. SakoonSay Gaming Store serves Faisalabad and customers across Pakistan. Confirm current availability and motherboard compatibility before ordering.</p><h3>Frequently asked questions</h3><p><strong>What is the difference between i7-7700T and i7-7700?</strong> The 7700T is a 35W lower-power variant with 2.90GHz base and up to 3.80GHz turbo; the standard i7-7700 has higher clock speeds and a 65W TDP.</p><p><strong>Does i7-7700T work with all LGA1151 boards?</strong> No. Chipset and BIOS compatibility must be checked.</p><p><strong>Does it include a cooler or warranty?</strong> Product condition, cooler inclusion and warranty terms have not been verified for future inventory; confirm them before ordering.</p><p><small>Reference image: genuine i7-7700T SR339 processor photograph from a third-party <a href="https://www.ebay.com/itm/126693161551">eBay listing</a>, not SakoonSay stock. Image rights remain with their owner. Manufacturer details: <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/sku/97122/intel-core-i77700t-processor-8m-cache-up-to-3-80-ghz/specifications.html">Intel specifications</a> and <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/sku/97122/intel-core-i77700t-processor-8m-cache-up-to-3-80-ghz/ordering.html">Intel ordering code</a>.</small></p>','\n',char(10)),15999,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/intel-core-i7-7700t-sr339-real-cpu-reference.jpg?v=1791539002','https://sakoonsay.com/products/intel-core-i7-7700t-7th-gen-processor-price-in-pakistan-35w-lga1151.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:02:56');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(3961,'15405060128821','intel-core-i7-7700k-7th-gen-b0-tray-oem-processor-4-cores-8-threads-lga1151','Intel Core i7-7700K 7th Gen Processor Price in Pakistan | 4.5GHz LGA1151',replace('<h2>Intel Core i7-7700K 7th Generation Processor Price in Pakistan</h2><p>Buy the <strong>Intel Core i7-7700K processor in Pakistan</strong> from SakoonSay Gaming Store, Faisalabad, for <strong>Rs. 22,999</strong>. This 7th Gen Kaby Lake desktop CPU delivers 4 cores, 8 threads, a 4.20 GHz base clock and up to 4.50 GHz Intel Turbo Boost frequency. Designed for compatible LGA1151 desktop systems, the unlocked i7-7700K is an option for gaming PC upgrades and everyday productivity.</p><h3>Intel Core i7-7700K specifications</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-7700K, 7th Gen Kaby Lake</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cores / threads:</strong> 4 / 8</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Clock speeds:</strong> 4.20 GHz base, up to 4.50 GHz turbo</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cache:</strong> 8 MB Intel Smart Cache</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Socket:</strong> FCLGA1151</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Power:</strong> 91W TDP</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Memory:</strong> DDR4-2133/2400 or DDR3L-1333/1600, subject to compatible motherboard; up to 64 GB</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 630</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Multiplier:</strong> Unlocked, with compatible board and cooling</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Official Intel tray SKU:</strong> CM8067702868535</li>\n<li>\n<strong>S-spec / stepping:</strong> SR33A / B0</li>\n</ul><h3>Motherboard compatibility and upgrade guidance</h3><p>The Intel Core i7-7700K uses the LGA1151 socket and supports compatible Intel 100-series and 200-series chipset motherboards, subject to manufacturer BIOS support. Not all LGA1151 boards are compatible: Intel 300-series motherboards designed for 8th/9th Gen CPUs are not interchangeable. Check your exact motherboard model and BIOS version before purchase. A suitable cooling solution is needed, especially for sustained turbo or overclocking.</p><h3>Intel i7-7700K price and availability in Pakistan</h3><p><strong>Price: Rs. 22,999.</strong> Shopify inventory is tracked; available stock may change. SakoonSay Gaming Store serves customers in Faisalabad and across Pakistan. Check the current product page availability before placing an order.</p><h3>Frequently asked questions</h3><p><strong>Does the Intel i7-7700K support gaming?</strong> Yes. It can run games when paired with compatible hardware; actual FPS depends on the graphics card, memory, game and settings.</p><p><strong>Does the i7-7700K need a dedicated graphics card?</strong> Not for basic display output on a compatible motherboard, because Intel HD Graphics 630 is integrated. A dedicated GPU is recommended for demanding games.</p><p><strong>Does the i7-7700K work with every LGA1151 motherboard?</strong> No. Check chipset and BIOS support; the same socket name alone does not guarantee compatibility.</p><p><strong>Is a cooler or warranty included?</strong> Cooler inclusion, item condition and warranty terms have not been independently verified for these units; confirm details with SakoonSay before purchasing.</p><p><small>Product photo: genuine Intel Core i7-7700K reference image sourced from <a href="https://www.cpumedics.com/intel-bxc80677i77700k-4-20ghz-lga1151-8mb-intel-core-i7-7700k-4-core-cpu-processor/">CPU Medics</a>, not a photograph of SakoonSay stock. Image rights remain with the owner. Manufacturer specifications: <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/sku/97129/intel-core-i77700k-processor-8m-cache-up-to-4-50-ghz/specifications.html">Intel</a>.</small></p>','\n',char(10)),22999,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/intel-core-i7-7700k-sr33a-physical-reference-cpumedics.jpg?v=1791538810','h