t imply endorsement by the photographer.</p><p>Official <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/products/sku/126684/intel-core-i78700k-processor-12m-cache-up-to-4-70-ghz/ordering.html">Intel ordering and S-spec information</a>.</p>','\n',char(10)),39999,NULL,0,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/intel-core-i7-8700k-sr3qr-genuine-cpu-photo-wikimedia.jpg?v=1791538188','https://sakoonsay.com/products/intel-core-i7-8700k-8th-gen-tray-oem-processor-6-cores-12-threads-lga1151.js','Processors',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:02:56');
