pplied without box. RAM, HDD and mixed-brand PSU are system-pulled. RAM consists of two 8GB DDR4 2133/2400MHz modules. NVMe brand and model vary with stock. Used GPU listing specifies a 15-day checking warranty; confirm terms for other components.</p><p>Complete-build availability requires confirmation: GTX 1660 SUPER and 1TB HDD currently show zero catalog stock. Contact the store before ordering.</p><h2>Assembly Checks</h2><p>Confirm motherboard BIOS support for i5-9600KF, matching RAM, LGA1151 cooler mounting hardware, case clearances and CPU temperatures under load. No CPU overclocking is promised. Select a quality PSU with adequate verified 12V output and required native PCIe power connectors. The KF CPU requires the dedicated GPU for display.</p><p>Monitor, keyboard, mouse, headset, Windows licence and separate assembly charges are excluded. Main image is an illustrative build render; actual component appearance and lighting may vary.</p>','\n',char(10)),143999,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/sakoonsay-i5-9600kf-gtx-1660-super-boost-unicorn.png?v=1791369613','https://sakoonsay.com/products/sakoonsay-intel-i5-9600kf-gtx-1660-super-gaming-pc-asus-tuf-z370-16gb-ram-256gb-nvme-1tb-hdd.js','Gaming PC',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:03:47');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(4075,'15403106041909','sakoonsay-60k-gaming-pc-intel-i7-4790-gtx-1060-3gb-16gb-ram-128gb-ssd','SakoonSay 60K Gaming PC – Intel i7-4790 & GTX 1060 3GB | 16GB RAM | 128GB SSD',replace('<p>Budget gaming PC featuring Intel Core i7-4790, GIGABYTE GTX 1060 3GB graphics, 16GB DDR3 RAM (8GB + 8GB) and 128GB SSD storage. Intel stock cooler included free.</p><h2>Component Breakdown</h2><table>\n<tr>\n<th>Component</th>\n<th>Price (PKR)</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Intel Core i7-4790 — 4 cores, 8 threads</td>\n<td>8,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ASUS H81M-C motherboard</td>\n<td>5,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16GB DDR3 — 2 × 8GB system-pulled RAM</td>\n<td>7,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GIGABYTE GTX 1060 3GB GDDR5</td>\n<td>27,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>128GB used SSD — select compatible 2.5-inch SATA unit</td>\n<td>4,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>650W used system-pulled PSU</td>\n<td>6,500</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Used desktop case — mixed model, without case fans</td>\n<td>3,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Intel stock cooler — compatible LGA1150 unit</td>\n<td>Free</td>\n</tr>\n</table><p><strong>Total: Rs. 60,500.</strong></p><h2>Condition and Availability</h2><p>RAM, SSD, PSU and case are used/system-pulled. Confirm remaining component condition and warranty with the store. The case varies by stock; the main image is an illustrative render. SSD brand, PSU brand and case design shown are representative. DVD drive is not included in this quotation.</p><p>Complete-build availability requires confirmation: the used case currently shows zero catalog stock, while SSD product and variant stock readings differ. No complete-build stock is claimed.</p><h2>Assembly Checks</h2><p>Confirm i7-4790 BIOS support, matching DDR3 modules, suitable Intel stock cooler and case clearances. Select a quality PSU with adequate verified 12V output and correct native GTX 1060 PCIe power connectors. Case fans are not included; suitable airflow must be arranged before operation.</p><p>Monitor, keyboard, mouse, headset, Windows licence, additional case fans and separate assembly charges are excluded. The 128GB SSD provides limited game storage; larger storage can be quoted separately.</p>','\n',char(10)),60500,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/sakoonsay-i7-4790-gtx-1060-3gb-16gb-gaming-pc.png?v=1791369031','https://sakoonsay.com/products/sakoonsay-60k-gaming-pc-intel-i7-4790-gtx-1060-3gb-16gb-ram-128gb-ssd.js','Gaming PC',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:03:47');
