: 19.5938px;">\n<td style="width: 80.5005%; height: 19.5938px;">FROZER AURA M-ATX Black Case — 3 ARGB Infinity Fans</td>\n<td style="width: 16.6676%; height: 19.5938px;">10,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style="height: 19.5938px;">\n<td style="width: 80.5005%; height: 19.5938px;">FROZER FR-200 Pro Black Air Cooler</td>\n<td style="width: 16.6676%; height: 19.5938px;">2,000</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>Total: Rs. 196,499.</strong></p>\n<p>Monitor, keyboard, mouse, headset, Windows licence and any separate assembly charges are excluded.</p>\n<h2>Condition and Availability</h2>\n<p>This build includes a used graphics card and system-pulled RAM. The used GPU has a 15-day checking warranty. Confirm remaining component warranties with the store.</p>\n<p>Availability is subject to component stock confirmation. The graphics card currently shows zero catalog stock; PSU stock readings require confirmation. Contact SakoonSay Gaming Store before ordering.</p>\n<p>Final assembly requires confirmation of Ryzen-compatible BIOS, matching RAM, AM4 cooler mounting hardware and case clearances. Main image is an illustrative build render; actual appearance may vary.</p>','\n',char(10)),196499,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/sakoonsay-ryzen-5600x-rtx-3060-ti-gaming-pc.png?v=1791366784','https://sakoonsay.com/products/sakoonsay-200k-gaming-pc-ryzen-5-5600x-rtx-3060-ti-16gb-ram-256gb-nvme.js','Gaming PC',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:03:47');
