 PC use?</h4>\n<p>It is configured with an AMD Ryzen 7 5700X and ZOTAC GeForce RTX 3070 Twin Edge 8GB graphics card.</p>\n<h4>How much memory and storage does the build include?</h4>\n<p>The build includes 16GB DDR4 memory (2 × 8GB), a 512GB NVMe SSD and a 1TB desktop HDD.</p>\n<h4>Is this Ryzen 7 5700X PC available?</h4>\n<p>One complete unit is listed in stock. Please confirm availability with SakoonSay before placing an order.</p>\n<p><em>Feature image is an AI-generated illustration of the planned configuration; actual case and component appearance may vary.</em></p>','\n',char(10)),245000,246998,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/sakoonsay-ryzen-7-5700x-rtx-3070-gaming-pc.png?v=1791623869','https://sakoonsay.com/products/sakoonsay-ryzen-7-5700x-rtx-3070-gaming-pc-16gb-ddr4-512gb-nvme-1tb-hdd.js','Gaming PC',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:02:40');
