 It supports hardware ray tracing and DLSS Super Resolution in compatible games. Performance depends on the game, resolution, CPU and settings.</p>\n<h3>Can I use it for streaming or editing?</h3><p>Yes. NVENC and NVIDIA Studio drivers support streaming and compatible creative software.</p>\n<h3>Will it work with a PCIe 3.0 motherboard?</h3><p>PCIe is backward compatible. A suitable PCIe x16 slot, sufficient case clearance and an appropriate power supply are required.</p>\n<h3>Is a retail box included?</h3><p>No. This graphics card is supplied without its retail box.</p>\n<p><small>Product gallery uses original catalog/model reference images; actual stock condition may vary.</small></p>\n<p><a href="/collections/graphics-cards">Browse graphics cards</a> or <a href="/collections/nvidia-gpus">compare NVIDIA GPUs</a>.</p>','\n',char(10)),90000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/galax-rtx-3070-ex-white-front_0057d060-d5ab-44b4-8a8e-54b09ce8a2a0.jpg?v=1792261304','https://sakoonsay.com/products/galax-geforce-rtx-3070-ex-gamer-white-8gb-gddr6-graphics-card.js','Graphics Cards',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:02:34');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(14442,'15412484145205','amd-ryzen-5-2600x-6-core-12-thread-am4-ddr4-processor','AMD Ryzen 5 2600X 6-Core 12-Thread AM4 DDR4 Processor',replace('<h2>AMD Ryzen 5 2600X Processor Price in Pakistan</h2><p>The AMD Ryzen 5 2600X is a 6-core, 12-thread desktop processor for compatible AM4 systems. It offers a 3.6 GHz base clock and up to 4.2 GHz boost for gaming, multitasking and everyday productivity when paired with a suitable graphics card.</p><h3>Specifications</h3><ul>\n<li>6 CPU cores and 12 threads</li>\n<li>3.6 GHz base clock; up to 4.2 GHz boost</li>\n<li>Pinnacle Ridge, 12nm architecture</li>\n<li>AM4 CPU socket</li>\n<li>16MB L3 and 3MB L2 cache</li>\n<li>95W default TDP</li>\n<li>Dual-channel DDR4 support, up to 2933 MT/s official memory specification</li>\n<li>PCIe 3.0</li>\n<li>Unlocked multiplier; overclocking requires a compatible motherboard and cooling</li>\n<li>No integrated graphics: dedicated graphics card required</li>\n</ul><h3>Compatibility and Cooling</h3><p>Check your exact motherboard CPU support list and required BIOS version before ordering. AM4 socket alone does not guarantee support. Use compatible DDR4 memory and an AM4 cooler suitable for this 95W processor.</p><h3>Frequently Asked Questions</h3><h4>Does the Ryzen 5 2600X need a graphics card?</h4><p>Yes. It has no integrated graphics, so a dedicated graphics card is required for display output.</p><h4>Is it compatible with every AM4 motherboard?</h4><p>No. Verify the exact motherboard model, revision and BIOS CPU support list.</p><h4>Does it support DDR5?</h4><p>No. This processor uses DDR4 memory.</p><h4>Are a cooler and retail box included?</h4><p>Confirm included accessories and packaging with SakoonSay Gaming Store before ordering.</p><p>Matching-model reference photograph shown without box; actual CPU markings may vary. Confirm item condition with the store before purchase.</p>','\n',char(10)),13000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/amd-ryzen-5-2600x-processor-without-box.jpg?v=1791971874','https://sakoonsay.com/products/amd-ryzen-5-2600x-6-core-12-thread-am4-ddr4-processor.js','AMD Processor',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:02:34');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(14443,'15412324728885','gigabyte-b450m-gaming-am4-ddr4-micro-atx-motherboard','GIGABYTE B450M GAMING AM4 DDR4 Micro-ATX Motherboard',replace('<h2>GIGABYTE B450M GAMING Motherboard Price in Pakistan</h2><p>Build a compatible AMD gaming or everyday desktop with the GIGABYTE B450M GAMING AM4 Micro-ATX motherboard. Its B450 platform offers dual-channel DDR4 memory, PCIe graphics expansion and M.2 storage.</p><h3>Specifications</h3><ul>\n<li>AMD B450 chipset; AM4 CPU socket</li>\n<li>2 DDR4 DIMM slots; up to 64GB memory</li>\n<li>DDR4 speeds up to 3600 MHz (OC), subject to CPU, RAM and BIOS</li>\n<li>1 PCIe 3.0 x16 graphics slot and 2 PCIe 2.0 x1 slots</li>\n<li>1 M.2 socket for 2242/2260/2280 SATA and PCIe SSDs; mode depends on CPU</li>\n<li>4 SATA 6Gb/s ports</li>\n<li>HDMI, DVI-D and VGA display outputs with a compatible processor featuring integrated graphics</li>\n<li>Gigabit Ethernet and Realtek HD audio</li>\n<li>Micro-ATX form factor</li>\n<li>24-pin ATX and 8-pin CPU power connectors</li>\n</ul><h3>CPU and BIOS Compatibility</h3><p>GIGABYTE lists support for compatible Ryzen 5000, 5000G and earlier AM4 processors with the required BIOS. Verify the exact CPU, board revision and BIOS version using the manufacturer CPU support list before purchase.</p><h3>Frequently Asked Questions</h3><h4>Does it support Ryzen 5000?</h4><p>Supported models require the appropriate BIOS. Confirm your exact CPU against GIGABYTE''s support list.</p><h4>Can I use DDR3 or DDR5?</h4><p>No. This motherboard uses DDR4 desktop RAM.</p><h4>Can I install an NVMe SSD?</h4><p>Yes, the M.2 slot supports PCIe storage with compatible CPUs. Some processors restrict M.2 operation to SATA mode.</p><h4>Will the display ports work without a graphics card?</h4><p>Only with a supported processor that has integrated graphics. CPUs without integrated graphics require a dedicated GPU.</p><p>Official manufacturer reference image shown without box. Confirm stock condition and included accessories with SakoonSay Gaming Store before ordering.</p>','\n',char(10)),17000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/gigabyte-b450m-gaming-without-box.png?v=1791969182','https://sakoonsay.com/products/gigabyte-b450m-gaming-am4-ddr4-micro-atx-motherboard.js','AMD Motherboard',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:02:34');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(14444,'15412304609333','asus-prime-a320m-k-am4-amd-a320-ddr4-micro-atx-motherboard','ASUS PRIME A320M-K AM4 AMD A320 DDR4 Micro-ATX Motherboard',replace('<h2>ASUS PRIME A320M-K Motherboard Price in Pakistan</h2><p>The ASUS PRIME A320M-K is a Micro-ATX motherboard with AMD A320 chipset, AM4 socket and dual-channel DDR4 memory support for a compatible AMD desktop build.</p><h3>Specifications</h3><ul>\n<li>AMD AM4 socket and A320 chipset</li>\n<li>2 DDR4 DIMM slots; up to 32GB memory according to ASUS specifications</li>\n<li>Memory speeds up to DDR4-3200 (OC), depending on processor and RAM</li>\n<li>1 PCIe x16 slot and 2 PCIe 2.0 x1 slots</li>\n<li>1 M.2 socket for 2242/2260/2280 SSDs; SATA and PCIe 3.0 x4 support depends on CPU</li>\n<li>4 SATA 6Gb/s connectors</li>\n<li>HDMI and VGA display outputs, requiring a processor with integrated graphics</li>\n<li>Gigabit Ethernet and Realtek ALC887 audio</li>\n<li>Micro-ATX size: 22.6 × 22.1 cm</li>\n</ul><h3>Compatibility</h3><p>Check the exact CPU against the ASUS CPU support list and required BIOS version before ordering. AM4 socket alone does not guarantee compatibility. This motherboard uses desktop DDR4 RAM. Confirm case fit, power supply connectors and GPU clearance.</p><h3>Frequently Asked Questions</h3><h4>Can I use DDR3 or DDR5 RAM?</h4><p>No, this board requires compatible DDR4 desktop memory.</p><h4>Does it support an NVMe SSD?</h4><p>Its M.2 slot supports PCIe 3.0 x4 storage with supported processors. M.2 capabilities depend on the installed CPU; check ASUS specifications for your configuration.</p><h4>Do HDMI and VGA work without a graphics card?</h4><p>Only when the installed processor has supported integrated graphics. Otherwise, install a dedicated graphics card.</p><h4>Is every Ryzen CPU supported?</h4><p>No. Check the exact model and BIOS requirement on the ASUS support page.</p><p>Manufacturer reference image shown. Confirm item condition and included accessories with SakoonSay Gaming Store before ordering.</p>','\n',char(10)),13500,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/asus-prime-a320m-k-without-box.png?v=1791968654','https://sakoonsay.com/products/asus-prime-a320m-k-am4-amd-a320-ddr4-micro-atx-motherboard.js','AMD Motherboard',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:02:34');
INSERT INTO "products" ("id","source_id","handle","title","description","price_pkr","compare_at_pkr","available","image_url","source_url","category","sourcing_enabled","priority","min_margin_pct","condition_rule","updated_at") VALUES(14447,'15413481832501','asus-prime-geforce-rtx-5060-oc-8gb-gddr7-without-box','ASUS PRIME GeForce RTX 5060 OC 8GB GDDR7 — Without Box',replace('<h2>ASUS PRIME RTX 5060 OC 8GB GDDR7</h2><p>Model PRIME-RTX5060-O8G combines NVIDIA Blackwell graphics with a triple-fan Axial-tech cooler for gaming and creative workloads. Available from SakoonSay Gaming Store in Pakistan, without a retail box. Images are manufacturer reference views.</p><h3>Specifications</h3><ul>\n<li>GPU: GeForce RTX 5060; 3,840 CUDA cores</li>\n<li>Memory: 8GB GDDR7, 128-bit, 28 Gbps</li>\n<li>Boost: 2,565 MHz default; 2,595 MHz OC mode</li>\n<li>Bus standard: PCI Express 5.0</li>\n<li>Outputs: 3 × DisplayPort 2.1b and 1 × HDMI 2.1b</li>\n<li>Maximum displays: 4</li>\n<li>Dimensions: 268.3 × 120 × 50 mm; 2.5-slot design</li>\n<li>Power: 1 × 8-pin PCIe connector; recommended PSU 550W</li>\n<li>Dual BIOS, vented backplate and 0dB fan-stop technology</li>\n<li>DLSS 4 support in compatible games</li>\n</ul><h3>Frequently asked questions</h3><p><strong>Does it include a retail box?</strong><br>No, this listing is without a box.</p><p><strong>Which power supply is recommended?</strong><br>ASUS recommends 550W with one 8-pin PCIe connector. Total system requirements may vary.</p><p><strong>Will it fit my case?</strong><br>Check clearance for its 268.3 mm length and 2.5-slot thickness.</p><p><strong>Is this the OC edition?</strong><br>Yes. The supplied model label reads PRIME-RTX5060-O8G.</p>','\n',char(10)),125000,NULL,0,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/asus-prime-rtx5060-o8g-front.png?v=1792044584','https://sakoonsay.com/products/asus-prime-geforce-rtx-5060-oc-8gb-gddr7-without-box.js','Graphics Cards',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:02:31');
