al-fan design. Actual stock appearance may vary. Retail packaging is not included.</small></p><p><a href="/collections/graphics-cards">Browse graphics cards</a> or <a href="/collections/nvidia-gpus">compare NVIDIA GPUs</a>.</p>','\n',char(10)),67000,NULL,1,'//cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0647/5196/0117/files/manli-rtx2060-12gb-original-front.png?v=1792170022','https://sakoonsay.com/products/manli-geforce-rtx-2060-12gb-gddr6-dual-fan-without-box.js','Graphics Cards',1,'normal',20,'used,refurbished,new','2026-10-22 08:02:28');
